<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">- Ngulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Sigilizi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabu che Zisigilizi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zisigilizi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Zisig</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitabu che Zisigilizi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Zisig</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOELO</para>
  <para style="ip">Zisigilizi ni mauiyo ye zisigilizi zimwe vitabu vishano ve ndagano ya kale. Kwa Kiibulania dizina dye Kitabu iki nuko kugamba, “Mbuli.” Yahuilwa kugamba Musa niye awandikaga kitabu iki, mna hawandikaga kitabu chose mpaka uko kukulongwa ukubanika kwakwe. Kitabu chakonga kwa kugamba, “Izi nizo zimbuli Mua awagambilaga Waizilaeli wose.” Fanyanyi ya kugamba Musa niye awandikaga Titabu iki che Zisigiizi yalongwa nk'hanana nyingi mwe Ndagano Imp'hya, enga via mwe Kitabu che Mitendele ya wegala Ulosi mwo mnango wa katatu na msitali wa milongo miidi na miidi, mpaka milongo miidi na mitatu aho Petulo auiyaga Zisigilizi na mwo mnanago wa mnane msitali wa mlongo wa shano mpaka msitali wa mlongo na mnane, naho alongaga kugamba izo zandaga mbuli za Musa. Vadahika kugamba Musa awandikaga vitabu enga via, Kitabu che Zisigilizi, na Kitabu cho Ukulawa na Kitabu cha Mbuli za Walawi ne Kitabu co Uwazilo ivo aviwandikaga mwe miaka alufu na magana matatu hegu alufu na magana mane umwo Umwo Kilisito andaga akei kwelekwa. Kitabu che zisigilizi chawandikwagwa kunda mwiivano wa seuta na Useuta mtuhu, mwiivano uwo wakakimailwa ni uyo seuta enga ivo vandaga aho kale. Uno wandaga ni Mwiivano wa Mnungu na want'hu wa Izilaeli. Mnungu azumilaga kuwavikila want'hu wakwe wa Izilaeli uneva wanatimila imiko yakwe, mna uneva hawanatimile nevinda wasulumizwe. Na iki nicho kikulongwa mwe Kitabu chose. Mna mwe milango ya milongo miidi na mfungate na milongo miidi na mnane aho chalongesa kwa kuwandika ludongo lwa uvikilwa na maligito, naho kwa kuyatambula ayo yadahikaga kulaila kwa waizilaeli kwa kutimila hegu kwa kuleka kutimila Zisigilizi za Mnungu. Mkabila yehengi ya Wazilaeli yakimalaga mwe milima ihengi umwo wandaga yakalava uvikilwa hegu maligito kwa kilayumwenga, naho kwa izwi kulu kwa kulagisa Indagano. Ayo ye mndani 1 Mwo mnango wa kaidi kuita mnango wa katatu, Musa alonga ayo yalailaga umwo Waizilaeli wandaga wakatamba mwe nyika. 2 Kikulongwa mwo mnango wa kane kuita mnango wa milongo miidi na mandatu ni yadya yakuungwa mwa maivano ya Mnungu na want'hu wakwe. 3 Mwo mnango wa milongo miidi na mfungate kuita milongo mitatu, Waizilaeli walonga uvikilwa na maligito naho kwa izwi kulu vikulagisa kugamba Indagano iyo ni ya kindedi. 4 Kwo uheelo, mwe milango ya milongo mitatu na umwenga kuita milongo mitatu na mine, musa alonga mbuli zimwenga zo mzigilizo kwa Yoshua na kwa kila kabila dya Waizilaeli umwo andile akei kubanika.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DEU 1" />
  <para style="s">Utambalisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 1:1" />Mwe kitabu iki numo zili zimbuli izo Musa alongaga na want'hu wa Izilaeli umwo wandaga mwe dijangwa ulailo wa zuwa wo mto Yolodani. Wandaga mwe Dikolongo dya Yolodani hagihi na Safu, hagati yo mzi wa Palani nt'hendelo imwenga ne mizi ya Tofeli na Labani na Hezoloti na Dizahabu kwe nt'hendelo int'huhu. <verse eid="DEU 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 1:2" />Ni lugendo lwa zuwa dimwenga kulawa kwo mnima Holebu uwo ukwitangwa Sinai mpaka Kadeshi-banea kwombokela mwe isi ya vigulu va Seili. <verse eid="DEU 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 1:3" />Mwo mwaka wa milongo mine, mwe dizuwa dya nk'hongo mwo mwezi wa mlongo na umwenga, aho weze walawe Misili, Musa awagambilaga ayo agambilalagwa ni Zumbe awagambile Waizilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 1:4" />Ayo yalailaga aho Musa eze amhume Sihoni seuta ywa Waamoli na awo wekalaga mwo mzi Heshi-boni no kumhuma Ogu seuta ywa Bashani uyo ailongozaga mizi ya Ashitaloti na Adulei. <verse eid="DEU 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 1:5" />Umwo want'hu wandaga ulailo wa zuwa wo mto Yolidani mwe isi ya Moabu, Musa akongaga naho kutambalisa Imiko.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 1:5">Akagamba, <verse eid="DEU 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 1:6" />“Umwo chandaga kudya kwo mnima Helobu Zumbe Mnungu ywetu akigambaga, ‘Mwikalisa elo mwo mnima uno, <verse eid="DEU 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 1:7" />kongeni utafi msogele kulongole mwe isi ye vigulu ya Waamoli, mwiite kwe zi isi zose zi mgihi mwe dikolongo dya Yolodani mwe isi ye vigulu na mwe isi ze nt'hindiga, na nt'hendelo ya Kwa mwenye mzi na mp'hwani ye Bahali ya Meditelania. Mwiite kwe isi ya Wakanaani na kujink'ha milima ya Lebanoni mpaka kwo mto mkulu wa Efulati. <verse eid="DEU 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 1:8" />Kauleni isi ino yose hiwenk'hani nyuwe, isi iyo niyo miye Zumbe naikilaga kilapi cha kuwenk'ha wakale wenyu awo Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo ne vyeleko vawe. Haluse iteni mkaitahe.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa awasagula Walamuzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 1:9" />Musa awagambaga want'hu, “Umwo chandaga mwo mnima Sinai nawagambagani, ‘Ndima ino ya kuwalongozani nyuwe ndala. Hikuidaha miye nikedu. <verse eid="DEU 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 1:10" />Zumbe Mnungu ywetu kawenk'hani cheleko, ivo dielo mgenyelesa enga nt'hondo za mwo ulanga. <verse eid="DEU 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 1:11" />Zumbe Mnungu ywa wakale wenyu awagenyezeni vitendese no kuwavikila enga ivo awaikilaga kilapi wakale wenyu. <verse eid="DEU 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 1:12" />Mna miye nikedu nenidahe vivihi kubinda nk'halalizi zenyu? <verse eid="DEU 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 1:13" />Saguleni want'hu wana mizungu naho wabala naho wakuzumilwa kulawa mwe kila kabila dyenyu, name neniwatende vilongozi wenyu.’ ” <verse eid="DEU 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 1:14" />Nanywe mwanigambaga, “Icho ufanyanye ni kint'hu chedi cho kudamanya.” <verse eid="DEU 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 1:15" />Elo, naguhaga vilongozi mwa makabila yenyu, want'hu wata mizungu naho wabala na wakuzumilwa kulawa mwe makabila yenyu. Want'hu awa waikagwa kunda vilongozi wakulu wa watowani kwenyu mwa want'hu maalufu na vilongozi wa want'hu magana na vilongozi wa want'hu milongo mishano na vilongozi wa want'hu milongo. Naho nehisagula wakimalizi wa makabila.<verse eid="DEU 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 1:16" />“Mwo lupisi ludya nawenk'haga walamuzi wenyu sigilizi izi kugamba, ‘Tegelezeni mahigano mwa wandugu zenyu naho mlamule haheina kwazagula, ikanda ni mwa waizilaeli wandugu hegu watakwiza wakwikala mwenyu. <verse eid="DEU 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 1:17" />Msekwazagula mwo kulamula kwenyu msengeleni kila mnt'hu mwo usengeelo uwo haheina kukaula ivo eli. Msekogoha mnt'hu yeyose kwaviya ulamuzi mkudamanya walawa kwa Mnungu. Uneva masa yatendesa madala naho hamkudaha kulamula, nigaileni miye nenilamule.’ ” <verse eid="DEU 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 1:18" />Mwo lupisi uludya nehiwagambilani kila kint'hu nomkaungwa kudamanya.<verse eid="DEU 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wapelembi watumwa kulawa Kadesh-banea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 1:19" />“Nekitenda enga ivo Mnungu ywetu akigambile. Chahalawaga ho mnima wa Helobu kuhinga kwe isi ye vigulu va Waamoli kwombokela mwe isi ina kutisa kwi hengi mwe dijangwa, niyo chabula Kadeshi banea. <verse eid="DEU 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 1:20" />Name niyo nawagambagani, ‘Mbula mwe isi ya vigulu umwo wakwikala Waamoli, iyo Zumbe Mnungu ywetu akukink'ha. <verse eid="DEU 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 1:21" />Kauleni, Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu kawenk'hani isi. Iteni mkaitahe vilagane na ivo asigiile Zumbe Mnungu ywa wakale wenyu. Mse kogoha naho msekukink'hila.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 1:22" />“Mna nomwiza kwangu niyo mwanigamba, ‘Goja kigale wapelembi wakaipelembe isi vileke wakakigambile sila iyedi yo kombokela na kukigambila ivo ili imizi ya uko.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 1:23" />“Mbuli iyo niyo yanelela, ivo nasagulaga wagosi mlongo na waidi, yumwenga kulawa mwe kila kabila. <verse eid="DEU 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 1:24" />Waitaga mpaka kwe isi ye vigulu no mpaka kwe nt'hindiga ya Eshikoli niyo waipelemba. <verse eid="DEU 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 1:25" />Wanonolaga matunda ye isi idya niyo wakigaila ulosi naho wakigamba isi akukink'ha Zumbe Mnungu ni yedi.”<verse eid="DEU 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 1:26" />“Mna hamwazumila kukwela uko, mwasagukaga mwe sigilizi iyo ya Zumbe Mnungu , naivo hamwadahaga kwingila mwe iyo isi. <verse eid="DEU 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 1:27" />Msigala mwa mahema yenyu niyo mwakalaliza mkagamba, ‘Zumbe kakiihiya. Kakilava mwe isi ya Misili vileke akink'hize kwa Waamoli na kwa sila ino akikome pele. <verse eid="DEU 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 1:28" />Chogohaga! Uko chabasai? Wadya chawatumaga wakigamba mazint'hu ya uko matali naho yana ludole kujink'ha suwe naho yekala mwe mizi ina magomela yakubula kwo ulanga. Naho wayaonaga amazint'hu ayo uko!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 1:29" />“Mna miye nawagambagani, ‘Msekuyogoha mazint'hu ayo naho msekwingila chevu. <verse eid="DEU 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 1:30" />Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu mkumvika naawalongozeni, naho naawatowanileni, enga ivo mwaonaga ukwo Misili, <verse eid="DEU 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 1:31" />na ivo atendaga kwe dijangwa. Mwaonaga ivo awaguhagani mwo utafi wenyu wose mpaka mbula mwe isi ino, enga tati ya mnt'hu ivo akudaha akumguha mwanawe.’ ” <verse eid="DEU 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 1:32" />Mna hamwenga na ayo yose adamanye hamumhuile Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu <verse eid="DEU 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 1:33" />awalongoele mwo utafi, nekilo kwa mkola wa moto kuwalagisa sila mkuunga mwombokele, nomsi kwa idyo divunde, vileke awazunguile hant'hu ho kukima mahema yenyu.<verse eid="DEU 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zumbe awasulumiza Waizilaeli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 1:34" />“Zumbe evaga zink'halalizi zenyu niyo afa maya. Akelisaga akagamba, <verse eid="DEU 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 1:35" />‘Mwe cheleko iki cho uwihi hahali yeyose neengile mwe isi iyedi iyo nakelisaga kuwenk'ha wakale wenyu. <verse eid="DEU 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 1:36" />Ni kalebi mwana Yefune du neengile mwe isi iyo. Yehe kanda mhuwilwa kwangu, name nenimwink'he yehe ne vyeleko vakwe isi iyo aipelembe.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 1:37" />Naho Zumbe nakanifiila maya kwajili yenyu niyo anigamba, ‘Weye nawe iviyaiviya howingile mwe isi iyo. <verse eid="DEU 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 1:38" />Mna mwambizi ywako Yoshua mwana Nuni niye neengile umo. Mna umgele moyo yehe niye naawalongoze Waizilaeli mwo kuitaha isi iyo.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 1:39" />“Naho Zumbe akigambaga suwe chose, ‘Wana wenyu wadodo heewekudaha kwazagula ayedi na yaihile nawo nawengile mwe isi, awadya nomkagamba nawatahigwe ni wank'hondo wenyu. Neni ink'hize isi kwawe naho neinde ukipe wawe. <verse eid="DEU 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 1:40" />Mna nyuwe hitukeni muuye kwedijangwa kuhinga kwe Bahali ya Shamu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 1:41" />“Akajika mwanigambaga, ‘Suwe kidamanya wavu kwa Zumbe Mnungu mna haluse nekiite kwe nk'hondo enga ivo Zumbe Mnungu ywetu ivo akisigiile.’ ” Niyo kila yumwenga ywenyu akeika lumwe kwa nk'hondo mkafanyanya kugamba nevinde vihufu kuitaha isi ye vigulu.<verse eid="DEU 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 1:42" />“Mna Zumbe anigambaga, ‘Wakanye wasekugenda kutowana kwaviya miye heninde hamwenga nawo, nawahumwe ni wank'hondo wawe <verse eid="DEU 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 1:43" />Nawagambilagani ivo Zumbe alongaga, mna hamwivile. Kwa kukeduvya kwenyu nomsaguka na kukwela kwe isi ye vigulu. <verse eid="DEU 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 1:44" />Ivo Waamoli wandaga wakekala mwe isi ye vigulu waweziilagani enga matuluma ya nyuki wakawahiga. Wawakulumbuzani niyo wawatowani uko Homa mwe isi ya Seili mpaka Halimahi. <verse eid="DEU 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 1:45" />Ivo mwamwiilaga Zumbe awambizeni, mna hawategelezeni naho awaonagani hi kint'hu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waizilaeli wangadika uko Kadeshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 1:46" />“Naivo elo mwekalaga Kadeshi kwa lupisi lutali.”<verse eid="DEU 1:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DEU 2" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 2:1" />Niho chahitukaga niyo chakonga kuita kuhinga kwe dijangwa kwe Bahali ya Shamu enga ivo Zumbe anisiigile. Utafi wetu waguhaga lupisi lutali kwa kwangadika mwe isi ya vigulu ya Seili.<verse eid="DEU 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 2:2" />“Niyo Zumbe anigamba, <verse eid="DEU 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 2:3" />changadikisa mwe isi ino, haluse kihinge mkoma mahanya. <verse eid="DEU 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 2:4" />Haluse wagambe want'hu awo ivi, ‘Mwihagihi na komboka mwe isi ya wandugu zenyu awo welekwa wa Esau awo wakwikala Seili. Nawande wamwogohani ivo mkaulise. <verse eid="DEU 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 2:5" />Mse kuawasogola vileke mkonge nk'hondo nawo, kwaviya heniwenk'heni hant'hu hohose mwe isi yawe, hata hant'hu ha kujata na lwayo. Hiwenk'ha welekw wa Esau isi ye vigulu ya Seili inde yawe. <verse eid="DEU 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 2:6" />Nomgule nk'hande na mazi yo kunywa kwawe.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 2:7" />“Zumbe Mnungu mkumvika kawavikilani mwe zindima zenyu zose mkudamanya. Kamanya icho kiwalaileni mwe dijangwa idi dikulise mwe miyaka ino milongo mine. Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu mkumvika kanda hamwenga na nyuwe haheina kuhungukilwa chochose.”<verse eid="DEU 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 2:8" />“Naivo elo chombokelaga kunk'handa mwa wandugu zetu welekwa wa Esau wakwikala Seili. Chahitukaga kulawa kwe sila ya Alaba ikulawa Elati na Ezioni-gibeli niyo chagenda kombokela mwe sila ya mwe dijangwa dya Moabu. <verse eid="DEU 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 2:9" />Zumbe anigambaga, ‘Msekuwagela nk'huswank'huswa hegu kukonga nk'hondo na want'hu wa Moabu awo welekwa wa Loti. Kwaviya kawenk'ha wana wa Loti mzi wa Ali unde wawe naho haakink'e suwe hohose mwe isi yawe.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 2:10" />Aho kale mzi wa Ali wekalagwa ni mazint'hu makulu yetangagwa Maemimu, yendaga matali enga Waanaki. <verse eid="DEU 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 2:11" />Waaemi na Waanaki wose kwa hamwenga wamanyika enga waalefai. Mna Wamoabu wawetanga Waaemi. <verse eid="DEU 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 2:12" />Iviyaiviya aho kale Waamoli wekalaga uko Seili, mna welekwa wa Esau wawagulusaga na kuwakoma pele no kuiguha isi yawe enga ivo Waizilaeli watendaga mwe isi idya Zumbe awenk'haga inde kipe chawe.<verse eid="DEU 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 2:13" />“Zumbe akigambaga chomboke dikolongo dya Zeledi. Ivo niyo chadyomboka idikolongo idyo. <verse eid="DEU 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 2:14" />Yombokaga miaka milongo mitatu na mnane kulawa mwo lupisi ludya chombokaga Kadeshi Banea. Watowani wose we cheleko kiya wandaga wabanika enga ivo Zumbe awaikilaga kilapi. <verse eid="DEU 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 2:15" />Zumbe agendeelaga kuwahiga mpaka aho awakomaga wose.”<verse eid="DEU 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 2:16" />“Elo welekwa wose weze wabanike pele, <verse eid="DEU 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 2:17" />Zumbe Mnungu anigambaga, <verse eid="DEU 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 2:18" />‘Dielo nomwomboke mihaka ya Moabu kwombokela isi ya Ali. <verse eid="DEU 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 2:19" />Mkeza mpaka mwe mihaka ye isi ya wana Amoni welekwa wa Loti, mse kuwagela nk'huswank'huswa hegu kuwatowa nk'hondo kwaviya heniwenk'heni hohose mwe isi idya niwenk'hile woho, kwaviya hiwenk'ha wana Loti isi iyo.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 2:20" />Isi iyo iviyaiviya yamanyikaga kunda ni isi ya Walefai, zina dya want'hu wekalaga mwei isi iyo, Waamoli wawetangaga Wazamimu. <verse eid="DEU 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 2:21" />Wandaga watali enga Waanaki wabindile ingi naho wata ludole, mna Zumbe awakomaga wose, niho Waamoni waguhaga isi yawe no kwikala umo. <verse eid="DEU 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 2:22" />Zumbe kawadamanyila aayo Waedomu welekwa wa Esau awo wakwikala mwe isi ya Edomu. Awakomaga pele Waaholi, kwaivo Waedomu waiguhaga isi yawe na kwikala umo mpaka ivi haluse. <verse eid="DEU 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 2:23" />Naho kwandaga na Waavi wekalaga mwe zikaya mnk'handa mwe Meditelania mpaka Gaza. Naho Wakafitoli kulawa mwe kisiwa cha Kilete. Awo nawo wawakoma pele Waavi awo wekala mwe isi iyo niyo waiguha isi yawe yose mpaka mwo mzi wa Gaza.<verse eid="DEU 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 2:24" />“Kize chombokele Moabu, Zumbe akigambaga, ‘Haluse kongeni utafi. mwomboke mto Anoni. Hiwenk'hani udahi wa kumuhuma Sioni seuta ywa Waamoli ywa Heshiboni niyo mwaitaha isi yakwe. <verse eid="DEU 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 2:25" />Neniwatende want'hu wose mwe isi wawogoheni na kunda na lukeng'ent'ha umwo wakeva dizina dyenyu dikatambulwa.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Izilaeli wamhuma seuta ywa Sihoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 2:26" />“Naivo elo nasigiilaga want'hu kulawa aha Kademosi waite kwa Sihoni seuta ywa Heshiboni wegale ulosi uno wo utondowazi. <verse eid="DEU 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 2:27" />‘Kilekele chombokele mwe isi yako. Nechomboke mwe sila haheina kuhinga kulume hegu kumoso. <verse eid="DEU 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 2:28" />Nk'hande na mazi nekigule kwako. Chalombeza kint'hu kimwenga du kwako, ukilekele chomboke lwa viga mwe isi yako, <verse eid="DEU 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 2:29" />mpaka aho nechomoke mto Yolodani kingile mwe isi idya Zumbe Mnungu ywetu akukin'ha. Welekwa wa Edomu wakwikala Seili na Wamoabi wakwikala Ali wakilekelaga niyo chomboka mwe isi yawe.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 2:30" />“Mna Sihoni seuta ywa Heshiboni hakilekele chomboke mwe isi yakwe. Zumbe Mnungu ywetu uyo amtendaga ande mnk'hani na kusaguka vileke kimhume na kuitaha isi yakwe iyo kikwikala mpaka ivi haluse.”<verse eid="DEU 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 2:31" />“Zumbe Mnungu niyo anigamba, ‘Kaula himtenda seuta ywa Sihoni na want'hu wakwe kunda wasokezi kwenyu, itaheni isi yakwe inde yenyu.’ ” <verse eid="DEU 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 2:32" />Ivo Sihoni seuta ezaga na watoani wakwe vileke atoane na suwe hagihi no mzi wa Yahazi. <verse eid="DEU 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 2:33" />Zumbe Mnungu ywetu uyo amwiikaga mwo udahi wetu niyo chamkoma yehe na wanawe na want'hu wakwe wose. <verse eid="DEU 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 2:34" />Chaitahaga na kuibananga mizi yakwe yose na kuwakoma want'hu wakwe wagosi kwa wavele na wana. Hachalekile yeyose kunda mgima. <verse eid="DEU 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 2:35" />Nekitaha mifugwa no ugoli wose wandaga mwe mizi. <verse eid="DEU 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 2:36" />Zumbe Mnungu uyo akitendaga kuitaha mizi yose. Kungongela Aloeli mwo lwega lwe dikolongo dya Alinoni no mzi uhagati he dikolongo mpaka Gileadi. Hakwandaga na mzi wowose wandaga na gomela tali naho ditogile chadundugaga kudimola. <verse eid="DEU 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 2:37" />Mna hachadahile kuisogeela isi ya Waamoni hegu mwo lwega lwo mto Yabokihegu mwe mizi ye isi ye vigulu hegu hant'hu hohose hadya kilemezwe ni Zumbe Mnungu ywetu uyo kakigamba kisekuita.<verse eid="DEU 2:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DEU 3" />
  <para style="s">Waizilaeli wamhuma seuta Ogu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 3:1" />“Akajika chahitukaga niyo chakwela ne sila ikuhinga Bashani. Seuta Ogu ywa Bashani na watowani wakwe wose wakiziilaga vileke wakitowe nk'hondo hagihi no mzi wa Edulei. <verse eid="DEU 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 3:2" />Mna Zumbe anigambaga, ‘Use kumwogoha kwaviya hiwenk'hani udahi wa kumhuma na want'hu wakwe na kuitaha isi yakwe. Umtendele enga ivo utendile kwa seuta Sihoni ywa Waamoli uyo ekalaga Heshiboni.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 3:3" />“Elo, Zumbe Mnungu ywetu uyo akink'haga udahi wa kumuhuma seuta Ogu ywa Bashani na wank'hondo wakwe. Ivo chawakomaga wose pele haheina kusigaza mnt'hu yeyose. <verse eid="DEU 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 3:4" />Chaitahaga mizi yakwe yose, hakwandaga na mzi wowose chadundugaga kuutaha. Chatahaga mizi ibuile milongo mtandatu, nuko kugamba ni isi yose yalongozagwa ni Ogu seuta ywa Bashani. <verse eid="DEU 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 3:5" />Mizi iyo yose yandaga na magomela matali yandaga na nk'hili zina madanga hamwenga kaya zibindile ingi hezendaga na magomela . <verse eid="DEU 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 3:6" />Kila kint'hu na kila mzi chavibanangaga pele niyo chawakoma wagosi na wavele na wana enga ivo chatendile kwe mizi ya seuta Sihoni ywa Heshiboni. <verse eid="DEU 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 3:7" />Mna mifugwa yose no ugoli wose chavitahaga vinde vetu.”<verse eid="DEU 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 3:8" />“Ivo mwo lupisi ulo, chatahaga isi iyo ya maseuta awo waidi wa Waamoli, nt'hendelo ya ulailo wa zuwa yo mto Yolodani, kulawa kwo mto Anoni mpaka kwo Mnima Helimoni. <verse eid="DEU 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 3:9" />Mnima Helimoni want'hu wa Sidoni wawitangaga Silioni, Waamoli nawo wawitanga Senili. <verse eid="DEU 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 3:10" />Chatahaga mizi yose imwe nt'hindiga mwa magundi na si yose ya Geleadi na Bashamu yose mpaka Saleka na isi ya Adulei mizi ya seuta Ogu wa Bashani.”<verse eid="DEU 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 3:11" />Seuta Ogu niye asigalaga du mwa Walefai. Jeneza dyakwe dyadamanyagwa dya kilama na maiwe. Dyandaga na utali wa mp'hima mtandatu, uzangalamu wakwe nawo mp'hima nt'hatu. Jeneza idyi dikei diuko komzi ukwitangwa Laba, umzi wa Waamoni.<verse eid="DEU 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makabila yakwikala mwo ulailo wa zuwa wo mto Yolodani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 3:12" />“Kize kitahe isi iyo naink'hizaga kwa makabila ya Lubeni na Gadi kwe nt'hendelo ya mkoma mahanya mwa Aloeli hagihi na mzi wa Aloeli hagihi ne dikolongo dya Alinoni ikanda ni hamwenga ne nt'hendelo imwenga ye isi ye vigulu ya Geleadi hamwenga ne mizi yakwe. <verse eid="DEU 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 3:13" />Nte'hendelo isigale ya isi ya Gileadi na Isi yose ya Bashani, uwo useuta wa Ogu, nehiwenk'ha idihinde dye dikabila dya Manase. Isi yose ya Agabo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 3:13">(Bashani yamanyikaga kunda ni isi ya Walefeimu. <verse eid="DEU 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 3:14" />Mnt'hu yumwenga ywa kabila dya Manase akwitangwa Yeli aguhaga isi yose ya Agabo iyo ikwitangwa Bashani mpaka kwe mihaka ya Geshuli na Maaka. Vikaya vose avink'haga dizina dyakwe. Ivo mpaka ivi dielo vetangwa vikaya va Yaili.)<verse eid="DEU 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 3:15" />“Isi ya Gileadi nehiwenk'ha lukolo lwa Makili lwe dikabila dya Manase. <verse eid="DEU 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 3:16" />Want'hu wa makabila dya Lubeni na Gadi woho nawenk'haga isi yose kulawa Gileadi mpaka kwo mto wa Anoni. Mhaka wawe wa Kwa mwenye mzi wandaga nu mto Anoni, mhaka wa mkoma mahanya nawo wandaga nu mto Yaboki uwo ukuhakana ne isi ya Waamoli. <verse eid="DEU 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 3:17" />Ko usweelo wa zuwa isi iyo yenelaga mpaka kwo mto Yolodani, kulawa kwe diziwa dya Galilaya kwe nt'hendelo ya mkoma mahanya yaseelaga mpaka kwe bahali ya Alaba iyo ikwitangwa Bahali yo Munyu mpaka kwe ziseleza za Pisiga kwe nt'hendelo ya Ulailo wa zuwa.”<verse eid="DEU 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 3:18" />“Mwo lupisi uludya nawa sigiilagani ivi, ‘Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu kawenk'hani isi ino ulailo wa zuwa wo mto Yolodani inde yenyu. Haluse wagosi wose wadahi we nk'hondo wakekake vitowanilo mwomboke mto Yolodani, muwalongoele wandugu zenyu Waizilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 3:19" />Mna wavele wenyu na wana wenyu ne mifugwa yenyu, himanya kugamba mnanayo mifugwa ibindile ingi, awo nawasigale kwe mizi niwenk'hileni. <verse eid="DEU 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 3:20" />Wambizeni wandugu zenyu Waizilaeli mpaka Zumbe awenk'he kutondowala mwe isi yawe enga ivo nyuwe naywe mtondowale. Nuko kugamba woho nawo waikaile isi yawe iyo wakwink'higwa ni Zumbe Mnungu uyo kikuvika uko kwe nt'hendelo int'huhu yo mto Yolodani. Yakajika ayo nomuuye kwe isi yenyu ino niwenk'hileni inde yenyu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 3:21" />“Naho namsigiilaga Joshua ivi, ‘Kuyaona mwenye ayo yose Zumbe Mnungu naawambize kuwakoma pele wadya maseuta waidi, uyo Sihoni na Ogu. Ivi nivo Zumbe naawatende kwe ziisi zose mkugenda kuzitaha. <verse eid="DEU 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 3:22" />Mse kuwogoha kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu naawatowanileni.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa halekelwe kwingila Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 3:23" />“Mwo lupisi ludya namlombezesaga Zumbe hamgamba, <verse eid="DEU 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 3:24" />‘Zumbe Mnungu, kunda kunilagisa miye mndima ywako ukulu wako na udahi wako. Hakuli mnungu yeyose kwe mbingu hegu he isi akudaha kudamanya vint'hu vikulu vikweheela enga ivo udamanye weye! <verse eid="DEU 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 3:25" />Zumbe, nakulombeza unilekele nomboke mto Yolodani haione isi ina ulozo kwe nt'hendelo int'huhu, isi yedi ye vigulu hamwenga ne Milima ya Lebanoni.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 3:26" />“Mna ni nyuwe mlekile Zumbe hanitegeleze. Vituhu vakwe niyo anigamba, ‘Nyamala, usekugendeela kulonga na miye mwe mbuli ino naho! <verse eid="DEU 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 3:27" />Ita kwo lunenengwa lwo mnima Pisiga niyo wakaula kwo ulailo wa zuwa na usweelo wa zuwa na Kwa mwenye mzi na mkoma mahanya. Uikaulise isi iyo kwaviya howomboke na mpaka nt'hendelo int'huhu ya Yolodani. <verse eid="DEU 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 3:28" />Umsangalaze na kumwink'ha ludole Yoshua na kumsigiila kwaviya naawalongoze want'hu awa womboke umto Yolodani naho naawalongoze Waizilaeli kutaha isi na idya kuikala.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 3:29" />“Ivo chekelaga aaho he dikolongo dikuita Beti Peoli.”<verse eid="DEU 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4" />
  <para style="s">Musa awasigiila Waizilaeli wase kumwasa Zumbe Mnungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 4:1" />Musa awagambaga want'hu, “Mwive naho mdamanye miko huwahinizani nanywe nomnde wagima nomwingile na kuikaila isi iyo mkwink'higwa ni Zumbe Mnungu ywa wakale wenyu. <verse eid="DEU 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 4:2" />Msekongezela naho msekuhungula chochose mwe zisigilizi huwasigiilani. Mtimile sigilizi za Zumbe Mnungu. <verse eid="DEU 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 4:3" />Nyuwe wenye nomkeonela icho adamanyaga Zumbe Mnungu kudya Baali Peoli. Awakomaga wose wamvikaga Baali ywa Peoli, <verse eid="DEU 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 4:4" />mna wose wandaga wahuilwa kwa Zumbe Mnungu, wakei wagima mpaka ivi dielo.”<verse eid="DEU 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 4:5" />“Kauleni! Hiwahinizani sigilizi zose, enga ivo Zumbe Mnungu anisigiile, kugamba mzive na kuzitimila kwe isi mkwiingila na kuitaha inde yenyu. <verse eid="DEU 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 4:6" />Mzitoze na kuzitimila, kwa uhuilwa nivo want'hu we si nt'huhu nawamanye ivo mwili na mizungu na umanyi umwo wakeva zisigilizi izi zose nawagambe, ‘Ikindedi want'hu awa ni isi nk'hulu, wana mizungu naho wabala.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 4:7" />“Kwaviya haihali isi nk'hulu ina mnungu ehagihi nawo enga ivo eli Zumbe Mnungu ivo eli hagihi na suwe kila kikamlombeza wambizi. <verse eid="DEU 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 4:8" />Naho ni isi ihi nt'huhu nk'hulu ina sigilizi na miko enga izi niwahinizeni dielo? <verse eid="DEU 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 4:9" />Mna mkedime naho mdimise unt'hu wenyu sema mjale vint'hu mkeonele nyuwe wenye niyo mwazijala mwo wikazi wenyu. Vint'hu ivi vimanyike kwa wana wenyu na welekwa wenyu. <verse eid="DEU 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 4:10" />Kumbukileni ivo mwakimalaga ha Zumbe Mnungu kudya kwo mnima wa Sinai umwo anigambaga, ‘Waduganye want'hu ahangu wategeleze zimbuli zangu vileke wahine kuniva lupisi lwose wakekala mwe isi naho wawahinize wana wawe.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 4:11" />“Wagambileni wana wenyu ivo mwakimalaga he diwandamo dyo mnima wagubikwe na mavunde matitu ya mosi na moto, walimbijaga mpaka kwe mbingu na vunde dititihale na ziza. <verse eid="DEU 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 4:12" />Naho Zumbe alongaga na nyuwe kulawa mwo moto. Mwevaga ulosi alongile mna hamwamuonaga ivo eli, mwevaga diizwi dyakwe du. <verse eid="DEU 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 4:13" />Awagambilagani kugamba mwaungwa kutimila Ndagano yakwe iyo aikile na nyuwe mwaungwa kuzizumila na kuzidamanya sigilizi mlongo izo aziwandika mwe vibesu viidi va maiwe. <verse eid="DEU 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 4:14" />Zumbe nakanigamba niwahinizeni sigilizi zose izo mkuungwa kuzitimila kwe isi mkugenda kuitaha kuikaila.”<verse eid="DEU 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makanyo mwe mbuli yo kuvika mahili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15" />“Ivo indeni ne wengele kwaviya hammuone yehe mwenye ivo eli mwe dizuwa diya umwo Zumbe alongaga na nyuwe kulawa mgati gati mwo moto. <verse eid="DEU 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 4:16" />Msekudamanya wavu kwa kukedamanyila mahili yakeigile futa yoyose idamanywe enga mvele hegu mgosi <verse eid="DEU 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 4:17" />hegu enga kala dyodyose mwe isi hegu enga dege dikupululuka mwo ulanga, <verse eid="DEU 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 4:18" />hegu dikale enga magondo yakubulumuka mwe sanga naho hegu enga samaki yoyose imwa mazi. <verse eid="DEU 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:19" />Naho umwo mka kaula kulanga na kuzdiona dizuwa no mnenge ne zi nt'hondo na vose vi mwo ulanga, msekugezwa kwa kuvifikila madi na kuvivika. Kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu aviumbaga want'hu ivo vileke avipange kwa wose we hasi ye mbingu. <verse eid="DEU 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 4:20" />Mna nyuwe, Zumbe kawaguhani na kuwalavani mwe nunda ikulimmbija moto, kulawa Misili. Kawalavani vileke awatende kunda want'hu wakwe mwenye enga ivo mwili haluse. <verse eid="DEU 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 4:21" />Ni nyuwe mwalekaga Zumbe Mnungu akanifiila maya niyo akelisa kugamba henomboke mto Yolodani no kwingila mwe isi iyedi iyo Zumbe Mnungu akuwenk'hani inde yenyu. <verse eid="DEU 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 4:22" />Miye nenibanike mwe isi ino henomboke mto Yolodani mna nyuwe mwihagihi na komboka mto Yolodani no kuiguha isi iyo iyedi. <verse eid="DEU 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 4:23" />Mkaulise sema mnajale Indagano iyo Zumbe Mnungu aikile na nyuwe, Timileni sigilizi yakwe, mse kukedamanyila hili dyodyose. <verse eid="DEU 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 4:24" />Kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu ni moto ukoka pele, naho ni Mnungu mta wivu.”<verse eid="DEU 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 4:25" />“Aho mkeza kunda na wana, na wezukulu naho niyo mwadalahala mwe isi. Naho uneva mnadamanya wavu kwa kukedamanyila hili dyodyose na kumdamanyila wiihi Zumbe Mnungu , niyo mwamtenda ande na maya. <verse eid="DEU 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 4:26" />Naitanga mbingu ne isi kunda waona wangu kwajili yenyu dielo, kugamba hamnivile, nomsunguze kusila pele mwe isi, homwikalise mwe isi mkomboka mto Yolodani iyo mwihagihi na kuitaha. Nomkomigwe pele. <verse eid="DEU 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 4:27" />Zumbe naawamwaganiseni mwe zi isi nt'huhu naho uko nomsigale wageke du. <verse eid="DEU 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 4:28" />Uko nomvike milungu idamanywe ni want'hu, milungu ya maziti na maiwe heiikudaha kukaula hegu kwiva heiikudya hagu kuhefya. <verse eid="DEU 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 4:29" />Mna mkanda uuko nomumzungule Zumbe Mnungu nanywe nommuone uneva nomumzungule kwa moyo wose no unt'hu wenyu wose. <verse eid="DEU 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 4:30" />Umwo mkeza kunda mwa makunt'ho, naho aya yose yakeza kuwalailani, niho nomwize muuye kwa Zumbe na kumwiva. <verse eid="DEU 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 4:31" />Kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu ni mta mbazi. Haamwaseni na kuwakomani, naho haajale Indagano iyo mwenye aiikilaga kilapi na wakale wenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 4:32" />“Keuzeni wenye, kukongela aho Mnungu aumbaga want'hu mwe isi mpaka ivi dielo uzeni mwe si zose kulawa mp'hembe imwenga mpaka mp'hembe nt'huhu, uneva mbuli ya kweheela enga ino yanda ilaile hegu kwivigwa? <verse eid="DEU 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 4:33" />Togoleni weyuko want'hu watuhu wevaga Mnungu akalonga kulawa mwo moto niyo wanda wakei wagima enga ivo indile kwenyu? <verse eid="DEU 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 4:34" />Hegu eyuko mnungu yeyose adahaga kuwaguha want'hu kulawa mwe want'hu wa isi nt'huhu na kuwatenda want'hu wakwe enga ivo Zumbe Mnungu ivo amitendeleni kudya Misili? Atendaga kwa udahi mkulu na ludole egalaga makunt'ho na nk'hondo naho adamanyaga mitu na va kweheela naho niyo adamanya mbuli zikutisa iivi mkakaula. <verse eid="DEU 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 4:35" />Zumbe kamilagisani aya mmanye ikindedi kugamba ni yehe ekedu niye Mnungu naho hahali mtuhu. <verse eid="DEU 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 4:36" />Awatendagani mwive diizwi dyakwe kulawa kwe mbingu vileke awahinizeni, naho amilagisagani moto wakwe ukukile aha he isi naho alongaga na nyuwe mgati mwo moto uwo. <verse eid="DEU 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 4:37" />Kwaviya awaungaga wakale wenyu na kuwasagula welekwa wawe na kwa udahi wakwe mkulu yehe mwenye nakawalava Misili. <verse eid="DEU 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 4:38" />Aho mwandaga mkeza awagulusaga kulongole kwenyu want'hu wa si nk'hulu naho zina udahi kujink'ha nyuwe na kuwegalani nyuwe mwe isi yawe inde yenyu enga ivo ili dielo. <verse eid="DEU 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 4:39" />Haluse kumbukileni naho mse kujala, Zumbe niye Mnungu kwe mbingu kulanga na mwe isi aha hasi, naho hahali Mnungu mtuhu. <verse eid="DEU 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 4:40" />Timileni sigilizi zakwe zose niwenk'hileni dielo niho nomwikale wikazi wedi nyuwe ne vyeleko venyu. Nanywe nomgendeele kwikalisa mwe isi mkwink'higwa ni Zumbe Mnungu kunda yenyu mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="DEU 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unyilikilo wa want'hu, ulailo wa zuwa wa mto Yolodani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 4:41" />Ivo Musa apagulaga mizi mitatu ulailo wa zuwa wo mto Yolodani, <verse eid="DEU 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 4:42" />iyo yeyse akomile mnt'hu akudaha kunyilikila uneva hamkomile kwa kumkambila. Adaha kunyilikila mwo mzi umwenga mwe mizi iyo miidi vileke akehonye ugima wakwe. <verse eid="DEU 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 4:43" />Mizi yenye yandanga ni ino, Bezeli kwe zint'hindiga ze dijangwa, kwajili ya kabila dya Lubeni, Lomosi ukwo Gileadi kwajili ya kabila dya Gadi na Galani uko Bashani kwajili ya kabila dya Manase.<verse eid="DEU 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utambalisi mwo kuhiniza Miko ya Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 4:44" />Izi nizo zisigilizi izo Musa aiikaga mwa Waizilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 4:45" />Ino niyo Imiko na malagizo ayo Musa awagambile Waizilaeli umwo weze walawe uko Misili. <verse eid="DEU 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 4:46" />Naho waikaga nk'hambi kwe dikolongo dihagihi na Beti Peoli ulailo wa zuwa wa mto Yolodani kwe isi ya Sihoni seuta ywa Waamoli, uyo alongozaga Heshiboni naho niye atowagwa ni Musa na Waizilaeli wawahumaga umwo wandaga wakalawa Misili. <verse eid="DEU 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 4:47" />Waizilaeli waiguhaga isi yakwe ne isi ya seuta Ogu ywa Bashani na maseuta waidi wa Waamoli kwe nt'hendelo ya ulailo wa zuwa wa mto Yolodani. <verse eid="DEU 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 4:48" />Ivo Waizilaeli waiguhaga isi yose kulawa Aloeli mnk'handa mwe dikolongo dya Alinoni mpakaa kwo mnima wa Sioni iviyaiviya wetangwa Helimoni, <verse eid="DEU 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 4:49" />hamwenga ne dibwandasi dyose dyo mto Yolodani mpaka Kwa mwenye mzi ye Bahali yo Munyu.<verse eid="DEU 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DEU 5" />
  <para style="s">Sigilizi mlongo za Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 5:1" />Musa awaduganyaga hamwenga want'hu wa Izilaeli niyo awagamba, “Want'hu wa Izilaeli, tegelezini imiko yose huwagambilani dielo. Mkehinize naho mkaulise kugamba mwaitimila. <verse eid="DEU 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 5:2" />Zumbe Mnungu aikaga Ndagano na suwe ukwo kwo Mnima wa Sinai. <verse eid="DEU 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 5:3" />Haikile Ndagano na wakale wetu du, mna ni hamwenga na suwe kiwagima ivi dielo. <verse eid="DEU 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 5:4" />Zumbe Mnungu alongaga na nyuwe enga mnt'hu akulonga na miyawe, naho mwamwivaga wenye mgati mwo moto kudya kwo mnima. <verse eid="DEU 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 5:5" />Lupisi ludya miye nandaga mwigala ulosi hagati ha nyuwe na Zumbe hawagambilani icho andaga akalonga kwaviya mwogohaga umoto, ivo hamwakwelaga kulaga kwo mnima.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 5:5">“Zumbe niyo gamba, <verse eid="DEU 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 5:6" />‘Ni miye Zumbe Mnungu nawayokolagani kulawa Misili uko mwandaga watumwa.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 5:7" />“ ‘Msekunda na milungu mituhu, mna miye du.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 5:8" />“ ‘Msekukedamanyila hili dikeigile na kint'hu chochose kikulanga kwe mbingu hegu ki hasi mwe isi hegu ki mwa mazi hasi ye isi. <verse eid="DEU 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 5:9" />Msekuvifikila madi hegu kuvivika, kwaviya miye ni miye Zumbe Mnungu mkunivika naho nna wivu hiikufinyiliza kuikwa hamwenga na milungu mituhu. Nawasulumiza wana kwo wavu wa watati zawe, mpaka cheleko cha katatu na cha kane va wadya wakuni iihia. <verse eid="DEU 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 5:10" />Mna nalagisa lukunde lwangu kwa maalufu ya vyeleko va wadya wakuniunga na kutimila na kudamanya sigilizi zangu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 5:11" />“ ‘Msekutambula dizina dya Zumbe Mnungu haheina mbuli ya kindedi, kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu mkumvika haaleke kumgela mnt'hu mwa masa mnt'hu akuditambula dizina dyakwe haheina mbuli ya kindedi.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 5:12" />“ ‘Dikumbukileni Dizuwa dyo Kuhumula naho dinde dya kumvika Zumbe, enga ivo Zumbe Mnungu awasigiileni. <verse eid="DEU 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 5:13" />Nomdamanye zindima zenyu mwa mazuwa mtandatu, <verse eid="DEU 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 5:14" />mna dizuwa dya mfungate ni Dizuwa dya Kuhumula, mnt'hu yeyose mwenyu asekudamanya ndima, ikanda ni wana wenyu, hegu watumwa wenyu, mifugwa yenyu hegu wata kwiza we mwe isi yenyu. Watumwa wenyu nawo wahumule enga nyuwe. <verse eid="DEU 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 5:15" />Mkumbukile kugamba mwandaga watumwa umwo mwandaga Misili, naho kugamba Zumbe Mnungu awalavagani kwa udahi mkulu. Nivo vikuleka nawagambani mdikumbukile Dizuwa dyo Kuhumula.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 5:16" />“ ‘Umwive iso na nyokwe vileke wikazi wako unde wedi naho vileke wikalise mwe isi hukwink'ha miye Zumbe Mnungu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 5:17" />“ ‘Use kukoma.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 5:18" />“ ‘Use kugenda na mvele hi ywako.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 5:19" />“ ‘Use kubawa.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 5:20" />“ ‘Use kulonga uwona wa udant'hi kwa miyawo.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 5:21" />“ ‘Use kumunk'hilwa ni mkaza mnt'hu, hegu nyumba yakwe hegu nk'honde hegu mtumwa ywakwe hegu ng'ombe yakwe hegu mp'hunda yakwe hegu kint'hu chochose hi chako.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 5:22" />“Sigilizi izi nizo Zumbe awagambilagani nyuwe nyose aho awaduganyagani kudya kwo mnima. Umwo alongaga na nyuwe kwa izwi dya udahi mkulu mgati mwo moto na mwe divunde dititihale, awenk'hagani zisigilizi izi naho hiyo nt'huhu. Akajika aziwandikaga mwe vihant'hi viidi va maiwe niyo anink'ha.”<verse eid="DEU 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wogohi wa want'hu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 5:23" />“Umo mwevaga idiizwi dikalawa mwo lwiza mnima wandaga ukalimbija moto, mwanibasaga wakulu wose wa makabila na wadala vilongozi wenyu, <verse eid="DEU 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 5:24" />niyo mwagamba, ‘Zumbe Mnungu kakilagisa ung'azi no ukulu wakwe naho nekimwiva akalonga mgati mwo moto. Dielo kiona kugamba mnt'hu adaha kunda mgima hata uneva Mnungu analonga naye! <verse eid="DEU 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 5:25" />Mna haluse chaunga kibanikilei? Moto uno mkulu wadaha kuchoka pele naho nekibanike kina gendeela kudiiva diizwi dya Zumbe Mnungu. <verse eid="DEU 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 5:26" />Kwaviya niani mwa wose wata mwili andaga mgima aho eze eve Mnungu mta ugima akalonga mgati mwo moto? <verse eid="DEU 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 5:27" />Sogela hagihi weye niyo wategeleza kila kint'hu akulonga Zumbe Mnungu niyo wakigambila. Suwe nekive na kutimila.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 5:28" />“Zumbe awevagani ivo mwalongaga na miye naye niyo anigamba, ‘Hiva zimbuli izo want'hu wakugambile, ayo walongile ni kindedi. <verse eid="DEU 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 5:29" />Uneva wandile na moyo enga uno mndani mwawe mazuwa yose, moyo wa kunivika na kutimila sigilizi zangu mazuwa yose, wikazi wawe wose hegu nounda wedi woho ne vyeleko vawe mazuwa yose! <verse eid="DEU 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 5:30" />Kawagambe wauye kwa mahema yawe. <verse eid="DEU 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 5:31" />Mna weye Musa, kikalanye aha, name nohwink'he zigilizi zangu zose ne miko yangu yose no usengelo wangu wose. Noukawahinize kugamba wakazidamanye kwe isi iyo huwenk'ha.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 5:32" />“Want'hu wa Izilaeli mkaulise kugamba mwadamanya kiya msigiilwe ni Zumbe Mnungu. Msekuleka kutimila sigilizi zakwe zose. <verse eid="DEU 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 5:33" />Timileni sila zose za Zumbe Mnungu enga ivo awasigiileni vileke wikazi wenyu unde wedi naho mgendeele kwikala mwe isi mkuitaha.”<verse eid="DEU 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DEU 6" />
  <para style="s">Sigilizi ink'hulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 6:1" />“Izi nizo zisigilizi ne miko no usengelo izo Zumbe Mnungu ywetu anisigiile nize niwahinizeni. Mzive na kuzitimila kwe isi iyo nomwingile no kuitaha, <verse eid="DEU 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 6:2" />vileke wana wenyu na vyeleko vawe wamtunye Zumbe Mnungu umwo nomnde mwekala kwa kutimila usengelo wakwe wose ne zisigilizi izo huwagambilani mwa mazuwa yose yo wikazi wenyu, vileke mazuwa yo ugima wenyu yande mengi. <verse eid="DEU 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 6:3" />Tegelezeni nyuwe want'hu wa Izilaeli, naho mkombeke kuziva na kuzitimila na ivo wikazi wenyu nounde wedi, naho nomgenyele no kwikala mwe isi yedi ina ulozo na udimi enga ivo Zumbe Mnungu ywa watati zenyu awagambagani naadamanye.”<verse eid="DEU 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 6:4" />“Tegelezeni nyuwe want'hu wa Izilaeli, Zumbe Mnungu ni Zumbe ekedu. <verse eid="DEU 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 6:5" />Muunge Zumbe Mnungu kwa moyo wako wose na kwo unt'hu wako wose na kwa ludole lwako lwose. <verse eid="DEU 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 6:6" />Mzikumbukile zisigilizi izi huwasigiilani dielo naho zinde mwe mioyo yenyu. <verse eid="DEU 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 6:7" />Mzihinize kwa wana wenyu. Zinde ni simulizi yenyu mkanda hakaya hegu mkanda kwe samo hegu mkagenda mwe sila na mkanda mhumula hegu mkanda mwadamanya ndima. <verse eid="DEU 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 6:8" />Mziwandike na kuzivala mwe mikono na mwe vihanga venyu kunda lukumbusa. <verse eid="DEU 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 6:9" />Ziwandikeni sigilizi izi mwe mikimaila ye zinyivi zenyu na mwe zink'hili zenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makanyo mwe mbuli yo kusaguka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 6:10" />“Naho umwo Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu akawegalani kwe isi awaikilaga kilapi wakale wenyu, Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo kugamba naawenk'he isi ina mizi mikulu yedi homwii zengile nyuwe. <verse eid="DEU 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 6:11" />Mnungu naawenk'heni nyumba zimemile vint'hu vedi homwii vidamanye nyuwe, masima homuyasimbile, nk'honde za mizabibu na mizeituni homwii handile. Mna mneza kunda na nk'hande nyingi yakuwegusani, <verse eid="DEU 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 6:12" />mkaulise msekwiza kumjala Zumbe awalavileni Misili kwe isi uko mwandaga watumwa. <verse eid="DEU 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 6:13" />Mwogoheni Zumbe Mnungu, mumvike yehe ekedu naho nomkelise kwa zina dyakwe du. <verse eid="DEU 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 6:14" />Mse kuvika milungu mituhu ya want'hu wawazungulukeni, <verse eid="DEU 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 6:15" />kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu emgati mwenyu, ni Mnungu mta wivu naho maya yakwe enga moto yanase kuwakimp'hukilani na kuwakomani pele mwe isi.”<verse eid="DEU 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 6:16" />“Mse kumgeza Zumbe Mnungu enga ivo mwatendile uko Masa. <verse eid="DEU 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 6:17" />Mzitozese zisigilizi za Zumbe Mnungu miko yakwe huwasigiilani. <verse eid="DEU 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 6:18" />Damanyeni yakwelela na yedi ha Zumbe vileke wikazi wenyu unde wedi, naivo mdahe kugenda kuiguha isi iyo iyedi iyo Zumbe Mnungu aikile Ndagano kuwenk'ha wakale wenyu, <verse eid="DEU 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 6:19" />naho nomuwalave kuse ye isi wank'hondo wenyu wose ivi mkakaula enga ivo Zumbe alongile kugamba naadamanye.”<verse eid="DEU 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 6:20" />“Mwa mazuwa yakwiza umwo wana wenyu wakeza kuwauzani wakagamba, ‘Nii Zumbe Mnungu kakisigiila kitimile zisigilizi izi zose?’ <verse eid="DEU 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 6:21" />Wagambeni ivi, ‘Suwe chandaga watumwa wa Falao kudya Misili, mna Zumbe akilavaga uko kwa udahi wakwe mkulu. <verse eid="DEU 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 6:22" />Kiona wenye aho Zumbe atumaga vilagiso va mitu yakweheela vikulu na vikutisa uko Misili na kwa Falao na kwa wandima wakwe. <verse eid="DEU 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 6:23" />Nakakilava Misili no kukigala aha niyo akink'ha isi idya aikaga Ndagano kwa kilapi kuwenk'ha wakale wetu. <verse eid="DEU 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 6:24" />Zumbe nakakigamba kive na kitimile sigililizi izi zose naho kimogohe. Kinadamanya ivo naadime isi yetu na kutenda kipatise. <verse eid="DEU 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 6:25" />Uneva kinamwiva na kutenda kila kint'hu kiya aungile Zumbe Mnungu nekimwelele.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 6:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DEU 7" />
  <para style="s">Mnungu awasagula want'hu wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 7:1" />“Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu naawegaleni kwe isi idya ikuunga inde yenyu, naawaguluse want'hu wa si nyingi nk'hulu zina ludole kujink'ha nyuwe, awo Wahiti na Wagiligashi, Waamoli na Wakanaani, Wapelizi na Wahivi na Wayebusi. <verse eid="DEU 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 7:2" />Umwo Zumbe Mnungu akeza kuwatenda mnde na ludole na kuwahuma vaungwa muwakome wose. Mse kunda na mwivano nawo na kuwaonela mbazi. <verse eid="DEU 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 7:3" />Msekulombelana naho msekuloza wana kike hegu kuwaloza wana kilume kwawe, <verse eid="DEU 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 7:4" />kwaviya nawawalongoze wana wenyu wasaguke kwa Zumbe niyo wavika milungu mituhu. Niho maya ya Zumbe nayawakip'hukileni nanywe namsunguze kukomwa pele. <verse eid="DEU 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 7:5" />Haluse ivi nivo nomuwatendele. Nommole vilingo vawe vo kulavila nt'hambiko, na katula mikola yawe vibesubesu na kumola mahili yawe ya Ashela, no kuyoka mahili yawe ya kusongola. <verse eid="DEU 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 7:6" />Kwaviya nyuwe mwi want'hu wa Zumbe Mnungu. Yehe kawasagulani nyuwe mnde want'hu wakwe kujink'ha want'hu wose we mwe isi.”<verse eid="DEU 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 7:7" />“Zumbe Mnungu hiyo kugamba kawaungani na kuwasagulani kwaviya nomndilisa wengi mwe si kujink'ha want'hu watuhu, nyuwe mwandilisaga wageke kujink'ha want'hu wose mwe si. <verse eid="DEU 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 7:8" />Mna Zumbe awaungagani naho aungaga kukint'hiza Ndagano aikaga na wakale wenyu. Ivo nivo valekile awayokolagani na kuwakombola mwo utumwa kulawa kwa Seuta ywa Misili kwa udahi mkulu. <verse eid="DEU 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 7:9" />Ivo mmanye kugamba, Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu ni Mnungu mhuilwa, akukint'hiza Ndagano yo lukunde kwa maalufu ye vyeleko va want'hu wakumuunga no kutoza zisigilizi zakwe, <verse eid="DEU 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 7:10" />mna haaleke kuwasulumiza wakumwiihia. <verse eid="DEU 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 7:11" />Ivo elo damanyeni yandya yose mhinizwe, ziiveni na kuzidamanya zisigilizi zose huwagambilani dielo.”<verse eid="DEU 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uvikilwa kwa kutimila sigilizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 7:12" />“Uneva mnategeleza zisigilizi izi niyo wazitimila kwa uhuilwa niho Zumbe Mnungu nagendeele kukint'hiza Indagano yakwe iyo adamanye na nyuwe naalagise lukunde lwakwe kwenyu enga ivo aikaga kilapi kwa wakale wenyu. <verse eid="DEU 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 7:13" />Naawaungeni niyo awavikilani vileke mgenyele na kweleka wana wengi, naavikile zink'honde zenyu zinde na ulozo wa nk'hande na divai na mavuta ya zeituni, naho naawavikileni mnde na ng'ombe na ngoto na mbuzi nyingi. Naawavikileni mwa aya yose mwe isi awaikilaga kilapi wakale wenyu kugamba naawenk'heni. <verse eid="DEU 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 7:14" />Nyuwe nomvikilwe kujink'ha want'hu wose mwe si. Hokunde na mgosi hegu mvele naande mgumba, naho hakunde na ludimo lwenyu lwolwose lukuunga lunde nt'hasa. <verse eid="DEU 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 7:15" />Zumbe naawamileni na maine yoyose. Naho haalekele maine yaihile mwayaonaga kudya Misili yaweziileni. Naayalekele maine ayo yaihile yaweziile wank'honido wenyu. <verse eid="DEU 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 7:16" />Wakomeni want'hu wa isi zose. Mnungu kawenk'ha udahi wakuwahuma naho mse kuwaonela mbazi. Naho msekuivika milungu yawe kwaviya iyo nainde lwinika kwenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 7:17" />“Naho msekukegamba mwe mioyo yenyu want'hu awa wana ludole kujink'ha suwe, hekidahe kuwalava mwe isi ino. <verse eid="DEU 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 7:18" />Mse kuwogoha, kumbukileni vedi ivo Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu amtendaga Falao na Wamisili wose. <verse eid="DEU 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 7:19" />Kumbukileni makunt'ho yakutisa yadya mwakeonelaga wenye, na mitu na ya kweheela na udahi mkulu na ludole kwa ivo Zumbe Mnungu awakombolagani. Enga ivo awakomaga pele Wamisili, naawakome pele awo want'hu mkuwogoha. <verse eid="DEU 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 7:20" />Naho Zumbe Mnungu naatende wogohi mgati mwao naawabanange pele wadya wakukefisa. <verse eid="DEU 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 7:21" />Ivo want'hu awa wase kuwatisani kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu uyo mnanaye ni Mnungu mkulu ywa . <verse eid="DEU 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 7:22" />Zumbe Mnungu naawaguluse kwenyu want'hu we isi izi aho mkwingila. Haawabanange wose kwa lupisi lumwenga, chaivo makala mbago nayagenyele niyo yawagelani nk'huswank'huswa. <verse eid="DEU 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 7:23" />Zumbe Mnungu naawatende mnde na ludole kujink'ha wank'hondo wenyu vileke waganike mpaka wakomigwe pele. <verse eid="DEU 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 7:24" />Naawatendeni mnde na ludole kujink'ha maseuta wawe. Nomuwakome wose niyo wajaligwa. Hahali naawahigeni. <verse eid="DEU 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 7:25" />Nomuyoke moto mahili yawe. Mse kumunk'hilwa ni masawa hegu zahabu yawe niyo mwaziguha, msekuziguha sema inande lwinika kwenyu kwaviya Zumbe awihiya uhabwasi. <verse eid="DEU 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 7:26" />Msekuguha mahili aya na kuyegala kwe zikaya zenyu kwaviya nomligitwe enga mahili ayo. Msekuyaunga naho myabele kwaviya yaligitwa ni Zumbe ”<verse eid="DEU 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DEU 8" />
  <para style="s">Isi yedi yo kuitaha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 8:1" />“Mtende kwa wengele zisigilizi zose niwenk'hileni ivi dielo vileke mnde na ugima na kugenyela, naho muitahe isi iyo Zumbe aikaga kilapi kugamba naawenk'he wakale wenyu. <verse eid="DEU 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 8:2" />Kumbukileni ivo Zumbe Mnungu awalongozagani mwo utafi mkomboka mwe dijangwa kwa miaka milongo mine ino yomboke. Awagezagani vileke amanye ayo ye mwe mioyo yenyu kugamba nomzitegeleze na kuzitimila zisigilizi zakwe hegu bule. <verse eid="DEU 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 8:3" />Awagezagani kwa sala niyo awenk'hani mana mdye, nk'hande iyo nyuwe na wakale wenyu hamnati mwiidye, ivo yandaga ni kuwahiniza kugamba Mnt'hu haaikwe ni kudya nk'hande du, mna naaikwe ni kiya akulonga Mnungu. <verse eid="DEU 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 8:4" />Suke zenyu hazasakalaga naho viga venyu havatutukaga miaka iyo yose milongo mine. <verse eid="DEU 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 8:5" />Mmanye mwe mioyo yenyu kugamba, enga ivo mwelesi akumuogola mwanawe, iivo Zumbe Mnungu naye awaogolani. <verse eid="DEU 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 8:6" />Ivo elo damanyeni enga ivo Zumbe awa sigiileni, wikazi wenyu ulongozwe ni zisigilizi zakwe niyo mwazitegeleza na kuzidamanya. <verse eid="DEU 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 8:7" />Kwa viya Zumbe Mnungu awegalani kwe isi ina ulozo, naho ina mito na vizuto na makawa ya mazi nc'hoko zikutumbuka mazi mwa makolongo na mwe vigulu. <verse eid="DEU 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 8:8" />isi ina ngano na shaili na zabibu na tini na makomamamnga na zeituni no uki. <verse eid="DEU 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 8:9" />Isi heiina sala naho homhungukilwe ni chochose, isi ina maiwe yakulava vilama naho ni isi mkudaha kusimba shaba. <verse eid="DEU 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 8:10" />Nomnde na kila kint'hu cho kudya naho nomumgambe Zumbe Mnungu nivedi kwajili ye isi ina ulozo awenk'hileni.”<verse eid="DEU 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wazilaili wakanywa wase kumjala Zumbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 8:11" />Musa agendeelaga kulonga akagamba “Msekumjala Zumbe Mnungu naho mse kudunduga kuiva na kutimila sigilizi yakwe yoyose iyo huwenk'hani ivi dielo. <verse eid="DEU 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 8:12" />Umwo mkeza kunda na nk'hande ya kuwegusani naho mkeza kunda mzeka nyumba zedi niyo mwekala uumo, <verse eid="DEU 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 8:13" />naho umwo ng'ombe zenyu na magoto na masawa na zahabu na ugoli wenyu mtuhu ukeza kunda ugenyela, <verse eid="DEU 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 8:14" />mkaulise mnase kukeduvya niyo mwamjala Zumbe Mnungu awalavileni Misili ukwo mwandaga watumwa. <verse eid="DEU 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 8:15" />Ni yehe awalongozagani mwe dijangwa dikutisisa dyandaga na nyoka zina usungu ukukoma na visuse. Awalavilagani mazi mwo luwe mwe isi heiina mazi. <verse eid="DEU 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 8:16" />Awenk'hagani mana mdye, nk'hande iyo wakale wenyu hawaimanyaga. Awatendelagani ayo yose vileke awagezeni kwa ayedi akuunga awenk'heni kulongole. <verse eid="DEU 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 8:17" />Aho mnakaulise, mnase mgambe mwe miyoyo yenyu mpata ugoli uwo kwa ludole na udahi wenyu wenye. <verse eid="DEU 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 8:18" />Mkumbukile kugamba Zumbe Mnungu niye awenk'hileni udahi wa kupata ugoli uwo. Adamanya aya kwaviya yehe akei mhuilwa dielo kwa Ndagano idya aikaga na wakale wenyu. <verse eid="DEU 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 8:19" />Mneza kumjala Zumbe Mnungu niyo mwatimila milungu mituhu na kuifikila madi na kuivika, nawakanyani kindedi kugamba nomkomwe pele. <verse eid="DEU 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 8:20" />Mnaleka kwiva na kutimila yalongigwe ni Zumbe Mnungu nomkomigwe pele enga ivo Zumbe awakomaga pele want'hu wa isi nt'huhu umwo mwandaga mkeza.”<verse eid="DEU 8:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DEU 9" />
  <para style="s">Kusaguka kwa Wazilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 9:1" />“Mtegeleze nyuwe Waizilaeli! Ivi dielo mwaunga mwomboke mto Yolodani mwingile kwa kuwaika want'hu wa isi nt'huhu mwo udahi wenyu. Isi nk'hulu zina udahi kujink'ha nyuwe, na mizi mikulu izengelwe magomela matali yakubula kwa mavunde, <verse eid="DEU 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 9:2" />want'hu wenye wana ludole naho watali, welekwa wa Waanaki enga ivo muwamanyize. Mwiva ivo ikulongwa, Niani akudaha kukimaala awahige Waanaki? <verse eid="DEU 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 9:3" />Elo mmanye dielo kugamba Zumbe Mnungu niye akuwalongoelani kulongole kwenyu enga moto ukoka pele. Naawahume na kuwakoma pele naho naawakinye mkawa sinya. Ivo nivo nomuwakulumbuze na kusunguza kuwakoma pele enga ivo Zumbe Mnungu alongile.”<verse eid="DEU 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 9:4" />“Aho Zumbe Mnungu akeza kuwagulusa iivi mkawasinya msekufanyanya mwe myo yenyu kugamba uwagilwa wenyu nuwo ulekile Zumbe akawegalani mkaitahe isi ino, kumbeke nu wavu wa want'hu we ziisi izo nuwo ukuleka Zumbe awakulumbuze iivi ukawasinya. <verse eid="DEU 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 9:5" />Hiyo kwaviya wazumilwa ha Mnungu naho wadamanya uwagilwa vikuleka Zumbe akulekele uitahe isi yawe, bule. Naawaguluse kwaviya wadamanya yaihile naho Zumbe Mnungu kwaviya akumbukila Indagano aikaga na Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo. <verse eid="DEU 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 9:6" />Ivo umanye kugamba Zumbe Mnungu ukumvika hakukwink'ha isi iyo iyedi vileke uitahe kwaviya uywedi, bule weye ywi mnt'hu mnk'hani.”<verse eid="DEU 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 9:7" />“Usekujala ivo mwamtendaga Zumbe Mnungu ande na maya kudya kwe dijangwa. Kukongela kwe dizuwa diya mwalawaga Misili mpaka aha, mwasagukaga na kumhiga. <verse eid="DEU 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 9:8" />Hata kudya kwo mnima wa Sinai mwamtendaga Zumbe ande na maya, andilisaga na maya niyo aunga awakome pele. <verse eid="DEU 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 9:9" />Aho nize nikwele kwo mnima kuhokela vibesu va maiwe ivo viwandikwe Indagano iyo Zumbe Mnungu adamanyaga na nyuwe, na kwikala uko mazuwa milongo mine, kilo na msi, hidile nk'hande naho hinywele mazi. <verse eid="DEU 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 9:10" />Niyo Zumbe anink'ha vibesu viidi va maiwe viwandikwe kwa kadole kakwe Mnungu, nevinda viwandikwa mbuli zose izo Zumbe amigambileni uko kwo mnima kulawa mwo moto zuwa dya mdugano. <verse eid="DEU 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 9:11" />Ivo, mazuwa milongo mine yeze yomboke, kilo na msi, Zumbe anink'haga vibesu viidi va maiwe vawandikagwa Ndagano.”<verse eid="DEU 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 9:12" />“Ivo Zumbe anigambaga, ‘Sunguza useele hasi yo mnima, kwaviya want'hu wako uwalavile Misili wasaguka. Wasunguza kuileka sila niwasigiile waitimile naho wakedamanyila hili dya kusana.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 9:13" />“Zumbe Mnungu niyo anigamba, ‘Hiwakaula want'hu awa, ni want'hu wank'hani vitendese, <verse eid="DEU 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 9:14" />nileke niwabanange, vileke wase kukumbukilwa naho mwe isi, miye nohutende weye unde tate ywa si nk'hulu ina ludole kujink'ha woho.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 9:15" />“Ivo, nahitukaga, na kuseela kulawa kwo mnima, handa hinula viya vibesu viidi va maiwe, moto nawo wandaga ukakweela kwo mnima. <verse eid="DEU 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 9:16" />Nehyehelwa na kuona kugamba mdamanya kale wavu kwa Zumbe Mnungu. mkukedamanyila hili dya ndama ya kusana, nomsunguza kuileka sila ya Zumbe Mnungu iyo amisigileeni. <verse eid="DEU 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 9:17" />Ivo navitozaga viya vibesu viidi na kuvitwant'hiza hasi na kuvitula iivi mkasinya. <verse eid="DEU 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 9:18" />Nafunamizaga mtwi hasi hant'hu ha kumvika Zumbe Mnungu enga aho nk'hongo, kwa mazuwa milongo mine kilo na msi, hidile nk'hande hegu kunywa mazi, kwajili yo wavu wenyu muutendile kwa kudamanya yaihile ha Zumbe Mnungu kwa kumuihiya. <verse eid="DEU 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 9:19" />Nogohesaga maya ya Zumbe mwa nyuwe hegu nakawakomani pele, mna Zumbe Mnungu anivaga mwo lupisi ulwo. <verse eid="DEU 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 9:20" />Naivo, Zumbe Mnungu nakamuonela maya vitendese Haluni, niyo aunga amkome, ivo nehimlombezela Haluni mwo lupisi uulwo. <verse eid="DEU 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 9:21" />Naho naguhaga kiya ikint'hu cho wavu mwadamanyaga, indama mwadamanyaga niyo nayoka mwo moto. Niyo naitula vibesubesu na aitigint'haga niyo yanda enga luvumbi. Luvumbi ulo naluduulaga mwa kazuto kaseelaga kulawa kwo mnima.”<verse eid="DEU 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 9:22" />“Naho mwamtendaga Zumbe Mnungu ande na maya kudya Tabela na kudya Masa na kudya Kibloti Hataava. <verse eid="DEU 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 9:23" />Naho umwo Zumbe eze awatumeni kulawa Kadeshi Banea awagambagani mwiite mkaitahe isi idya huwenk'hani mna nyuwe hamwatimilaga sigilizi ya Zumbe Mnungu, hamumhuile naho hammwivile na kutimila ayo alongile. <verse eid="DEU 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 9:24" />Nyuwe msaguka kwa Zumbe kukongela aho nize niwamanyeni.”<verse eid="DEU 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 9:25" />“Ivo Nafunamizaga mtwi hasi hant'hu ha kumvika Zumbe kwa mazuwa milongo mine kilo na msi, kwaviya Zumbe naakaunga awakomeni pele. <verse eid="DEU 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 9:26" />Naho namlombezaga Zumbe hagamba, ‘We Zumbe Mnungu usekuwakoma pele want'hu wako mwenye, awo want'hu wawakombolaga kwa ukulu wako, na kuwalava Misili kwa ludole lwako lukulu. <verse eid="DEU 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 9:27" />Wakumbukile wandima wako, Ibulahimu, Isaka na Yakobo. Use kukaulisa zink'hani na wiihi na wavu wa want'hu wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 9:28" />Chaivo Wamisili nawagambe hwadahile kuwegala want'hu wako kwe isi idya wagambile nouwenk'he. Naho nawagambe kuwegala want'hu wako kwe dijangwa ukawakome kwaviya kuwaihia. <verse eid="DEU 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 9:29" />Mna awa ni want'hu wako ukipe wako uwalavile Misili kwa ludole lukulu na udahi.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DEU 10" />
  <para style="s">Musa ahokela naho Sigilizi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 10:1" />“Mwo lupisi ludya Zumbe anigambaga, ‘Damanya vibesu viidi va maiwe enga viya va nk'hongo niyo wadamanya sanduku dya mbao dyo kuikila ivo vibesu, akajika wakwela uku kwangu kwo mnima, <verse eid="DEU 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 10:2" />neni wandike mwe vibesu ivo zimbuli zandaga mwe vibesu viya wavibogozolaga, niyo wavigela mwe Disanduku idyo.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 10:3" />“Ivo elo nadamanyaga Disanduku dya mbao za msaji na kudamanya vibesu viidi va maiwe enga viya va nk'hongo, akajika nakwelaga navo kwo mnima. <verse eid="DEU 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 10:4" />Zumbe awandikaga naho zia zisigilizi mlongo mwe vibesu ivo enga ivo aziwandaikaga nk'hongo, ziya Zumbe awagambilagani kudya kwo mnima akalonga mgati mwo moto, mwe dizuwa diya chaduganaga. Akajika Zumbe anink'haga miye vibesu ivo. <verse eid="DEU 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 10:5" />Naseelaga kulawa kwo mnima niyo navigela vibesu ivo mwe Disanduku nadamanye, enga ivo Zumbe anisigiile, navo vimndani mwe Disanduku.”<verse eid="DEU 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 10:6" />Waizilaeli watambaga kulawa kwa masima ya Wajakani kuita Mosela. Haluni abanikaga niyo amoselwa msanga uuko, Eliyazali umwanawe aguhaga hant'hu ha ise kunda mlavant'hambiko. <verse eid="DEU 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 10:7" />Kulawa aho watambaga kuita Gudigoda. Weze walawe Gudigoda watambaga mpaka Yotibasa isi yandaga na mazi mengi. <verse eid="DEU 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 10:8" />Lupisi ludya Zumbe awasagulaga want'hu we dikabila dya Lawi wenule Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Zumbe. Wakimale ha Zumbe wadamaye ndima ya Zumbe na kunda enga walavant'ambiko, no kuwavikila want'hu kwa zina dyakwe hata ivi dielo. <verse eid="DEU 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 10:9" />Ivo nivo vikuleka mwa Waizilaeli, Walawi hawapangilwe hant'hu mwe isi enga Waizilaeli watuhu ivo wapangilwe, Zumbe nuwo ukipe wawe enga ivo Zumbe Mnungu ivo alongaga.<verse eid="DEU 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 10:10" />Musa agendeelaga kulonga, “Nekalaga kwo mnima mazuwa milongo mine kilo na msi enga ivo natendaga hadya nk'hongo. Zumbe anitegelezaga naho azumilaga ase kuwakomani pele. <verse eid="DEU 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 10:11" />Zumbe niyo anigamba niite Ita hawalongoze want'hu vileke wakengile na kuitaha isi inde yawe, isi iyo agambaga naawenk'he wakale wawe.”<verse eid="DEU 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Icho akuunga Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 10:12" />“Haluse nyuwe want'hu wa Izilaili, icho Zumbe Mnungu akuunga kwenyu ni iki, aunga mmogohe, naho mwikale mkalongozwa naye mwe zimbuli zenyu zose, mmuunge na kumvika kwo moyo wenyu wose no unt'hu wenyu wose, <verse eid="DEU 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 10:13" />naho mzive na kuzitimila zisigilizi zakwe zose. Nawenk'hani sigilizi izi dielo vileke muuone uwedi wakwe. <verse eid="DEU 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 10:14" />Kauleni, zimbingu zikulanga vitendese ne isi na vose vimemile uumwo vose vakwe yehe Zumbe Mnungu. <verse eid="DEU 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 10:15" />Naho Zumbe awonelaga kinyemi na kuwaungisa wakale wenyu, niyo awasagula welekwa wawe kujink'ha want'hu watuhu wa si zose enga ivo vili dielo. <verse eid="DEU 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 10:16" />Naivo elo kukongela ivi haluse mmwive Zumbe Mnungu na kudamanya ayo akulonga, msekunda wank'hani naho. <verse eid="DEU 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 10:17" />Kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu ni Mnungu ywe milungu, na Zumbe ywa mazumbe, ni Mnungu mkulu, akutisa naho hee kwazagula hegu hakuhokela vint'hu vikwazaganya uwagilwa. <verse eid="DEU 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 10:18" />Awenk'ha uwagilwa wanank'hiwa na wabanikilwe ni walume zawe naho awaungisa watakwiza, awenk'ha suke na nk'hande. <verse eid="DEU 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 10:19" />Naivo elo mnde na lukunde na watakwiza kwaviya nyuwe nanywe mwandaga watakwiza kudya Misili. <verse eid="DEU 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 10:20" />Mwive na kutimila yadya akulonga Zumbe Mnungu na kumvika yehe ekedu. Mnde wahuwilwa kwakwe na kukelisa kwe dizina dyakwe du. <verse eid="DEU 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 10:21" />Mtogoleni yehe, uyo niye Mnungu nanywe mwaonaga wenye mbuli nk'hulu na za kutisa awadamanyileni. <verse eid="DEU 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 10:22" />Wakale wenyu waitaga Misili wakanda milongo mfungate, mna haluse Zumbe Mnungu kawagenyezani enga nt'hondo zo ulanga.”<verse eid="DEU 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DEU 11" />
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Zumbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 11:1" />“Naivo elo, muungeni Zumbe Mnungu naho mazuwa yose mtende viya akuwasigiilani. <verse eid="DEU 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 11:2" />Mkumbukile dielo kugamba wana wenyu hiwo woho waone na kuhina makanyo ya Zumbe Mnungu, na ukulu wakwe na udahi wakwe na ludole lwakwe, <verse eid="DEU 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 11:3" />ne mitu yakwe. Mwaonaga ayo amdamanyilaga seuta ywa Misili na want'hu wakwe wose. <verse eid="DEU 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 11:4" />Mwaonaga ivo Zumbe awatendaga watowani we Kimisili ne zifalasi zawe na magali yawe ya nk'hondo ivo awatubwikaga mwe bahali ya Shamu umwo wandaga waka watimilani, naivo awakomaga pele mpaka ivi dielo, <verse eid="DEU 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 11:5" />na ivo awadamanyileni kudya kwe dijangwa mpaka mbula aha, <verse eid="DEU 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 11:6" />naho ivo awatendile Dasani na Abilamu wana Eliyabi we dikabila dya Lubeni iivi wose wakakaula, umwo isanga yagubukaga niyo wahubugila hamwenga ne zimp'huga zawe na mahema yawe na wandima wawe na mifugwa yawe. <verse eid="DEU 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 11:7" />Ikindedi mwaonaga wenye ndima nk'hulu iyo Zumbe adamanye.”<verse eid="DEU 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uvikilwa kwe isi ye Ndagano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 11:8" />“Mzive na kuzitimila zisigilizi zose izi huwenk'hani dielo vileke mdahe komboka mto Yolodani na kuitaha isi idya nomwingile. <verse eid="DEU 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 11:9" />Vileke mdahe kwikala lupisi lutali mwe isi ina ulozo, iyo Zumbe aikaga kilapi kuwenk'ha wakale wenyu ne vyeleko vawe. <verse eid="DEU 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 11:10" />Isi mkugenda kuiguha vileke inde yenyu hiyo enga idya ya Misili uko mlawile. Uko mwahandaga mbeyu zenyu naho mwadamanyaga ndima nk'hulu ya komeela ink'honde. <verse eid="DEU 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 11:11" />Mna isi iyo mkugenda kuitaha ni isi ya milima na makolongo nayo yapata mazi ya fula kulawa kwo ulanga. <verse eid="DEU 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 11:12" />Zumbe Mnungu aikaulisa isi iyo mwaka wose.”<verse eid="DEU 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 11:13" />“Ivo uneva mneva na kutimila kwa uhuilwa zisigilizi izi huwasigiilani dielo kugamba mmuunge Zumbe Mnungu na kudamanya yadya yakumwelela Mnungu kwa miyoyo yenyu yose na unt'hu wenyu wose, <verse eid="DEU 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 11:14" />niho nenigale fula mwe isi yenyu naho kwa lupisi lukuungwa, fula za vuli na za masika vileke mlozole nk'hande na mazi ya zabibu na mavuta. <verse eid="DEU 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 11:15" />Nenihoteze mani kwajili yo ludimo lwenyu, nanywe nomdye no kwiguta. <verse eid="DEU 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 11:16" />Mnde na wengele sema mioyo yenyu ikadant'hilizwa niyo mwahituka na kuivika na kuifunamizila mtwi hasi milungu mituhu. <verse eid="DEU 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 11:17" />Uneva mnatenda ivo Zumbe naawafiileni maya naho haalekele fula inye mwe isi, ivo hokunde na ulozo, nanywe nomsunguze kubanika mwe isi yedi akuwenk'hani Zumbe.”<verse eid="DEU 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 11:18" />“Zimbuli izi huwagambilani mziike mwe mioyo yenyu na mwo unt'hu wenyu, zivaleni mwe mikono yenyu na mwe vihanga venyu kunda lukumbusa. <verse eid="DEU 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 11:19" />Mzihinize kwa wana wenyu. Zinde ni simulizi yenyu mkanda hakaya hegu mkanda kwe samo hegu mkagenda mwe sila na mkanda mhumula hegu mkanda mwadamanya ndima. <verse eid="DEU 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 11:20" />Yawandikeni mwe vifigwe ve milango yenyu na mwe zink'hili zenyu. <verse eid="DEU 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 11:21" />Ivo nyuwe na wana wenyu nomwikale kwa lupisi lutali mwe isi iyo Zumbe Mnungu aikaga kilapi kugamba naawenk'he wakale wenyu. Ivo nomwikale mwo lupisi lwose lukwiza.”<verse eid="DEU 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 11:22" />“Kwaviya uneva mnatimila kwa wengele zisigilizi izi zose huwenk'hani dielo, Mmuunge Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu mkumvika, na kudamanya kila kint'hu mwe sila zakwe zose na kunda hamwenga naye. <verse eid="DEU 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 11:23" />Niho Zumbe naawaguluse want'hu we si nt'huhu aho mkwiza, nyuwe nomzitahe si nt'huhu nk'hulu wata ludole kujink'ha nyuwe. <verse eid="DEU 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 11:24" />Kila hant'hu aho nomhajate nahande henyu. Isi yenyu neyenele kukongela Kwa mwenye mzi ye dijangwa mpaka kwe milima ya Lebanoni na kulawa kwo mto Efulate mpaka usweelo wa zuwa we Bahali ya Meditelania. <verse eid="DEU 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 11:25" />Hohose nomnaite mwe isi idya, Zumbe Mnungu naawatende want'hu wamtunyeni enga ivo alongile naho hokunde na yeyose naawakindileni.”<verse eid="DEU 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 11:26" />“Haluse dielo nomsagule mwe aya maidi, mvikilwe hegu mligitwe. <verse eid="DEU 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 11:27" />Uneva mnatimila zisigilizi za Zumbe Mnungu izi huwenk'hani ivi dielo nomvikilwe, <verse eid="DEU 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 11:28" />mna uneva homtimile zisigilizi za Zumbe Mnungu na kuleka isila ino huwasigiilani dielo, na kuvika milungu mituhu hemwiinati mwuivike nomligitwe . <verse eid="DEU 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 11:29" />Naho umwo Zumbe Mnungu akeza kuwegalani mwe isi iyo mkugenda kuikaila, nombilikize uvikilwa kulawa mwo mnima wa Gelizimu, maligito nayo kulawa mwo mnima Ebali. <verse eid="DEU 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 11:30" />Milima ino miidi ing'ambu yo mto Yolodani, usweelo wa zuwa we sila kuhinga ulailo wa zuwa mwe isi ya Wakanaani wakwikala mwe dikolongo dya mto Yolodani hagihi na mzi wa Giligali mnk'handa ye miti ya mialoni. <verse eid="DEU 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 11:31" />Kwaviya mwihagihi no komboka mto Yolodani niyo mwaitaha isi idya Zumbe Mnungu akuwenk'hani. Umwo mkeza kuitaha no kwikala umwo, <verse eid="DEU 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 11:32" />kauleni kugamba mwaziva na kuzitimila sigilizi zose huwasigiilani dielo.”<verse eid="DEU 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DEU 12" />
  <para style="s">Hant'hu hamwenga ha kuvikila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 12:1" />“Izi nizo sigilizi ne miko izo mkuungwa mzive naho mzitimile mwe isi iyo Zumbe Mnungu ywa wakale wenyu akuwenk'hani inde yenyu mwo lupisi lwose nomwikale mwe isi. <verse eid="DEU 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 12:2" />Banangeni pele kila hant'hu, mwe milima mitali, mwe vigulu na mwa maziti, aho want'hu wa si nt'huhu wakuivika milungu yawe. <verse eid="DEU 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 12:3" />Moleni vilingo vawe vo kulavila nt'hambiko naho tuleni imikola yawe na kuyoka milungu yawe ya Ashela. Yokeni mahili ye milungu yawe mazina yawe yase kutambulwa naho kulawa hant'hu aho.”<verse eid="DEU 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 12:4" />“Msekumvika Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu enga ivo want'hu we isi ino wakuvika milungu yawe. <verse eid="DEU 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 12:5" />Zumbe naasagule hant'hu mwe Izilaeli yose aho want'hu naweze wamvike ho undiilo wakwe. <verse eid="DEU 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 12:6" />Nomwigale aho malavo yo kokwa pele na malavo matuhu na imwenya ya mlongo na malavo ugambile noulave, na malavo uungile kulava mwenye na malavo ya welekwa wa nk'hongo we zing'ombe ne zimbuzi ne zingoto zenyu. <verse eid="DEU 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 12:7" />Nyuwe ne zimp'huga zenyu niho nomdye na kuvionela kinyemi vint'hu vedi mvipatile kwa kudamanya ndima aho hant'hu ha kumvika Zumbe Mnungu uyo awavikileni.”<verse eid="DEU 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 12:8" />“Lupisi ulo lukwiza msekudamanya enga ivo nomkadamanya. Mpaka ivi kila mnt'hu avika enga ivo akuunga mwenye. <verse eid="DEU 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 12:9" />Kwaviya hamnati mbule kwe isi yo kuhumula iyo Zumbe Mnungu akuwenk'hani. <verse eid="DEU 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 12:10" />Mna mkeza kujink'ha mto Yolodani Zumbe naawatende mwiitahe isi na kwikala uumo. Naawamile na wank'hondo wenyu wose nanywe nomwikale kwa utodowazi. <verse eid="DEU 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 12:11" />Niho nomwigale kudya Zumbe asagule kuvikwa kila kint'hu icho asigiile, malavo yenyu yo kokwa na malavo matuhu na imwenga ya mlongo na malavo mkuunga wenye na kila kint'hu msagule kwa kuika kilapi kugamba nomumlavile Zumbe. <verse eid="DEU 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 12:12" />Nanywe nomnde na kinyemi aho hant'hu ha kumvika Zumbe Mnungu, nyuwe na wana wenyu wa kilume na wa kike, watumwa wenyu wa kilume na wa kike na Walawi we mwe mizi yenyu kwaviya hawana isi wapangilwe woho. <verse eid="DEU 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 12:13" />Mkaulise, msekulava malavo yenyu yo kokwa kila aho nomuone hamwelelani, <verse eid="DEU 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 12:14" />yalaveni du hant'hu hamwenga mwe isi iyo Zumbe Mnungu akuwenk'hani. Aho niho nomumlavile malavo yenyu yo kokwa pele na kudamanya yose niwasigiileni.”<verse eid="DEU 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 12:15" />“Mna mwadaha mkachinjila nyama zenyu mwo mzi wowose uwo nomsagule niyo mwadya viligane na ivo Zumbe Mnungu awavikileni, yazumilwe na heye zumilwe. Want'hu wose wazumilwe kumvika Zumbe na hewezumilwe kumvika wadaha kudya inyama iyo enga ivo mkudya mp'hala na nt'wika. <verse eid="DEU 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 12:16" />Mna msekuidya isakame, itileni du mwe sanga enga mazi. <verse eid="DEU 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 12:17" />Use kuvidiila kwako hant'hu ha mlongo nk'hande zako, na divai na mavuta, na welekwa wa nk'hongo we zing'ombe zako na mbuzi ne zingoto, hegu kilapi chochose wiikile, hegu malavo yako uungile mwenye hegu malavo yako yo kwinulwa yo mkono wako. <verse eid="DEU 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 12:18" />Nyuwe na wana wenyu hamwenga na wandima wenyu na Walawi wakwikala mwe mizi yenyu, mdye malavo ayo aho hant'hu Mnungu asagule. Nanywe nomnde na kinyemi aho hant'hu kwa kila kint'hu udamanye. <verse eid="DEU 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 12:19" />Naho kauliseni msekuwajala Walawi mwo lupisi lwose nomwikale mwe isi yenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 12:20" />“Umwo Zumbe Mnungu akeza kuyongezela isi yenyu enga ivo alongile nanywe nomdye nyama ivo nomuunge wenye. <verse eid="DEU 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 12:21" />Uneva hant'hu ahasagule Zumbe Mnungu hananda hale na weye, niho noudahe kuchinja ng'ombe hegu mbuzi hegu ngoto kulawa mwe difyo akwink'hile Zumbe enga ivo husigiile, weye nawe noudya mwe nyumba yako enga ivo hugambile. <verse eid="DEU 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 12:22" />Nomdye enga ivo mkudya nk'hulungu na kapala. Mnt'hu yeyose akanda kazumilwa hegu hazumilwe adaha kudya. <verse eid="DEU 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 12:23" />Mna mkaulise msekudya nyama na sakame yakwe, kwaviya sakame nuwo ugima. Elo msekudya ugima hamwenga na sakame. <verse eid="DEU 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 12:24" />Msekudya sakame, mna mwiitile mwe sanga enga mazi. <verse eid="DEU 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 12:25" />Msekudya sakame vileke mnde wahumi mwo wiakazi wenyu na wana wenyu mkadamanya yakumwelela Zumbe. <verse eid="DEU 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 12:26" />Mna malavo yako yakukile na vose wiikile kilapi kumlavila Zumbe nouka yalavile hant'hu aho Zumbe asagule kuvikwa. <verse eid="DEU 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 12:27" />Ukayalave malavo yako yo kokwa pele aho he kilingo cho kulavila malavo kwa Zumbe Mnungu ywako. Nyama ne sakame. Sakame ya nt'hambiko neitilwe he kilingo cho kulavila malavo kwa Zumbe Mnungu, mna inyama wadaha kuidya. <verse eid="DEU 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 12:28" />Kauliseni, naho mtimile aya huwasigiilani, mnatenda ivo nomvikilwe mwa mazuwa yo wikazi wenyu wose nyuwe ne veleko venyu vikwiza kwaviya nomnde mwadamanya yakumwelela Zumbe Mnungu.”<verse eid="DEU 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Want'hu wakanywa wase kuvika Mahili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 12:29" />“Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu naawakome want'hu we zi isi izo mkuzikump'hukila na kuzitaha na kuzikaila. Na kwikala mwe isi yawe, <verse eid="DEU 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 12:30" />Zumbe anajika kuwakoma pele want'hu we ziisi izo, mkaulise msekugeza kutimila enga ivo wakuvika milungu yawe kwaviya ivo neinde nk'hondo kwenyu. <verse eid="DEU 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 12:31" />Msekumvika Zumbe Mnungu enga ivo woho wavikaga milungu yawe, kwaviya mwo kuvika kwakwe watendaga mbuli zose zikumwiihiza Zumbe. Wawalavaga wana wawe enga malavo ya kokwa mwe vilingo vawe vo kulavila malavo.”<verse eid="DEU 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 12:32" />“Kauliseni mdamanyeni kila kint'hu niwasigiileni, msekongezela hegu kuhungula chochose mwa ayo.”<verse eid="DEU 12:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="DEU 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 13:1" />“Uneva kunalaila mwenyu mlotezi hegu mtapita sozi niyo alagisa vilagiso na va kweheela, <verse eid="DEU 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 13:2" />vileke awalongozeni mkavike milungu mituhu hayamanyike hata kwa wakale wenyu, naho hata uneva vilagiso va kweheela alongile valaila, <verse eid="DEU 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 13:3" />msekutegeleza zimbuli za mlotezi uyo hegu sozi za uyo alotile. Kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu naande awagezani akaule uneva mwamuunga Zumbe Mnungu kwa mioyo yenyu yose na kwo unt'hu wenyu wose. <verse eid="DEU 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 13:4" />Mtimileni Zumbe Mnungu na kumwogoha, nuyo ywo kumwiva na kumtimila. Mvikeni yehe naho mnde wahuilwa kwakwe. <verse eid="DEU 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 13:5" />Uyo mlotezi na walota sozi wakomwe kwaviya kawahiniza want'hu wasaguke kwa Zumbe Mnungu. Zumbe awalavileni kwe isi ya Misili na kuwakombolani kulawa kwe isi iyo mwandaga watumwa. Kwaviya uyo kageza kuwausani mwe sila iyo Zumbe Mnungu awasigiileni muitimile. Ivo nivo nouuse wiihi kulawa mwenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 13:6" />“Hata uneva ni nduguyo ywa hagihi, hegu mwanao ywa kilume hegu ywa kike hegu mkazio ukumuungisa, hegu mbuyayo ywa hagihi. Uneva analonga na weye kwa kinyele niyo akugamba mkavike milungu mituhu, milungu iyo wakale wenyu nazuwa hawaivikaga, <verse eid="DEU 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 13:7" />milungu ya want'hu ikuzunguluke, ikanda hale hegu hagihi na weye, kulawa kwo lumbili lumwenga lwe isi kuita lutuhu, <verse eid="DEU 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 13:8" />msekumzumila hegu kumtegeleza. Msekumuonela mbazi naho usekumwamila. <verse eid="DEU 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 13:9" />Mkomeni mnt'hu uyo! Naho weye unde ywa nk'hongo kumtowa maiwe, niho want'hu watuhu watimile. <verse eid="DEU 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 13:10" />Mtoweni maiwe Mnt'hu uyo abanike! Ageza kuwazaganyani mumleke Zumbe Mnungu uyo awalavileni Misili uko mwandaga watumwa. <verse eid="DEU 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 13:11" />Uneva mnawakoma want'hu awo, want'hu wose wa Izilaeli naweve icho kilaile niyo wogoha, hokunde na yeyose naadamanye wiihi enga uwo.”<verse eid="DEU 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 13:12" />“Mkekala mwe mizi iyo Zumbe Mnungu akuwenk'hani mwadaha kwiva <verse eid="DEU 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 13:13" />kugamba wamt'hu waihile mwenyu wawazaganya want'hu we mizi yawe vileke wavike milungu hemwa ivikaga uko nk'hongo. <verse eid="DEU 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 13:14" />Unaiva seselo iyo niho nawe nouuze na kupelemba. Uneva inanda ni kindedi kugamba uihi uwo noulaila, <verse eid="DEU 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 13:15" />wakomeni pele want'hu wo mzi uwo ne mifugwa yawe. Ubanange pele mzi uwo. <verse eid="DEU 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 13:16" />Viduganyileni ho lwazo lwo mzi ivint'hu vawe vose. Akajika muwoke mzi ne vint'hu vose kunda malavo yo kokwa pele akulavilwa Zumbe Mnungu. Mzi uwo nounde mank'halank'hala mazuwa yose, naho houzengwe vituhu. <verse eid="DEU 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 13:17" />Mse kuguha kint'hu chochose kinde chenyu mwe ivi vint'hu visengelwe kubanagwa, vileke Zumbe ahitule maya yakwe yatendese awaoneleni mbazi. Naawagenyezeni viligane ne Ndagano aikaga kwa wakale wenyu, <verse eid="DEU 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 13:18" />uneva du nomwive ayo alongile Zumbe Mnungu na kudamanya yakumwelela.”<verse eid="DEU 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="DEU 14" />
  <para style="s">Mihongezele heikuzumilwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 14:1" />“Nyuwe mwi wana Zumbe Mnungu. Mkahongeza kwajili ya mnt'hu abanike mse kukesenga sale hegu kukemoga kipala enga ivo wakutenda want'hu watuhu. <verse eid="DEU 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 14:2" />Kwaviya nyuwe mwi want'hu wakukile kwa Zumbe Mnungu. Zumbe kawasagulani nyuwe kulawa mwa want'hu wose wa si zose vileke mnde want'hu wakwe mwenye.”<verse eid="DEU 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makala yakukutenda use kuzumilwa umwo ukavika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 14:3" />“Msekudya kint'hu chochose hekizumilwe mwo kumvika Zumbe. <verse eid="DEU 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 14:4" />Mwadaha kudya ng'ombe na ngoto na mbuzi, <verse eid="DEU 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 14:5" />na nt'wika na vipala na nk'hongoni mbala na mp'hofu na ngulugulu. <verse eid="DEU 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 14:6" />Mwadaha kudya nyama za makala yana ngaga zikepangile naho yaseula. <verse eid="DEU 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 14:7" />Mna msekudya nyama ya kala hedikuseula naho hadina ngaga zikepangile. Msekudya ngamia na kabuga na mp'helele. Makala ayo yaseula mna hayana ngaga zikepangile, ayo hayazumilwe. <verse eid="DEU 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 14:8" />Naho msekudya nguluwe, hamwenga na kugamba zina ngaga zikepangile mna hazi kuseula. Msekudya inyama yakwe naho msekutoza ivimba vawe.”<verse eid="DEU 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 14:9" />“Samaki zose zina vilamba na magwalatu mwadaha kudya. <verse eid="DEU 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 14:10" />Mna kiumbwa chochose kikwikala mwa mazi mna hakina vilamba na magwalatu msekudya inyama yakwe kwaviya unavidya ivo nevikutende use kuzumilwa kwo kuvika.”<verse eid="DEU 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 14:11" />“Mwadaha kudya madege yose yazumilwe. <verse eid="DEU 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 14:12" />Mna msekudya madege enga aya: Sumula na mp'hungu na, <verse eid="DEU 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 14:13" />Ndegenyika na kasoka na mzinge, <verse eid="DEU 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 14:14" />mwewe dink'hundu na mamwewe yose ye hengi amatitu, <verse eid="DEU 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 14:15" />na makungulu yose yehengi <verse eid="DEU 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 14:16" />Mbuguni na lugawa na dudumizi na visoka vihengi na mamwewe yose ye hengi, <verse eid="DEU 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 14:17" />makungwi ye hengi, <verse eid="DEU 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 14:18" />na fulindi na mzinge na yangeyange.”<verse eid="DEU 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 14:19" />Msekudya vidudu vose vina mawawa yakuvumila. Havizumilwe. <verse eid="DEU 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 14:20" />Mna viduvidu vose vina mawawa heye kuvumila vizumilwa, mwadaha kudya.<verse eid="DEU 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 14:21" />“Msekudya kiumbwa chochose kifile chenye. Mwadaha kuwenk'ha watakwiza wakwikala mwo mzi wenyu hegu du mwadaha kumtagila mtakwiza. Mna nyuwe mwi want'hu wakukile wa Zumbe Mnugu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 14:21">“Naho msekunyemsa nyama ya mwana mbuzi mwe mele ya nine.”<verse eid="DEU 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sigilizi ye imwenga ya mlongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 14:22" />“Usekuleka kupagula imwenga ya mlongo kulawa mwo ulozo wako we kwe nk'honde wa kila mwaka. <verse eid="DEU 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 14:23" />Udye imwenga ya mlongo ye nk'hande ne ye divai mp'ya na mavuta ya zeituni na welekwa wa nk'hongo we mifugwa yako. Widiile hant'hu hasagulwe ni Zumbe kugamba want'hu wamvike aho. Damanyeni ivi vileke mhine kumvika Zumbe Mnungu mazuwa yose. <verse eid="DEU 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 14:24" />Uneva aho hant'hu hale, Zumbe naye kakuvikila, naho hukudaha kwinula iyo imwenga ya mlongo Zumbe Mnungu akuvikile, <verse eid="DEU 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 14:25" />tageni ivint'hu ivo niyo mwayegala matundu ayo hant'hu hasagulwe kumvika Zumbe Mnungu. <verse eid="DEU 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 14:26" />Matundu ayo myaguile kint'hu chochose ikanda ni nyama ya ng'ombe hegu ya mbuzi hegu ya ngoto hegu divai hegu mp'hombe, hegu chochose nouunge. Akajika mvidiile hant'hu hasagulwe ni Zumbe kugamba want'hu wamvike aho.”<verse eid="DEU 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 14:27" />“Naho msekuwajala Walawi awo mkwikalanya nawo mwe mizi yenyu kwaviya woho hawana upasi hegu ukipe wawe. <verse eid="DEU 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 14:28" />Mwo uheelo wa kila mwaka wa katatu, nomwigale ziya imwenga za mlongo zo ulozo na kuziika mwa magulu ye mizi yenyu. <verse eid="DEU 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 14:29" />Izo nezinde kwajili ya Walawi hewenk'higwe hant'hu mwe isi kunda hawe, na watakwiza na wanank'hiwa na wabanikilwe ni wagosi zawe wakwikala mwe mizi yenyu. Awo naweze wadye na kwiguta, naivo Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu naawavikileni mwe zindima zenyu zose mkudamanya.”<verse eid="DEU 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="DEU 15" />
  <para style="s">Mwaka wo mfungate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 15:1" />“Kila mwo uheelo wa kila mwaka wa mfungate nomuwalekele wose mkuwatigiza. <verse eid="DEU 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 15:2" />Ivo nivo nomdamanye. Kila yumwenga amkopeshe Mwizilaeli miyawe, ahause diliho idyo naho asekugeza kumgamba amlihe kwaviya Zumbe mwenye niye aungile liho idyo dihauswe. <verse eid="DEU 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 15:3" />Mwadaha kuwagamba wata kwiza wawaliheni mna Muizilaeli miyao nomlekele.”<verse eid="DEU 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 15:4" />“Zumbe Mnungu nawavikile mwe isi akuwenk'hani kunda ugoli wenyu. Hahande na mnt'hu mkiwa mwa nyuwe, <verse eid="DEU 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 15:5" />uneva du mnamwiva na kumtimila kwa wengele kwa kiya akuwasigiilani dielo. <verse eid="DEU 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 15:6" />Ayo nayalaile kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu naawavikile enga ivo alongile. Nanywe nomzikopeshe si nyingi, mna nyuwe homkope. Mna si nt'huhu nezidamanye enga ivo mkuunga nyuwe mna nyuwe homdamanye enga ivo zikuunga si nt'huhu.”<verse eid="DEU 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 15:7" />“Uneva eyuko Mwizilaeli miyenyu mkiwa mwe isi iyo Zumbe Mnungu akuwenk'hani, msekunda wagila kwake na kulemela kumwambiza. <verse eid="DEU 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 15:8" />Vituhu vakwe, mkopesheni kwa kuunga nyuwe wenye ivo vikumkint'ha mwenye. <verse eid="DEU 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 15:9" />Kauliseni mbuli ihile isekunda mwe miyoyo yenyu, mkagamba, mwaka wa mfungate ni mwaka wa kuwalekela awo kiwakopeshe nawo wihagihi, niyo mwawakaula wandugu zenyu wakiwa kwa wiihi na kulemela kuwenk'ha chochose, woho wadaha kumwiila Zumbe kwajili yenyu nanywe nomnde na masa. <verse eid="DEU 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 15:10" />Mwink'heni ndugu ywenyu mkiwa kwa moyo wedi haheina kulabila, kwa ayo, Zumbe Mnungu naawavikile mwe zindima zenyu zose na kila kint'hu nomdamanye. <verse eid="DEU 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 15:11" />Kwaviya hokuswese kunda na wakiwa mwe isi yenyu, ivo nawaungani, mnde wakise kwa wandugu zenyu, na kwa wakiwa na kwa want'hu heweina kint'hu mwe isi yenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ivo wakutendelwa Watumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 15:12" />“Uneva nduguyo Mwizilaeli, mgosi hegu mvele anatagwa kwako, naakudamanyile ndima kwa miyaka mtandatu, mna mwo mwaka wa mfungate umlekele. <verse eid="DEU 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 15:13" />Umwo weye nawe unamlekela, usekumleka aite haena kint'hu. <verse eid="DEU 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 15:14" />Mwink'he kwa ukise kiya Zumbe akuvikile, ngoto na unga na divai. <verse eid="DEU 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 15:15" />Kumbukileni kugamba nyuwe nomnda watumwa kudya Misili naho Zumbe Mnungu nakawakombolani, nivo vikuleka nawasigiilani ivo dielo.”<verse eid="DEU 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 15:16" />“Mna uyo mtumwa analemela kuhalawa hako, kwaviya akuungisa weye ne mp'huga yako naho mwikalanya vedi, <verse eid="DEU 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 15:17" />ivo, nouguhe singano na kumponk'hola mwe digutwi dyakwe mpaka iyo singano ingile mwo lwivi yehe naye naande mtumwa ywako mazuwa yose. Naho noumtendele iivo mtumwa ywako ywe kivele. <verse eid="DEU 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 15:18" />Naho usekuona vidala kumlekela mtumwa ywako, kwaviya kakudamanyila ndima kwa miyaka mtandatu kwa hant'hu hamwenga mwe viidi viligane va maliho ndima. Damanya ivo, na Zumbe Mnungu naakuvikile kwa kiya noudamanye.”<verse eid="DEU 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Welekwa wa nk'hongo we ng'ombe ne zimbuzi na zingoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 15:19" />“Mpaguileni Zumbe Mnungu, welekwa wa nk'hongo we zing'ombe ne zimbuzi ne zingoto. Usekuzidamanyiza ndima ng'ombe. Zimbuzi ne zingoto nazo usekuzikant'ha mazoya. <verse eid="DEU 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 15:20" />Kila mwaka, weye ne mp'huga yako mwiidiile nyama iyo hant'hu hasagulwe ni Zumbe kugamba want'hu wamvike aho. <verse eid="DEU 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 15:21" />Mna mfugwa uwo unanda na lema dyodyose diya, usekumlavila Zumbe Mnungu, Mnungu ywako. <verse eid="DEU 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 15:22" />Nomdye nyama iyo ukanda mwo mzi wako, naho wose wana uwedi hegu heweina uwedi wadaha kudya enga ivo wakudya nyama ya kapala hegu ya nk'hongoni. <verse eid="DEU 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 15:23" />Mna usekudya sakame yakwe, uitile du hasi enga mazi.”<verse eid="DEU 15:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="DEU 16" />
  <para style="s">Kinyemi che dizuwa dye Pasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 16:1" />“Kumbukileni dizuwa dye kinyemi dye Pasaka mwezi wa Abihu na kumtunya Zumbe Mnungu. Kwaviya mwo mwezi wa Abihu, niho awayokolagani kulawa Misili nekilo. <verse eid="DEU 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 16:2" />Nomlave malavo ya Pasaka kulawa mwe mifugwa yenyu ya ngoto hegu ng'ombe na mbuzi kwa kumtunya Zumbe Mnungu hant'hu hamwenga ha kumvika. <verse eid="DEU 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 16:3" />Msekudya malavo ayo na mikate igeligwe ugwadu, nayo ni mikate ya makunt'ho, kwaviya nomsunguza kulawa Misili. Kwa mazuwa yose nomwikale mkakumbukila dizuwa diya mlawile Misili uko mwandile mkasulumila. <verse eid="DEU 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 16:4" />Kwa mazuwa mfungate mnt'hu yeyose asekugela ugwadu isi yakwe na mwe kaya yakwe, na nyama ya udya mfugwa uchinjigwe kisingi ye dizuwa dya nk'hongo isekusigala mpaka mtondo.”<verse eid="DEU 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 16:5" />“Msekulava malavo ya Pasaka mwo mzi wowose udya Mnungu naawenk'heni. <verse eid="DEU 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 16:6" />Vituhu vakwe nomwilavile hadya Zumbe Mnungu ahasagule hande hant'hu ha kumvika. Aho niho nomlave malavo ya Pasaka, umwo kisingi zuwa dikaswa mwo lupisi uludya mwahalawaga Misili. <verse eid="DEU 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 16:7" />Iyo inyama nomuitipwilise na kuidya hant'hu aho Zumbe Mnungu naahasagule, naho mtondo wakwe nomhituke na kuuya mwa mahema yenyu. <verse eid="DEU 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 16:8" />Kwa mazuwa mtandatu nomdye mikate heigeligwe ugwadu, naho mwe dizuwa dya mfungate nahande na mdugano mkulu wa kumvika Zumbe Mnungu, msekudamanya ndima yeyose mwe dizuwa idyo.”<verse eid="DEU 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zuwa dye kinyemi dyo Uvuni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 16:9" />“Nomuwaze mazuwa mfungate, naho nomkonge kuwaza kukongela aho nomwize mvune, <verse eid="DEU 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 16:10" />nomdamanye kinyemi cha mazuwa kwa kumtunya Zumbe Mnungu, Mnungu ywenyu, kwa kulava malavo ya kuunga mwenye, nomuyalave ivo Mnungu akuwavikilani. <verse eid="DEU 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 16:11" />Nomwinde na kinyemi hant'hu asagulwe kumvika Zumbe Mnungu, nyuwe hamwenga na wana wenyu na wandima wenyu Walawi na wata kwiza na wana nk'hiwa na wafiilwe ni wagosiwe awo wakwikala na nyuwe. Damanyeni aya hant'hu aho hasagulwe ni Mnungu. <verse eid="DEU 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 16:12" />Mkumbukile kugamba, mwandaga watumwa kudya Misili, ivo mnde na wengele kutimila sigilizi izi.”<verse eid="DEU 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dizuwa dye Kinyemi dye viheha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 16:13" />“Umwo mkajika kuvuna nk'hande yenyu na kuminya zizabibu zenyu, damanyeni zuwa dye kinyemi dye viheha kwa mazuwa mfungate. <verse eid="DEU 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 16:14" />Zuwa idyo dya mfungate nomdamanye kinyemi, nyuwe na wana wenyu wa kilume na wa kivele, na wandima wenyu Walawi na wata kwiza na yatima na wafiilwe ni wagosiwe awo wakwikala mwe mizi yenyu. <verse eid="DEU 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 16:15" />Kwa mazuwa mfungate na zuwa dya kinyemi kwa Zumbe Mnungu aho hant'hu ha kumvika. Kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu naawavikileni mwo uvuni wenyu na mwe zindima zenyu zose mkudamanya naho kinyemi chenyu nekinde kikint'ha.”<verse eid="DEU 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 16:16" />“Wagosi wose wa Izilaeli naweze ha Zumbe Mnungu nk'hanana nt'hatu kila mwaka, aho ho kuvikila. Mwo lupisi lwe kinyemi che mikate heigeligwe ugwadu, na kinyemi cho uvuni na kinyemi che viheha. Kila mnt'hu neegale malavo yakwe, <verse eid="DEU 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 16:17" />enga ivo naadahe viligane naivo Zumbe Mnungu akuvikile.”<verse eid="DEU 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walamuzi wo Uwagilwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 16:18" />“Nomsagule walamuzi na wakulu kulawa mwa makabila yenyu mwe mizi yenyu iyo Zumbe Mnungu naawenk'heni. Awo nawo nawalave ulamuzi wa uwagilwa mwa want'hu. <verse eid="DEU 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 16:19" />Msekwazaganya ikindedi, naho msekwazagula naho msekuzumila kuhokela kint'hu chochose kikutenda mlamuzi mta umanyi asekulamula kwa uwagilwa. <verse eid="DEU 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 16:20" />Nomuwasengele want'hu kwa kutimila ikindedi, vileke mdahe kwikala na kwiikaila isi iyo Zumbe Mnungu akuwenk'hani.”<verse eid="DEU 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 16:21" />“Umwo mkazenga kilingo kwajili ya Zumbe Mnungu mse kukimalisa mkola wa hili disongolwe dya ziti dya mnungu Ashela. <verse eid="DEU 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 16:22" />Naho msekukimalisa mkola wa maiwe akuwiihiya Zumbe Mnungu.”<verse eid="DEU 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="DEU 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 17:1" />“Msekulava malavo ya ng'ombe hegu ngoto ina lema dyodyose kwa Zumbe Mnungu, kwaviya ayo yamwiihiza Zumbe.”<verse eid="DEU 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 17:2" />“Mwadaha kwiva kugamba yumwenga ywenyu mwo mzi wenyu, mgosi hegu mvele kadamanya uwihi, na kubananga Indagano ya Zumbe Mnungu, <verse eid="DEU 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 17:3" />kwa kuidamanyila ndima na kuivika milungu mituhu, hegu zuwa hegu mwezi hegu nt'hondo, heviiligane ne sigilizi ya Zumbe. <verse eid="DEU 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 17:4" />Uneva nyuwe nanywe no mgambilwa ayo, nomkaule, uneva ni kindedi kint'hu iki kiihile kidamanywa mwe Izilaeli, <verse eid="DEU 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 17:5" />mlaveni kuse yo mzi mnt'hu uyo niyo mwamtowa maiwe mpaka abanike. <verse eid="DEU 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 17:6" />Hata ivo naakomwe uneva kuna uwona wa want'hu waidi hegu watatu. Asekukomwa uneva uwona ni wa mnt'hu yumwenga du. <verse eid="DEU 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 17:7" />Wadya waona wakonge woho kumtowa maiwe, akajika watimile watuhu. Ivo nivo nomuuse uwihi uno mwenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 17:8" />“Yadahika masa yamwenga nayande madala kulamulwa aho he kaya yenyu enga via kukoma haheina kukambila, hegu kumlumiza mnt'hu mtuhu, na masa ya kugombela ugoli mwa want'hu. Igaleni masa ayo hant'hu hasagulwe ni Zumbe Mnungu, Mnungu ywenyu. <verse eid="DEU 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 17:9" />Nomwigale masa ayo kwa walavant'hambiko walawi na kwa mlamuzi we dizuwa idyo, woho nawo nawalamule masa ayo. <verse eid="DEU 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 17:10" />Ivo nawalamule aho hant'hu hasagulwe ni Zumbe. Unde na wengele kudamanya kila kint'hu wakuunga wakulangilize kukidamanya. <verse eid="DEU 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 17:11" />Neiwaunge mdamanye kutimila sigilizi nomwink'higwe no ulamuzi wakuulava kwenyu. Msekuleka kutimila usengelo wakuunga waulave. <verse eid="DEU 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 17:12" />Mnt'hu hekumwiva mlava nt'hambiko hegu mlamuzi aikigwe kumdamanyila ndima Zumbe Mnungu akomwe. Nivo nomuuse uwihi enga uno mwenyu. <verse eid="DEU 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 17:13" />Want'hu wose naweve na kogoha naho hahali mnt'hu naageze kudamanya wiihi enga uno naho.”<verse eid="DEU 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sigilizi kwa seuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 17:14" />“Aho mkeza kwingila mwe isi iyo Zumbe Mnungu naawenk'heni na kwikala, naywe niyo mwaona kugamba ni vedi kunda na seuta enga ivo zili isi nt'huhu ziwazungulukeni. <verse eid="DEU 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 17:15" />Mmanye kindedi kugamba mnt'hu mkumsagula kunda seuta niye asagulwe ni Zumbe. Vaungwa ande yumwenga ywa want'hu wenyu. Msekumsagula mta kwiza ande seuta ywenyu. <verse eid="DEU 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 17:16" />Hata ivo asekunda na Falasi nyingi kwaajili ya watowani wakwe, naho asekuwavuza want'hu uko Misili vileke andilise na Falasi nyingi, kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu kawakanya sema wanauye naho uko Misili. <verse eid="DEU 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 17:17" />Naho asekunda na wavele wengi, saivo moyo wakwe noihituke, naho asekunda na masawa mengi na zahabu nyingi. <verse eid="DEU 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 17:18" />Akanda kekaila difumbi dyo useuta vamuunga ande ne kitabu kiwandikwe zisigilizi izi zilaile kwa walava nt'hambiko wa Kilawi. <verse eid="DEU 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 17:19" />Naho naande ne kitabu icho na kukisoma mazuwa yose yo wikazi wakwe, vileke ahine kumogoha Zumbe Mnungu na kutimila sigilizi zakwe na malagizo yakwe kwa uhuilwa. <verse eid="DEU 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 17:20" />Uneva anatenda ivo, haakeone kunda ywedi kujink'ha wanduguze Waizilaeli, na kuleka kumwiva Zumbe na kutimila sigilizi zakwe kwa sila yoyose idya. Kwa ivo neekalise mwo useuta, yehe mwenye na welekwa wakwe mwe Izilaeli.”<verse eid="DEU 17:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="DEU 18" />
  <para style="s">Upasi kwa walava nt'hambiko na Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 18:1" />“Walava nt'hambiko wose we dikabila dya Lawi hawapangilwe hant'hu mwe isi vileke hande hawe. Woho nawekale kwa malavo ya Zumbe Mnungu. <verse eid="DEU 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 18:2" />Naho hawande na hant'hu hawe enga ivo weli wandugu zawe. Upasi wawe ni kunda walava nt'hambiko wa Zumbe enga ivo Zumbe alongile.”<verse eid="DEU 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 18:3" />“Na ino neinde uwagilwa wa walava nt'hambiko kulawa kwa want'hu wakulava malavo inde ng'ombe hegu ngoto nawawenk'he walavant'hambiko, mikono njeje na utombo. <verse eid="DEU 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 18:4" />Nomuwenk'he ulozo wa nk'hongo wa nk'hande na divai mp'ya na mavuta na mazoya yakukant'hwa nk'hongo ye zingoto zako. <verse eid="DEU 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 18:5" />Mwe makabila yenyu yose, Zumbe Mnungu kasagula kabila dya Walawi dimdamanyile ndima enga walava nt'hambiko mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="DEU 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 18:6" />“Mna Mlawi yeyose anaunga mwenye adaha kulawa mwo mzi wowose udya wa Izilaeli na kuita hadya Zumbe Mnungu naahasagule, <verse eid="DEU 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 18:7" />naho adaha kudamanya ndima aho enga mlava nt'hambiko wa Zumbe Mnungu, enga wadya Walawi watuhu wakudamanya ndima aho. <verse eid="DEU 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 18:8" />Nawapate upasi wawe wo kudya, hamwega na kugamba wana vint'hu vikulawa mwe zindima za wandugu zawe.”<verse eid="DEU 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makanyo mwe vint'hu akuviihia Zumbe Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 18:9" />“Aho mkeza mpaka kwe isi idya mkwink'higwa ni Zumbe Mnungu, msekutimila vihendo viihile ve isi iyo. <verse eid="DEU 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 18:10" />Hasekunda na mnt'hu yeyose mwa nyuwe naamwoke mwanawe we kilume hegu ywe kike kunda malavo ya kokwa, akukaula mnamulo kwa misimo iihile, akutowa msia, <verse eid="DEU 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 18:11" />hegu msai wa hilizi, na akukweza mp'hepo na msai hegu mnt'hu akulonga na wabanike. <verse eid="DEU 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 18:12" />Kwaviya yeyose naadamanye ayo amwiihiza Zumbe, na kwaajili ya mbuli izi, Zumbe Mnungu awagulusa want'hu wakudamanya ayo, umwo nyuwe mkengila. <verse eid="DEU 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 18:13" />Mnde wahuilwa kwa Zumbe Mnungu.”<verse eid="DEU 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndagano ya kwigailwa mlotezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 18:14" />Musa niyo agamba, “Want'hu we si izi nomzikaile waita kwa wagangana na wakutoa milamulo, mna Zumbe Mnungu hakuunga nyuwe mdamanye mbuli enga izo. <verse eid="DEU 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 18:15" />Vituhu vakwe Zumbe Mnungu naawasaguileni mlotezi mtuhu enga miye kulawa mwenyu naho mwaungwa mmwive na kumtimila.”<verse eid="DEU 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 18:16" />“Icho nicho mumlombeze Zumbe Mnungu kudya kwo mnima Sinai mwe dizuwa diya dyo mdugano. Mwalombezaga kugamba hamkuunga kwiva naho Zumbe akalonga na nyuwe hegu kuuona naho uno umoto mkulu sema mnabanike. <verse eid="DEU 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 18:17" />Zumbe Mnungu nae niyo anigamba, ‘Ayo walongile ni kindedi. <verse eid="DEU 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 18:18" />Neniwasaguileni mwa wandugu zenyu mlotezi enga weye, nenigele ulosi wangu mwo mnomo wakwe, yehe naye naawagambileni yose nenimgambile. <verse eid="DEU 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 18:19" />Yeyose yudya heeve ulosi uwo naalonge mlotezi uyo kwa udahi wangu, miye mwenye nenimsengele. <verse eid="DEU 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 18:20" />Mna mlotezi mtuhu naalonge kwa udahi wa milungu mituhu, hegu naageze kulonga mbuli yeyose kwa udahi wangu ikanda himgambile alonge, uyo mlotezi naabanike.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 18:21" />“Nyuwe nanywe mwadaha kwehelwa kugamba nomuumanye vivihi ulosi houlawile kwa Zumbe? <verse eid="DEU 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 18:22" />Uneva mlotezi analonga kint'hu kwa udahi wa Zumbe mna kint'hu icho hakikudamanyika hegu kunda kindedi, mbuli iyo halongile Zumbe. Mlotezi uyo kakelongela kwa udahi wakwe mwenye, msekumwogoha mlotezi uyo.”<verse eid="DEU 18:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="DEU 19" />
  <para style="s">Mizi yo kunyilikila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 19:1" />“Umwo Zumbe Mnungu akeza kuwakoma pele want'hu we isi iyo akuwenk'hani niyo mwaiguha mizi yawe ne zinyumba zawe na kwikala uko, <verse eid="DEU 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 19:2" />nompagule mizi mitatu yakunyilikila mwe isi iyo mkwink'higwa ni Zumbe Mnungu. <verse eid="DEU 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 19:3" />Nouipange isi nk'hanana nt'hatu naho kila mzi unde mhufu kwingilwa, vileke yeyose akumkoma miyawe haheina kukambila, naanyilike mwo umwenga mwe mizi iyo. <verse eid="DEU 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 19:4" />Mnt'hu akumkoma miyawe haheina kukambila, naho yehe handile mnk'hondo ywakwe, mnt'hu uyo adaha kunyilikila mwo umwenga we mizi iyo na kukeyokola mwenye. <verse eid="DEU 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 19:5" />Enga viya, mnt'hu akuita na miyawe kwe mbago akakele nk'huni, umwo akaukela umti, hoya niyo yasomoka kulawa mwo mhini wakwe na kumkoma yudya mtuhu, mnt'hu uyo adaha kunyilikila mwo umwenga we mizi iyo vileke akeyokole mwenye. <verse eid="DEU 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 19:6" />Mna uneva nokunda na mzi umwenga du, mzi utendesa uhale. Uyo akuunga alihize adaha kumgulusa na kumgwila niyo amkoma kwa maya myawe hebanange dyodyose. Mna nakanda hakambile kumkoma miyawe uyo andile hiyo mnk'hondo ywakwe. <verse eid="DEU 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 19:7" />Ivi nivo vikuleka nawasigiila muipagule mizi iyo mitatu.”<verse eid="DEU 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 19:8" />“Naho uneva Zumbe Mnungu anongezela mihaka yenyu ye isi, enga ivo awagambilaga wakale wenyu na kuwenk'ha isi yose alaganaga kuwenk'ha awo wakale wenyu, niho nomsagule mizi mituhu mitatu. <verse eid="DEU 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 19:9" />Naawenk'heni isi ino uneva nomdamanye kila kint'hu huwasigiilani dielo, naho uneva nommuunge Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu na kwikala kwa kutimila mahinizo yakwe, <verse eid="DEU 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 19:10" />ipaguleni mizi iyo vileke mnt'hu heena masa asekukomwa mwe isi yenyu iyo Zumbe Mnungu nawenk'heni inde yenyu, na kuwatenda mnde na masa ya kukoma.”<verse eid="DEU 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 19:11" />“Mna mnt'hu ananda mnk'hondo ywa miyawe, na kumvima na kum kup'hukila niyo amkoma na kunyilikila mwo mzi umwenga mwa iyo. <verse eid="DEU 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 19:12" />Niho wadala vilongozi wo mzi uwo na wasigiile want'hu wamfoseze uko kwo mzi na kumwink'hiza kwa yudya mndugu akuunga alihize vileke akomwe. <verse eid="DEU 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 19:13" />Msekumuonela mbazi mnt'hu uyo. Ivo nivo nomhause uwihi wo ukomi wa mnt'hu heina masa mwe Izilaeli, vileke mpate ayedi.”<verse eid="DEU 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mihaka ya kale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 19:14" />“Aho mkeza kwingila mwe isi mkwink'higwa ni Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu inde yenyu msekuusa viwalo ve mihaka ya want'hu we hagihi na nyuwe ivo vaikagwa ni kale wenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miko mwe mbuli yo Uwona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 19:15" />“Uwona wa mnt'hu yumwenga haukudaha kumsengela mnt'hu mwa masa yeyose adamanye. Ni uwona wa want'hu waidi hegu watatu nuwo ukuungwa. <verse eid="DEU 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 19:16" />Uneva muwona aihile kalaila na kumlongeleza mnt'hu yeyose mwa masa, <verse eid="DEU 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 19:17" />ivo yehe na uyo alongelezwe mwa masa ayo nawaite hant'hu ha hakuvikila, na ha mlava nt'hambiko na walamuzi wo lupisi ulo naho nawa sengelwe. <verse eid="DEU 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 19:18" />Walamuzi awo nawakaulise kwa wengele malongelezo ayo naho, inanda muwona uyo ni mlulimi naho kamlongeleza miyawe kwa lulimi, <verse eid="DEU 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 19:19" />ivo, nomumdamanyile enga ivo naakaunga amdamanyile nduguye. Ivo nivo mkuunga muhause wiihi uwo mwe Izilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 19:20" />Naho want'hu watuhu naweve na kogoha. Wiihi enga uwo houdamanyike naho mwenyu. <verse eid="DEU 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 19:21" />Msekuwaonela mbazi want'hu enga awo. Ugima noulihwe kwa ugima, ziso kwa ziso, zino kwa zino, umkono kwa mkono, kiga nacho nekilihigwe kwa kiga.”<verse eid="DEU 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="DEU 20" />
  <para style="s">Miko ya kwe nk'hondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 20:1" />“Mkeza kuita kwe nk'hondo na kokutoana na wank'hondo wenyu, na kuziona zifalasi na magali yakuvutwa ni Falasi na fyo kulu dya wank'hondo kujink'ha idyenyu msekogoha. Kwaviya nomndanye na Zumbe Mnungu awalavile Misili. <verse eid="DEU 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 20:2" />Umwo mkanda hamnati kukonga nk'hondo, mlava nt'hambiko naafose kulongole na kuwagamba watoani, <verse eid="DEU 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 20:3" />‘Want'hu wa Iziaeli tegelezeni! Dielo mwihagihi na kutoana na wank'hondo wenyu. Msekogoha hegu kwingila chevu naho wasekumitisani. <verse eid="DEU 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 20:4" />Kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu niye naaite na nyuwe kokutoana na wank'hondo wenyu na kuwenk'hani nyuwe uhumi.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 20:5" />“Niho wakulu wa watowani nawawagambe watowani, ‘Togoleni, eyuko mnt'hu yeyose azengile nyumba mp'ya mna hanati ailimbule? Auye kaya, sema akabanikila kwe nk'hondo niyo nyumba iyo yalimbulwa ni mnt'hu mtuhu. <verse eid="DEU 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 20:6" />Togoleni, eyuko mnt'hu yeyose ahandile mizabibu naho hanati kudya matunda yakwe? Auye kaya, sema anakabanikila kwe nk'hondo niyo mnt'hu mtuhu aonela kinyemi ukudya matunda yakwe. <verse eid="DEU 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 20:7" />Togoleni eyuko mnt'hu yeyose aha atumize mvele naho ehagihi na kulomba? Auye kaya, sema anabanikile kwe nk'hondo niyo mnt'hu mtuhu amlomba uyo mtumizwa.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 20:8" />“Wakulu wa watowani nawagendele kuwagambila want'hu, ‘Togoleni eyaho mnt'hu afile chevu? Auye kaya, sema anatende weyawe wafe chevu enga yehe <verse eid="DEU 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 20:9" />Wakulu wa watowani awo wanajika kulonga na watoani, wakimalizi wa mafyo nawasagulwe kwa kila fyo dodo dya watowani.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 20:10" />“Mkeza kunda hagihi kuukump'hukila umzi, nomnde kuwauza uneva wazumila kuhumwa haheina kutowana. <verse eid="DEU 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 20:11" />Wakaya awo wazumila kuhumwa haheina kutowana na kuwakomwoelani zink'hili, niho want'hu wose awo weyaho nawande watumwa wenyu na kudamanya ndima kwa kutigizwa. <verse eid="DEU 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 20:12" />Mna want'hu wo mzi uwo wanalemela niyo wusagula kutowana na nyuwe, ivo nomuwakindile kwa kuuzunguluka mzi wawe ne difyo dya watowani wenyu, <verse eid="DEU 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 20:13" />naye Zumbe Mnungu anawatendani mdahe kuutaha, nomuwakome wagosi wose. <verse eid="DEU 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 20:14" />Mna wavele na wana na ng'ombe na vose viyumo mwo mzi, mwadaha kuviguha vit'hu vose kwaajili yenyu nyuwe wenye. Ivint'hu ivo Zumbe Mnungu amink'hileni kulawa kwa wank'hondo wenyu. <verse eid="DEU 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 20:15" />Nivo nomwiitende mizi yose ihale ne isi mkugenda kwikala.”<verse eid="DEU 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 20:16" />“Mna uneva mnaitaha mizi ye isi iyo, Zumbe Mnungu akuwenk'hani komeni kila kint'hu. <verse eid="DEU 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 20:17" />Nomkome pele, Wahiti na Waamoli, Wakanaani na Wapelezi, Wahivi na Wayebusi enga ivo Zumbe Mnungu awasigiileni mdamanye. <verse eid="DEU 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 20:18" />Wakomeni sema wanawahinizeni kutimila vint'hu vikuihiza ivo wakudamanya mwo kuvika milungu yawe niyo mwadamanya wavu ha Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 20:19" />“Mnaukindila kwa kuuzunguluka mzi kwa mazuwa mengi mkatoana vileke muutahe, msekubananga miti yakwe kwa kuikant'ha. Kwaviya mwadaha kudya matunda yakwe. Togoleni, miti ni wank'hondo vikuleka muikump'hukile? <verse eid="DEU 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 20:20" />Mwadaha du kukant'ha miti hi ya matunda kwa kudamanyila mihindo ya kukweela mwe digomela umwo mkaukump'hukila umzi uwo mpaka muutahe.”<verse eid="DEU 20:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="DEU 21" />
  <para style="s">Ukomi hewiina ulamuzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 21:1" />“ Uneva mnt'hu ananda kakoma kwe mbago mwe isi iyo awenk'hileni Zumbe Mnungu, nanywe hammanyize amkomile, <verse eid="DEU 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 21:2" />wadala vilongozi na walamuzi wenyu nawafose na kuhima uhale wa hant'hu kimba aho kili mpaka mzi wa hagihi. <verse eid="DEU 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 21:3" />Niyo, wadala wo mzi wi hagihi na kiya kimba nawaguhe kadama hekenati kudamanyila ndima yeyose. <verse eid="DEU 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 21:4" />Wadala vilongozi wo mzi uwo nawaigale indama iyo kwa kazuto ka mazi yakuseela uko isanga yakwe hainati ilimigwe hegu kuhandwa, uko nawaigogole isingo indama iyo. <verse eid="DEU 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 21:5" />Walava nt'hambiko nawo wana wa Lawi nawaite uko kwaviya woho nawo wakulamula kila masa ya nk'humbizi. Zumbe Mnungu kawasagula wamdamanyile ndima na kuvikila want'hu kwa zina dyakwe. <verse eid="DEU 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 21:6" />Akajika wadala wose we hagihi na uko akomelwe uyo mnt'hu wasunt'he mikono yawe mnanga mwe ndama idya, <verse eid="DEU 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 21:7" />na kugamba, ‘Hakimkomile mnt'hu uyo naho hakimmanyize amkomile. <verse eid="DEU 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 21:8" />Zumbe uwausile wavu want'hu wako wa Izilaeli uwakombole kulawa Misili, naho use kukigela mwa masa ya kumkoma mnt'hu hebanange dyodyose.’ ” <verse eid="DEU 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 21:9" />Kwa kudamanya ivo homnde na masa ya kukoma kwaviya mdamanya enga ivo Zumbe akuunga.<verse eid="DEU 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wavele watahigwe kwe nk'hondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 21:10" />“Umwo mkagenda kutowana na wank'hondo wenyu, Zumbe Mnungu naye ana watendani muwahume na kuwataha, <verse eid="DEU 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 21:11" />niyo mwaona mvele mtana uyo ukumuunga naho waunga umlombe, <verse eid="DEU 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 21:12" />mguhe umwigale kwe kaya yako naamoge fili za mwo mtwi na kukant'ha makombe yakwe, <verse eid="DEU 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 21:13" />naavale suke zakwe nt'huhu. Neekale mwe nyumba yako na kuwahongezela welesi wakwe kwa lupisi lwa mwezi umwenga ikajika aho umlombe ande mkazio, <verse eid="DEU 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 21:14" />uneva houmuunge mwa mazuwa ya kulongole noumlekele aite, usekumtaga kwa matundu, naho usekumtenda enga mtumwa, kwaviya kumgela soni kwa kwikala nae haheina kumlomba.”<verse eid="DEU 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukipe wa mwana kilume nt'hulasasu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 21:15" />“Uneva mgosi ana wavele waidi naho amuunga yumwenga mna yudya mtuhu hakuungwa, mna wavele awo wose weleka wana, naho nt'hulasasu ywa kigosi ni ywo mvele heekuungigwa, <verse eid="DEU 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 21:16" />naho dikeza mpaka dizuwa dyo kuwenk'ha wana awo ukipe, ase kulagisa kwazagula kwa mwana ywe kilume ywo mvele akumuunga kwa kumwink'ha upasi wa yudya nt'hulasasu. <verse eid="DEU 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 21:17" />Vaungwa amzumile yudya nt'hulasasu, mwana wa yudya mvele hekuungwa, na kumwink'ha uwagilwa wakwe hant'hu ha ugoli wakwe nk'hanana mbili.”<verse eid="DEU 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana kilume heekwiva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 21:18" />“Uneva mnt'hu ana mwana kilume naho hekuweva welesi wakwe hata uneva wanamkanya, <verse eid="DEU 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 21:19" />ivo, nine na ise ywa uyo mwana nawamguhe niyo wamwigala kwa wadala wo mzi akwikala uyo umwana. <verse eid="DEU 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 21:20" />Welesi awo nawawagambile wadala wo mzi uwo, ‘Mwana ywetu ywe kilume hakwiva, naho mhank'hu naho mkozi. <verse eid="DEU 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 21:21" />Aho want'hu wo mzi uwo nawamtoe maiwe mpaka abanike. Kila mnt'hu mwe Izilaeli neeve na kogoha. Nivo nomuuse uwihi uno mwenyu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miko ihengi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 21:22" />“Uneva mnt'hu kadamanya wavu ukuleka akomwe naho niyo akomwa kwa kuwambigwa mwo mti, <verse eid="DEU 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 21:23" />kimba chakwe kisekulekwa kilo chose, mna nomummose msanga zuwa iidyo. Kwaviya mnt'hu awambigwe mwo mti kaligitwa ni Mnungu. Kimoseleni msanga ikimba icho vileke isi inase ilemelwe ni Zumbe Mnungu.”<verse eid="DEU 21:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="DEU 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 22:1" />“Unaona ng'ombe hegu ngoto ya miyao yaga usekuileka ivo ivuze kwa nduguyo. <verse eid="DEU 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 22:2" />Mna uneva kwe kaya ya miyao ihale hegu hamummanyize mwenye, ivo nouguhe mfugwa uwo kwe kaya yako, ikale kwako mpaka akeza kwiza mwenye, na weye umvuze. <verse eid="DEU 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 22:3" />Noudamanye iivo mwe mp'unda hegu suke hegu kint'u chochose chagile cha miyao nawe niyo wakiona. Usekukifisa enga kugamba hukione.”<verse eid="DEU 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 22:4" />“Unaona mp'unda hegu ng'ombe ya miyao igwa mwe sila, usekuileka, umwambize miyao kuukimalisa naho mfugwa wakwe.”<verse eid="DEU 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 22:5" />“Wavele wanasekuvala suke za wagosi, wagosi nao wanasekuvala suke za wavele. Akudamanya ivo amuihiya Zumbe Mnungu.”<verse eid="DEU 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 22:6" />“Unabwiila sasa dya kadege mwo mti hegu mwe sila, mna makinda hegu matagi mami yawe naye kayafugatila matagi ayo hegu ayo makinda, usekumguha mami yawe. <verse eid="DEU 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 22:7" />Mlekele nine apuluke, mna wadaha kuguha makinda. Unadamanya ivo nouvikilwe na kwikalisa mwe isi.”<verse eid="DEU 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 22:8" />“Umwo unazenga nyumba mp'hya, izungulusile lugomafisi lutali uko kulanga kwe nyumba iyo, sema unde na masa umwo mnt'hu anagwa kulawa uko niyo abanika.”<verse eid="DEU 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 22:9" />“Usekuhanda mizabibu hamwenga na vihandwa vituhu mwe nk'honde yako, una tenda ivo zabibu ne vihandwa vituhu vose hevizumilwe ha Zumbe Mnungu.”<verse eid="DEU 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 22:10" />“Usekulima mgunda kwa gembe dikuvutwa ni ng'ombe na mp'hunda kwa hamwenga.”<verse eid="DEU 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 22:11" />“Usekuvala suke zisumigwe kwa kuhanganya sufu na kitambala chedi king'aile.”<verse eid="DEU 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 22:12" />“Funga vitunga mwe mp'embe izine ze zisuke zako.”<verse eid="DEU 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miko ye ndoza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 22:13" />“Mgosi analomba mvele, niyo amwiihiya na kumleka <verse eid="DEU 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 22:14" />na kumlongeleza mwe kiyeti kwa kumziga kugamba, umwo wamlombaga mvele uyu amuonga kugamba handaga mwali na mazanga.”<verse eid="DEU 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 22:15" />“Ivo ise na nine ywa uyo mvele nawegale uwona wa mgolole ding'aile we ndoza yakwe ukulagisa uwali na mazanga wo mwana ywawe na kuulagisa kwe kitala cha wadala vilongozi wo mzi wakakamba, <verse eid="DEU 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 22:16" />‘Nekimloza mwana ywetu kwa mnt'hu uyu, mna haluse hakumuunga, <verse eid="DEU 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 22:17" />naho amlongeleza kwa mbuli ya soni na kugamba hambwe hambwiile no mwali na mazanga yakwe. Hata ivo uwona wo mwana ywetu ni uno! Naho nawauguhe na kuu kunguzula mgolole uwo ha wadala vilongozi wo mzi uno. <verse eid="DEU 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 22:18" />Aho wadala vilongozi wo mzi nawamguhe yudya mgosi na kumtoa ngoda. <verse eid="DEU 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 22:19" />Naho nawamtoze vibesu mlongo va masawa na kwink'higwa ise dya yudya mvele kwaviya mgosi uyo kamgela soni mvele ywe Kiizilaeli. Uyo mvele naye naagendeele kunda mkaziwe naho haadahe kumwasa mwo wikazi wakwe wose.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 22:20" />“Mna uneva malongelezo ayo ni ya kindedi, na naho hakuna uwona kugamba kindeni andaga ni mwali na mazanga, <verse eid="DEU 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 22:21" />nawamwigale mwe nyumba ya ise na wagosi wo mzi uwo nawamtoe maiwe mpaka abanike, kwaviya kadamanya mbuli ihile ya uhabwasi kwe kaya ya ise. Nivo noumuuse uwihi uno mwenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 22:22" />“Mgosi anagenda na mvele hiyo ywakwe niyo agwilwa, wose waidi vaungwa wakomigwe. Nivo nomuuse uwihi uno mwenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 22:23" />“Mgosi ana mbwiila mndele atumizwe ni mnt'hu mtuhu niyo agenda naye, <verse eid="DEU 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 22:24" />nomuwafoseze kuse na kuwatowa maiwe mpaka wabanike. Mndele uyo vaungwa akomigwe kwaviya hagutile lukunga hata uneva andaga kwo mzi uko vadahike kwivika, naho mgosi uyo vaungwa akomigwe kwaviya kamgela usavu mkaza miyawe. Ivi nivo nomuuse uwihi uwo mwenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 22:25" />“Mna uneva mgosi ana mbwiila mele atumizwe niyo agona naye kwa kumkakalisa, ivo mgosi uyo naakomigwe ekedu <verse eid="DEU 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 22:26" />Sema mnamdamanyile uyo mndele chochose, yehe hana masa yakuunga usengelo wa kukomwa. Mbuli ino ni enga mbuli ya mnt'hu mtuhu akukumkup'hukila mnt'hu mtuhu na kumkoma. <verse eid="DEU 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 22:27" />Uyo mgosi atile kumgwila kwe mbago mvele atumizwe ni mnt'hu mtuhu, hata uneva nakaguta lukunga hakwandile na mnt'hu wa kumwambiza.”<verse eid="DEU 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 22:28" />“Uneva mgosi anagenda na mwali na mazanga kwa kuta kumgwila, naho ikanda yehe hamtumize, inamanyika iyo, <verse eid="DEU 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 22:29" />mgosi uyo naamlihe ise dya uyo mndele vibesu milongo mishano va masawa kwaviya kamgela usavu, naho uyo mwali na mazanga naande mkaziwe, asekumleka mwo wikazi wakwe wose.”<verse eid="DEU 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 22:30" />“Mwana kilume yeyose ase kumgela soni ise kwa kugenda na yeyose mwa wakaza ise.”<verse eid="DEU 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="DEU 23" />
  <para style="s">Miko mwo mdugano wa want'hu wa Zumbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 23:1" />“Mgosi yeyose afunt'higwe hegu akant'higwe ugosi wakwe haazumilwe kuvika hamwenga na want'hu wa Zumbe.”<verse eid="DEU 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 23:2" />“Naho mwana elekwe ni mgosi mwizilaeli kwa mvele hi Mwizilaeli, haazumilwe kwingila mwo mdugano wa want'hu wa Zumbe. Ino ni hamwenga na welekwa wakwe hata cheleko cha mlongo.”<verse eid="DEU 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 23:3" />“Mwamoni hegu Mmoabu yeyose, welekwa wakwe wose na cheleko chakwe cha mlongo, hawakuungwa mwo mdugano wa want'hu wa Zumbe. <verse eid="DEU 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 23:4" />Kwaviya walemelaga kuwenk'ha nk'hande na mazi umwo mwandaga mwe sila kulawa Misili, naivo nawamwink'ha ndima Balaamu mwana Beoli kulawa Petoli kudya Mesopotamia. Awaligiteni nyuwe. <verse eid="DEU 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 23:5" />Mna Zumbe Mnungu hamwivile Balaamu, vituhu vakwe ligito idyo adihitulaga kunda uvikilwa, kwaviya Zumbe kawaungisani nyuwe. <verse eid="DEU 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 23:6" />Usekuwazunguila utondowazi hegu uvikilwa Waamoni hegu Wamoabu, mazuwa yose mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="DEU 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 23:7" />“Msekuwaihiya Waedomu, awo ni ndugu zenyu. Naho msekuwaihiya Wamisili, kwaviya mwekalaga mwe isi yawe enga wata kwiza. <verse eid="DEU 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 23:8" />Welekwa wawe, kukongela cheleko cha katatu, nawazumilwe kwingila mwo mdugano wa want'hu wa Zumbe.”<verse eid="DEU 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuika ink'hambi vedi vileke izumilwe ni Zumbe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 23:9" />“Mkaita kwe nk'hondo, na kutoa nk'hambi, kila mnt'hu akenege na kila kint'hu kiihile kikukutenda usekuzumilwa ni Zumbe. <verse eid="DEU 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 23:10" />Uneva mgosi yeyose mwenyu aneningila usavu kwa kulawa mbeyu za cheleko nekilo, uyo naafose kuse ye nk'ambi na kwikala uko. <verse eid="DEU 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 23:11" />Mna inabula kisingi naahake mazi mwo mwili, naho zuwa dinaswa naauye kwe nk'hambi.”<verse eid="DEU 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 23:12" />“Mwaungwa kunda na hant'hu kuse ye nk'hambi, aho mkudaha kuzungulukila. <verse eid="DEU 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 23:13" />Mnde na vigembe vidododo vileke umwo mkazunguluka vimwambizeni kusiliza. <verse eid="DEU 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 23:14" />Nk'hambi yenyu yaungwa inde ikukile kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu eyumo mwe nk'hambi yenyu vileke awayokole na kuwenk'ha uhumi mwa wank'hondo wenyu. Msekutenda kint'hu chochose kisavu icho nekileke Zumbe awalekeni.”<verse eid="DEU 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miko ihengi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 23:15" />“Uneva watumwa wananyilika kwa wakulu wawe na kunyilikila mwe isi ya Izilaeli mse kumvuza kwo mkulu wawe. <verse eid="DEU 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 23:16" />Nekale hamwenga na nyuwe mwe mizi yenyu hant'hu hohose hedi naahasagule, msekuwadamanyila vihile.”<verse eid="DEU 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 23:17" />“Mwizilaeli yeyose mgosi hegu mvele hakuungwa kunda mhabwasi hant'hu hawe ho kuvika. <verse eid="DEU 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 23:18" />Matundu yeyose yalawile kwo uhabwasi, yasekwigalwa mwe nyumba ya Zumbe Mnungu kwajili ya kilapi chochose. Mnungu aviihia ivi vose.”<verse eid="DEU 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 23:19" />“Usekumwink'ha nduguyo Mwizilaeli kint'hu chochose kwa maliho ya kusump'hula inde matundu hegu nk'hande hegu chochose kiya. <verse eid="DEU 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 23:20" />Wadaha kuguha cha kusup'hula kwa mta kwiza hiyo kwa Mwizilaeli miyawo, vileke Zumbe Mnungu akuvikile mwe zindima zako zose noudamanye mwe isi iyo ukwingila uitahe inde yenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 23:21" />“Ukaika kilapi kwa Zumbe Mnungu, ukombeke kuiusa, kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu haleke kuiunga kwako naivo neinde wavu kwako, <verse eid="DEU 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 23:22" />mna unaleka kuika kilapi hounde na wavu, <verse eid="DEU 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 23:23" />unde na wengele mwe kukint'hiza kilapi icho ulongile, kwaviya nokuika Ndagano na Zumbe Mnungu kwa kuunga mwenye.”<verse eid="DEU 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 23:24" />“Ukagenda mwe nk'honde ya mizabibu ya mnt'hu wadaha kudya zabibu ivo ukudaha, mna usekunonola zabibu zozose niyo wagela mwe nt'hangulu yako. <verse eid="DEU 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 23:25" />Uneva ukengila mwe nk'honde ya mnt'hu ina mhuta wadaha kukwanyula niyo wadya mna use kuisenga ne ngola na kuita nayo kaya.”<verse eid="DEU 23:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="DEU 24" />
  <para style="s">Talaka no kulombigwa kaidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 24:1" />“Uneva mgosi analomba mvele, niyo anda hakumuunga kwaviya helelwe naye. Ivo mgosi niyo amwandikila talaka na kumgulusa mwe kaya yakwe, <verse eid="DEU 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 24:2" />akajika mvele uyo niyo alombigwa ni mgosi mtuhu, <verse eid="DEU 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 24:3" />uneva uyo mgosi ywa kaidi anamguha, yehe naye niyo amwasa na kumgulusa kwe kaya yakwe, hegu uyo mgosi anabanika, <verse eid="DEU 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 24:4" />ivo uyo mgosi ywa bosi asekumguha naho mvele uyo kunda mkaziwe, kwaviya katendigwa asekuzumilwa. Kutenda ivo ni kumuihiza Zumbe Mnungu. Mse kutenda wavu mwe isi iyo mkwink'higwa ni Zumbe Mnungu kunda ukipe wenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miko ihengi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 24:5" />“Mgosi yeyose alombile mazuwa ya hagihi asekuita kwe nk'hondo, naho asekwink'higwa ndima yeyose, alekelwe ekale kwa mwaka umwenga, vileke ekale kaya na mkaziwe.”<verse eid="DEU 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 24:6" />“Unamkopesha mnt'hu kint'hu, usekuguha iwe dyakwe dyo kusagila dinde poni. Unatenda ivo nounde kuusa isila yakwe yo kuikila lumwe nk'hande yo kumtenda ande mgima.”<verse eid="DEU 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 24:7" />“Mnt'hu yeyose anamguha kwa kumkakalisa Mwizilaeli miyawe na kumtenda mtumwa wakwe hegu kumtaga mwo utumwa, mnt'hu uyo vaungwa akomwe. Nivo nomtende uwihi uwo kunda hakuna.”<verse eid="DEU 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 24:8" />“Uneva mnt'hu yeyose ana maine yaihile ya nk'handa mwaungwa kunda na wengele kwa kutimila malagizo ya walava nt'hambiko wa Kilawi. Enga ivo niwasigiile nivo nomdamanye kwa wengele. <verse eid="DEU 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 24:9" />Kumbukileni Zumbe Mnungu ivo amtendele Miliamu umwo mwandaga mwe nt'hambo kulawa Misili.”<verse eid="DEU 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 24:10" />“Unamkopesha miyawo kint'hu chochose sema unengile mwe nyumba yakwe kuguha kint'hu. <verse eid="DEU 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 24:11" />Mgojele kuse naho mleke yehe mwenye akuletele icho ikint'hu, <verse eid="DEU 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 24:12" />mna uneva yehe mkiwa usekwikala ne kint'hu icho kilo chose, <verse eid="DEU 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 24:13" />mvuzile kila kisingi vileke akegubikile na kukuungila uvikilwa. Kudamanya ivo ni mbuli ya uwagilwa ha Zumbe Mnungu.”<verse eid="DEU 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 24:14" />“Usekumhujila mndima ywako mkiwa, ande Mwizilaeli hegu yumwenga mwa wakaya wakwikala mwo mzi wenyu. <verse eid="DEU 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 24:15" />Kila zuwa, dikanda hadinati kuswa mlihe kiya akuungwa kulihwa mwe dizuwa idyo, kwaviya yehe ni mkiwa na uwo nuwo akukawiila mwo moyo wakwe, vileke sema anamwiile Zumbe Mnungu, niyo weye wanda na masa.”<verse eid="DEU 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 24:16" />“Welesi wasekukomwa kwaajili ya masa ya wana wawe, naho wana wasekukomwa kwaajili ya masa ya welesi wawe. Kila mnt'hu naakomwe kwa masa yakwe mwenye.”<verse eid="DEU 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 24:17" />“Msekwazaganya uwagilwa wa wata kwiza na wanank'hiwa. Naho msekuguha valo dya mvele abanikilwe ni mgosiwe na kudiika poni. <verse eid="DEU 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 24:18" />Kumbukileni nyuwe nomnda watumwa mwe isi ya Misili, na Zumbe Mnungu niyo awakombola kulawa uko. Kwa ivo nawenk'hani sigilizi ino.”<verse eid="DEU 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 24:19" />“Mkavuna ulozo wenyu mwo mgunda msekusokoza, walekeni watakwiza na wanank'hiwa na wabanikilwe ni wagosi zawe, vileke Zumbe Mnungu awavikile mwe zindima zenyu zose. <verse eid="DEU 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 24:20" />Umwo unanonola matunda ya zeituni mwo mzeituni usekuuya naho ukanonole yadya yasigale, mna walekeleni wata kwiza na wanank'hiwa na wabanikilwe ni wagosi zawe. <verse eid="DEU 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 24:21" />Umwo mkanonola zabibu zenyu msekuvuzagiza, walekeleni watakwiza na wanank'hiwa na wafiilwe ni wagosi zawe. <verse eid="DEU 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 24:22" />Kumbukileni nyuwe nomnda watumwa mwe isi ya Misili, nivo vikuleka nawenk'hani sigilizi ino.”<verse eid="DEU 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="DEU 25" />
  <para style="p">Musa agendeelaga kugamba, <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 25:1" />“Uneva kuna nk'humbizi mwa want'hu waidi, niyo wagenda kulamulwa kwe kitala, yumwenga niyo aoneka hana masa, mtuhu naye niyo anoka kunda na masa, <verse eid="DEU 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 25:2" />uneva mta masa kasengelwa kutoigwa ngoda, mlamuzi uyo namgambe agone hasi na kumtowa uwazilo wa ngoda kuviligane na masa yakwe. <verse eid="DEU 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 25:3" />Mta masa adaha kutoigwa ngoda milongo mine naho hiyo zikujink'ha aho. Mnombosa uwazilo uwo nomnde mumgela soni ndugu ywenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 25:4" />“Usekuinyinya ng'ombe ikakwambiza kuhugusa uhule.”<verse eid="DEU 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mkaziwe dya mgosi abanike apaligwa ni mnamuwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 25:5" />“Uneva wandugu waidi wa kilume wekala hant'hu hamwenga niyo yumwenga ywawe abanika, mkaza uyo abanike naalombigwe uumwo mwe mp'huga iyo. Nduguye dya uyo abanike naamguhe ande mkaziwe. <verse eid="DEU 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 25:6" />Nt'hulasasu we kilume neelekwe nawo naawazigwe kunda mwana ywa yudya mgosi abanike, vileke zina dyakwe dise kuuswa mwe Izilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 25:7" />Mna uneva uyo mndugu ywa uyo abanike anagamba hakumuunga uyo mvele abanikilwe ni mgosiwe, ivo uyo mvele naaite ha wakulu wo mzi uwo na kugamba, ‘Nduguye ywa mgosi ywangu alemela kunipala, hakuunga kukint'hiza ndima ya mnumangu abanike.’ <verse eid="DEU 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 25:8" />Niyo wakulu wo mzi uwo nawamwitange uyo mgosi na kulonga nae. Uneva alemela kumpala, <verse eid="DEU 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 25:9" />uyo mvele abanikilwe ni mgosiwe naamwitile aaho ha wadala wo mzi, naamhambule kilatu chakwe kimwenga na kumtweela mate mwe kihanga chakwe niyo amgamba, ‘Ivi nivo nevinde kwa mnt'hu hekuunga kumwelekela nduguye wana.’ <verse eid="DEU 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 25:10" />Naho zina dye mp'huga yakwe mwe Izilaeli neitangwe ‘mp'huga ya mnt'hu ahambulwe kilatu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miko mituhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 25:11" />“Uneva wagosi waidi watowana na mvele ywa yumwenga ywawe niyo awabasa akamgombele mgosiwe akutoigwa, niyo amtoza kwo ugosi wa uyo akumtowa mgosiwe, <verse eid="DEU 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 25:12" />noukant'he mkono wakwe wo kulume uyo mvele, msekumuonela mbazi.”<verse eid="DEU 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 25:13" />“Msekunda na vihimo viidi va kuhimila, vikulu na vidodo. <verse eid="DEU 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 25:14" />Naho msekunda na vihimo vihengi vikulu na vidodo mwe kaya yako. <verse eid="DEU 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 25:15" />Mhimile na vihimo va kindedi na va hevikuhinya vileke mwikalise mwo wikazi wenyu mwe isi Zumbe Mnungu akuwenk'hani. <verse eid="DEU 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 25:16" />Wose wakudamanya ivo, Zumbe Mnungu aihiwa ne zimbuli izo.”<verse eid="DEU 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sigilizi ya Kuwakoma Waamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 25:17" />“Kumbukileni kiya Waamaleki wawadamanyilagani umwo mwandaga mkalawa Misili, <verse eid="DEU 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 25:18" />mwandaga hawakumwogoha Mnungu naivo wawatowagani kunyuma umwo mwandaga msokela, naho wawakomaga wose wandaga wakeza kunyuma wahwele. <verse eid="DEU 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 25:19" />Umwo Zumbe Mnungu eze awenk'heni kuhumula kulawa kwa wank'hondo wenyu wose wakuwazungulukani mwe isi iyo Zumbe akuwenk'hani inde yenyu mwikale umwo, nomuwakome Waamaleki wose vileke wasekwiza kukumbukilwa naho. Msekujala mbuli ino.”<verse eid="DEU 25:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="DEU 26" />
  <para style="s">Malavo yo uvuni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 26:1" />“Musa agendeela kulonga, nevinde kugamba aho mkeza kunda mwingila mwe isi akuwenk'hani Zumbe Mnungu na kunda ukipe wenyu na kuikaila, <verse eid="DEU 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 26:2" />niho kila yumwenga naagele mwe nt'hangulu ulozo wa nk'hongo wa kila uvuni avunile, niyo aita navo hant'hu aho Zumbe Mnungu kahasagule kuvikwa. <verse eid="DEU 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 26:3" />Noumbase mlavant'hambiko naande aho mwe dizuwa idyo, niyo wamgamba, ‘Dielo nalonga mwenye kwa Zumbe Mnungu ywanga kugamba hingila mwe isi ino Zumbe awaikilaga kilapi wakale wetu kugamba noukink'he.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 26:4" />“Mlavant'hambiko naye naaihokele kwako niyo aiika he kilingo cho kulavila nt'hambiko cha Zumbe Mnungu. <verse eid="DEU 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 26:5" />Naho nawe nouhitule mwenye aho hant'hu hasagulwe ni Zumbe Mnungu kagamba, ‘Mkale ywangu andaga Mwalami akwangadika niyo aita Misili ne mp'huga yakwe, umwo waitaga uko wandaga want'hu wageke mna welekaga niyo wanda si nk'hulu ina udahi naho want'hu wabindile ingi. <verse eid="DEU 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 26:6" />Wamisili wandaga wakakitendela kwa luhahila na kukitigiza kudamanya ndima ndala yo utumwa. <verse eid="DEU 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 26:7" />Niho chamwiilaga Zumbe Mnungu ywa wakale wetu. Akivaga niyo aona makunt'ho yetu na ndima ndala na kuzilwa kwetu. <verse eid="DEU 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 26:8" />Ivo Zumbe akilavaga uko Misili kwa udahi wakwe mkulu. Adamanyaga vilagiso na vihungi vingi na kweheela. <verse eid="DEU 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 26:9" />Akigalaga aha niyo akink'ha isi ina ulozo na ugoli. <verse eid="DEU 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 26:10" />Naho haluse negala kwa Zumbe ulozo wa nk'hongo we isi anink'hile, akajika ika int'hangulu hant'hu ha kumvika Zumbe niyo wafika madi ahakwe.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 26:10">“Akajika wiike int'hangulu aho hant'hu hasagulwe kumvika Zumbe <verse eid="DEU 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 26:11" />Ukaonele kinyemi ayedi yose akwink'hile Zumbe Mnungu weye ne mp'huga yako. Naho Walawi na watakwiza wakwikala kwako nawo wande mwe kinyemi icho.”<verse eid="DEU 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 26:12" />“Ukeza kunda kwazagula imwenga yamlongo mwo ulozo wako mwo mwaka wa katatu, mwaka uwo nomlave imwenga ya mlongo, umwink'he Mlawi na mtakwiza na mwana nk'hiwa na mvele abanikilwe ni mgosiwe vileke wadye mwe nyumba yako na kwiguta. <verse eid="DEU 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 26:13" />Ulonge kwa Zumbe Mnungu, ‘Hikiusa kint'hu kikukile imwenga ya mlongo mwe nyumba yangu, hiwenk'ha Mlawi na mtakwiza na mwana nk'hiwa na mvele abanikilwe ni mgosiwe enga ivo usigiile. Hilekile kuzitimila naho hijaile sigilizi yako yeyose. <verse eid="DEU 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 26:14" />Hidiile iyo imwenga yomlongo umwo hahongeza, naho hiusile chochose kulawa mwe nyumba yangu aho nandaga hizumilwe kwa Zumbe, naho vint'hu ivo hivitendile malavo kwa wabanike. Hidamanya kila kint'hu unisigiile. <verse eid="DEU 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 26:15" />Kaula uku hasi kulawa hakukile hako kwe mbingu niyo wawavikila want'hu wako Izilaeli hamwenga ne isi ukink'hile viligane na ivo wagambaga nouwenk'he wakale wetu, isi ina ulozo na ugoli.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Want'hu wa Zumbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 26:16" />“Dielo Zumbe Mnungu awasigiilani mtimile zisigilizi ne miko, ivo mzive na kuzitimila kwa uhuwilwa naho kwe mioyo yenyu yose no unt'hu wenyu wose. <verse eid="DEU 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 26:17" />Dielo kulonga mweye kugamba Zumbe Mnungu ni Mnungu ywako naho kugamba nomumtegeleze na kutimila ayo akukugambila na kuzidamanya zisigilizi zakwe zose na yose akukusigiila. <verse eid="DEU 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 26:18" />Dielo Zumbe kawazumilani kugamba nyuwe mwi want'hu wakwe mwenye wakukile enga ivo alonganga kugamba nomnde, naivo mwaungwa kutegeleza na kutimila zisigilizi zakwe zose. <verse eid="DEU 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 26:19" />Kugamba naawatunyiseni kujink'ha si zose aziumbile, naho nomtogolwe na kutunywa na kumanyika. Nomnde want'hu wakwe wakukile enga ivo alongile.”<verse eid="DEU 26:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="DEU 27" />
  <para style="s">Miko ya Mnungu iwandikwe mwa maiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 27:1" />Musa ne vilongozi wa Izilaeli wawagambaga want'hu, “Mwive na kutimila zisigilizi izi huwenk'hani ivi dielo. <verse eid="DEU 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 27:2" />Aho mnomboka mto wa Yolodani na kwingila mwe isi iyo mkwink'higwa ni Zumbe Mnungu, no mkimalise maiwe makulu niyo mwayakiziga. <verse eid="DEU 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 27:3" />Nomuwandike mnanga mwa maiwe ayo, sigilizi ino umwo mkeza kunda mwomboka na kwingila mwe isi. Iyo isi mkwink'higwa ni Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu. Ni isi ina ulozo na ugoli. Isi iyo Zumbe Mnungu ywa wakale wenyu agambaga naawenk'heni. <verse eid="DEU 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 27:4" />Umo mkeza komboka mto Yolodani nomkimalise maiwe mwo Mnima wa Ebali niyo mwayakiziga enga ivo huwasigiizani dielo. <verse eid="DEU 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 27:5" />Hant'hu aho nomumzengele Zumbe Mnungu kilingo cha kutambikila. Mzenge kwa maiwe heyesongolwe kwa kilama. <verse eid="DEU 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 27:6" />Heye, kila kilingo ukumzengela kwahohose hokumlavila nt'hambiko Zumbe Mnungu nouhzenge kwa maiwe heyesongolwe. Aho naho noulavile malavo yako yo kokwa. <verse eid="DEU 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 27:7" />Ulave malavo yo utondowazi aaho, mdye na kunda na kinyemi aho akuvikilwa Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu. <verse eid="DEU 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 27:8" />Akajika uwandike vedi zimbuli izi zose ze miko mwa maiwe ayo muyakizige.”<verse eid="DEU 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 27:9" />Musa na Walawi walavant'hambiko niyo wawagamba Waizilaeli, “Hake nyamaleni, nyuwe want'hu wa Izilaeli naho tegelezeni! Dielo ivi mnda want'hu wa Zumbe Mnungu. <verse eid="DEU 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 27:10" />Ivo elo mwive na kutimila zisigilizi zakwe ne miko yakwe humwink'hani.”<verse eid="DEU 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hewekumwiva Mnungu waligitwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 27:11" />Mwe dizuwa iidyo Musa alongaga na want'hu wa Izilaeli akawagamba, <verse eid="DEU 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 27:12" />“Mnomboka mto Yolodani, want'hu wa kabila dya Simioni na Lawi na Yuda na Isakali na Yusufu na Benjamini nawakimale kwo mnima wa Gelizimu vileke wawavikile awant'hu. <verse eid="DEU 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 27:13" />Naho makabila ya Lubeni na Gadi na Asheli na Zabuloni na Dani na Nafutali awa nawo nawakimale kwo mnima wa Ebali kwa ndima ya kuligita. <verse eid="DEU 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 27:14" />Akajika Walawi nawawasomele Waizilaeli wose amaligito ayo yose kwa izwi kulu wakagamba.”<verse eid="DEU 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 27:15" />“ ‘Kaligitwa mnt'hu yeyose akusongola hegu kusana hili dya maiwe hegu maziti hegu ya kilama niyo adivika kwa kinyele. Zumbe aihizwa na wadya wakuvika mahili.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:15">“Want'hu wose nawo wagambe, Taile.”<verse eid="DEU 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 27:16" />“ ‘Kaligitwa mnt'hu yeyose akumbela ise hegu nine.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:16">“Want'hu wose nawo wagambe, Taile.”<verse eid="DEU 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 27:17" />“ ‘Kaligitwa mnt'hu yeyose akusogeza vilagiso ve mihaka aho wahakanilane na miyawe.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:17">“Want'hu wose nawo wagambe, Taile.”<verse eid="DEU 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 27:18" />“ ‘Kaligitwa mnt'hu yeyose akumzaganya nt'hunt'hu mwe sila.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:18">“Want'hu wose nawo wagambe, Taile.”<verse eid="DEU 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 27:19" />“ ‘Kaligitwa yeyose akwazaganya uwagilwa wa mtakwiza na mwanank'hiwa na mvele anabikilwe ni mgosiwe.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:19">“Want'hu wose nawo wagambe, Taile.”<verse eid="DEU 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 27:20" />“ ‘Kaligitwa mnt'hu yeyose akugenda na yeyose mwa wakaza ise kwaviya hamogohe ise.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:20">“Want'hu wose nawo wagambe, Taile.”<verse eid="DEU 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 27:21" />“ ‘Kaligitwa mnt'hu yeyose naagende na kala.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:21">“Want'hu wose nawo wagambe, Taile.”<verse eid="DEU 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 27:22" />“ ‘Kaligitwa mnt'hu yeyose akugenda na lumbudye mwana ise hegu mwana nine.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:22">“Want'hu wose nawo wagambe, Taile.”<verse eid="DEU 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 27:23" />“ ‘Kaligitwa mnt'hu yeyose akugenda na nine mdodo.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:23">“Want'hu wose nawo wagambe, Taile.”<verse eid="DEU 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 27:24" />“ ‘Kaligitwa yeyose akumkoma miyawe kwa kinyele.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:24">“Want'hu wose nawo wagambe, Taile.”<verse eid="DEU 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 27:25" />“ ‘Kaligitwa yeyose akuhokela maliho ya kumkoma mnt'hu heena lema.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:25">“Want'hu wose nawo wagambe, Taile.”<verse eid="DEU 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 27:26" />“ ‘Kaligitwa yeyose heekwiva na kutimila miko yose ya Mnungu na mahinizo yakwe.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 27:26">“Want'hu wose nawo wagambe, Taile.”<verse eid="DEU 27:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="DEU 28" />
  <para style="s">Uvikilwa kwa wadya wakumwiva Zumbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 28:1" />“Uneva unamwiva na kumtimila kwa wengele Zumbe Mnungu na kutenda viligane ne zisigilizi zakwe zose izo hukwink'ha dielo, naawatunyiseni kujink'ha si zose za mwe isi. <verse eid="DEU 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 28:2" />Uvikilwa uno wose noukwizile uneva unatenda ivo akuunga Zumbe Mnungu.”<verse eid="DEU 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 28:3" />“Nouvikilwe, mwe mizi na kwe zink'honde zako.”<verse eid="DEU 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 28:4" />“Zumbe naakuvikile kwa kukwink'ha wana wengi na ulozo mwingi na ng'ombe nyingi na ngoto.”<verse eid="DEU 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 28:5" />“Zumbe naakuvikile mwo ulozo wako na vint'hu vako va kwambikila nk'hande.”<verse eid="DEU 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 28:6" />“Zumbe naakuvikile mwe zindima zako zose izo ukudamanya.”<verse eid="DEU 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 28:7" />“Zumbe naawatowe wank'hondo wakukwiziila, nawakukump'hukile kwa sila imwenga mna nawakunyilike kwa sila mfungate.”<verse eid="DEU 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 28:8" />“Zumbe naavikile magulu yako na kila mwe ndima ukudamanya. Naakuvikile mwe isi akukwink'ha.”<verse eid="DEU 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 28:9" />“Zumbe naawatende mnde want'hu wakwe wakukile enga ivo alongile kwa kuika kilapi, uneva mnaziva na kutimila sigilizi zakwe Zumbe Mnungu na kwikala kwa kutimila sila zakwe. <verse eid="DEU 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 28:10" />Niho want'hu wose mwe si zose nawaone kugamba msagulwa ni Zumbe kunda want'hu wakwe, naho want'hu awo nawawogoheni. <verse eid="DEU 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 28:11" />Zumbe naawenk'heni wana wengi na mifugwa mingi na ulozo we isi awagambaga wakale wenyu kugamba naawenk'heni. <verse eid="DEU 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 28:12" />Zumbe naawakomwoele kindolo chakwe chedi kulawa kwe mbingu, naawenk'heni fula ye isi yako kwe misimo yakwe. Naawavikileni mwe zindima zenyu zose, naho nomkopeshe si nyingi mna nyuwe homkope. <verse eid="DEU 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 28:13" />Zumbe Mnungu naakuike kunda kilongozi mwe si zose naho hiyo ywa kuzigiila, nounde mpati naho houdunduge uneva noumwive na kutimila kwa uhuwilwa zisigilizi zakwe izo hukukusigiila ivi dielo. <verse eid="DEU 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 28:14" />Mna kauliseni msekuleka kutimila zisigilizi yoyose mwe izi hukwink'ha dielo niyo watimila milungu mituhu na kuidamanyila ndima.”<verse eid="DEU 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakuunga yawalaileni hamna mwivile Zumbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 28:15" />“Mna uneva hunamwivile Zumbe Mnungu naho hunatimile kwa uhuilwa zisigilizi zakwe zose ne miko yakwe hukwink'ha dielo, mbuli izi zose ziihile nayakutimile.”<verse eid="DEU 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 28:16" />“Nouligitwe mwe mizi na kwe zink'honde zako.”<verse eid="DEU 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 28:17" />“Nouligitwe mwo uvuni wako, ne vint'hu vako va kwambikila nk'hande.”<verse eid="DEU 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 28:18" />“ Nouligitwe kwa kuswesa wana wengi na ulozo mgeke na mifugwa migeke.”<verse eid="DEU 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 28:19" />“Nouligitwe mwe kila ndima noudamanye.”<verse eid="DEU 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 28:20" />“Uneva unadamanya uwihi na kumlemela Zumbe, naakwigaile mavuma, kiyangayanga, na kuswesa kunda na ulamuzi mwe kila ndima noudamanye, mpaka msunguze kukomigwa pele. <verse eid="DEU 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 28:21" />Zumbe nakwigaile maine yakutisa mpaka yawabindeni pele mwe isi iyo mkuunga muitahe. <verse eid="DEU 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 28:22" />Zumbe naawatoweni na maine ya kululumka, naho hokunde na fula naho nokunde na nk'hung'unt'ho ikukoma pele vihandwa vako. Mavuma aya naya wakulumbuzeni mpaka viwakukomeni pele. <verse eid="DEU 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 28:23" />Hokunde na fula naho sanga yako neitoge enga kilama. <verse eid="DEU 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 28:24" />Zumbe hant'hu ha kukwigaila fula naakuselezele heho duna luvumbi na msanga mpaka ukomwe pele.”<verse eid="DEU 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 28:25" />“Zumbe naakutende uhumwe ha wank'hondo wako. Nouwabase kwa sila imwenga, mna nouwanyilike kwa sila mfungate. Want'hu wa si nt'huhu mwe si zose wakawakaulani na kuona ayo yawabwiileni nawogohese. <verse eid="DEU 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 28:26" />Ukeza kubanika, kimba chako nekidigwe ni madege na makewe ya mwe isi, naho hokunde na yeyose naaya guluse. <verse eid="DEU 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 28:27" />Zumbe naakugele maihu yakutumbuka na kunyegela enga yadya yawapataga Wamisili na nk'hwenge za kundani na uhele na kunyegelwa ivo heviikuhona. <verse eid="DEU 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 28:28" />Zumbe naakugele kilalu na unt'hunt'hu na kwazaganywa. <verse eid="DEU 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 28:29" />Nougende kwa kubabasa babasa nomsi enga nt'hunt'hu. Huna icho noupate mwe zindima zako zose, naho nouheele kunyanyagalwa na kuhokigwa zuwa kwa zuwa, hokunde na yeyose ywa kukugombela.”<verse eid="DEU 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 28:30" />“Noutumize mvele ywa kulomba mna naagende na mgosi mtuhu. Nouzenge nyumba mna houikale, naho nouhande zabibu mna houyabwede matunda yakwe. <verse eid="DEU 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 28:31" />Ng'ombe zako nezichinjigwe iivi ukakaula inyama nayo houidye weye, nouhokigwe zimp'hunda zako kwa ukwank'hwalu naho hezivuzigwe, ngoto zako nezink'hizwe kwa wank'hondo wako nawe houone ywa kukuwambiza. <verse eid="DEU 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 28:32" />Wanawo nawenk'hizwe kwa want'hu watuhu na kunda watumwa iivi ukasinya, nawe noukont'hole meso ukawakaula uko weli mna hawauye kwako. <verse eid="DEU 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 28:33" />Si hwiimanyize neiguhe ulozo wako ukombatize kuudamanyila ndima kwa udala, nawe nounyanyagalwe na kusulumizwa mazuwa yose. <verse eid="DEU 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 28:34" />Nounde enga mkilalu kwa mbuli nouzione. <verse eid="DEU 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 28:35" />Zumbe naakugele maihu yakulumisa heyekuhona mwa mavindi na mwe vijumbulu vako, nayakuvalame kulawa kwo lwayo mpaka kwo mtwi.”<verse eid="DEU 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 28:36" />“Zumbe naawegaleni nyuwe hamwenga na seuta ywenyu kwe isi hemwiimanyize, weye hegu wakale wako, uko nomvike milungu mituhu ya maziti na maiwe. <verse eid="DEU 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 28:37" />Want'hu nawawaoneni kinyala, na kuwagelani visimo, na kuwatendani zina dya lubezo mwe si zose izo Zumbe naawa mwaganiseni.”<verse eid="DEU 28:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 28:38" />“Nouhande mbeyu nyingi mna nouvune ulozo mgeke kwaviya ngeda nezidye vihandwa vako. <verse eid="DEU 28:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 28:39" />Nouhande zabibu na kuikaula vedi mna houvune zabibu zakwe hegu kunywa idivai yakwe, kwaviya zabibu neidigwe ni vidudu. <verse eid="DEU 28:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 28:40" />Mizeituni neikule kila hant'hu mwe isi yako mna hounde na mavuta yakwe kwaviya zeituni nezihuluke. <verse eid="DEU 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 28:41" />Noweleke wana wakike na wa kilume mna houwalele kwaviya nawatahigwe. <verse eid="DEU 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 28:42" />Maziti yako yose ne vihandwa vako nevidigwe ni sige.”<verse eid="DEU 28:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 28:43" />“Watakwiza wakwikala mwe isi yenyu nawagendeele na kunda na upati na ludole mna weye nouhunguke nokunda mkiwa naho hwiina ludole. <verse eid="DEU 28:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 28:44" />Nawakukopeshe mna weye houwa kopeshe. Naho kwo uheelo nawakulongoze.”<verse eid="DEU 28:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 28:45" />“Mavuma aya yose nayeze kwako nayakutimile niyo yakupata mpaka ubanike pele kwaviya hutegeleze ayo akulonga Zumbe Mnungu ywako uyo na kutimilisa sigilizi zakwe ne miko yakwe izo akwink'hile. <verse eid="DEU 28:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 28:46" />Neinde ni kilagiso cho usengelo wa Mnungu kwako na welekwa wako mazuwa yose, <verse eid="DEU 28:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 28:47" />kwaviya Zumbe akuvikilaga weye kwa sila zose mna weye humudamanyile ndima kwa moyo wa kinyemi na kumgamba nivedi kwajili yo uwingi udya we vint'hu vose. <verse eid="DEU 28:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 28:48" />Ivo elo nouwadamanyile ndima wank'hondo wakuungwa wegalwe kwako ni Zumbe. Naho nowikale mwo ukiwa haheina nkh'ande, na mazi yo kunywa na suke zo kuvala. Wank'hondo wenyu nawawasulumizeni kwa luhahila mpaka ukomwe pele. <verse eid="DEU 28:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 28:49" />Zumbe naakwigaile isi kulawa hale kwo uheelo we isi, si hwiimanyize hata ulosi wawe neikukime kulawa kulanga enga kasoka, <verse eid="DEU 28:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 28:50" />na wande na luhahila, hawalagise mbazi kwa yeyose akanda mdodo hegu mkulu. <verse eid="DEU 28:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 28:51" />Nawadye mifugwa yenyu no ulozo wenyu nanywe nomgwe mteho mpaka mbanike. Hawamwasileni nk'hande hegu divai hegu mavuta ya zeituni hegu mifugwa yenyu mpaka aho nombanike pele. <verse eid="DEU 28:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 28:52" />Nawawazungulukeni na kuwakindila mwe mizi yako yose mwe isi ukwink'higwa ni Zumbe Mnungu, mpaka aho nawamole magomela yako matali ayo uyahuwile.”<verse eid="DEU 28:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="DEU 28:53" />“Mwo lupisi ulo lwo kukindilwa nokunde na gumbo, niho noudye wanao mwenye wink'higwe ni Zumbe Mnungu umwo mkanda mwasulumizwa ni wank'hondo wenyu. <verse eid="DEU 28:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="DEU 28:54" />Hata mnt'hu mta nt'hogola naho mkombaganyi naande mgila kwa wanduguze na kwa mkaziwe ambwedile, hata kwa wanawe wasigalanye. <verse eid="DEU 28:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="DEU 28:55" />Haampangile yeyose inyama ya wanawe wakuunga wadye kwaviya homsigailwe ni kint'hu mwo kuuzungulukwa na kusulumizwa ni wank'hondo mwe mizi yenyu yose. <verse eid="DEU 28:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="DEU 28:56" />Hata mvele mta nt'hogola naho mgoli naande iivo. Heelelwe kumuoana mgosiwe ambwedile na wanawe mwenye. <verse eid="DEU 28:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="DEU 28:57" />Umwo mzi wakwe ukeza kunda ukindilwa naandilise na gumbo naho kwa kinyele naadye nyama ya katiti kakwe Naadye katiti kakwe ne beleko dyakwe naho naamnyime mgosiwe hata na wanawe.”<verse eid="DEU 28:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="DEU 28:58" />“Uneva hunatimile mbuli izi zose ze miko kwa wengele, izi ziwandikwe mwe kitabu iki naho hamna ditunyile dizina dina ung'azi na dyakweheelesa na kutisa dya Zumbe Mnungu, <verse eid="DEU 28:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="DEU 28:59" />naawegaileni maine na mavuma nyuwe na welekwa wenyu, maine yana luhahila naho ya lupisi lutali yahile naho heyekuhona. <verse eid="DEU 28:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="DEU 28:60" />Naawegaileni maine yose mwayaonaga Misili yadya yawatisagani nayo nayawatimileni mazuwa yose. <verse eid="DEU 28:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="DEU 28:61" />Iviaivia Zumbe neegale maine ye hengi na mavuma heyewandikwe mwe kitabu iki che miko mpaka mkomigwe pele. <verse eid="DEU 28:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="DEU 28:62" />Hamwenga no wingi wenyu enga nt'hondo zo ulanga nomsigale wageke kwaviya hamwivile na kumtimila Zumbe Mnungu. <verse eid="DEU 28:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="DEU 28:63" />Enga ivo vamwelele Zumbe kuwadamanyilani ayedi na kuwatendani mgenyele, iivo neelelwe kuwazaganyani na kuwakomani pele. Nomkwipulwe mwe isi mkugenda kuitaha inde yenyu.”<verse eid="DEU 28:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="DEU 28:64" />“Zumbe Mnungu naawamwaganiseni mwe isi zose, kulawa uheelo umwenga we si mpaka uheelo mtuhu. Uko nomvike milungu mituhu ya maziti na ya maiwe iyo heyamanyikaga kwenyu nyuwe na kwa wakale wenyu. <verse eid="DEU 28:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="DEU 28:65" />Houwone utondowazi hant'hu hohose, naho houdahe kuhumula mwe si izo. Zumbe naakwink'he wogofi naho nouswese kinyemi na kwingila chevu. <verse eid="DEU 28:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="DEU 28:66" />Lupisi lwose nounde na wogohi wa kukomwa ni want'hu. Kilo na msi nowogohese naho houmanye kugamba nounde mgima hegu bule. <verse eid="DEU 28:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="DEU 28:67" />Moyo wako noutunt'he kwa wogohi kwa kila kint'hu noukione. Kukanda mtondo nouunge kunde kisingi, naho kukanda kisingi nouunge kunde mtondo. <verse eid="DEU 28:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="DEU 28:68" />Zumbe naakuvuze naho Misili mwe mitumbwi mwo utafi nakelisaga kugamba howize uugende naho. Ukwo noukelave weye mweye uketage kwa wank'hondo wako unde mtumwa mgosi hegu mtumwa mvele, mna hokunde na yeyose naaunge kukugula.”<verse eid="DEU 28:68" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="DEU 29" />
  <para style="s">Ndagano ya Zumbe na Waizilaeli mwe isi ya Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 29:1" />Uno nuwo ulosi we Ndagano iyo Zumbe Mnungu amlagizaga Musa adamanye akanda hamwenga na Waizilaeli mwe isi ya Moabu, hamwenga na diya Zumbe Mnungu adamanye nawo mwo mnima Holebu.<verse eid="DEU 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 29:2" />Musa awetangaga hamwenga Waizilaeli wose niyo awagamba, “Mwaonaga nyuwe wenye ivo Zumbe amtendele seuta ywa Misili na vilongozi na wandima wakwe na isi yakwe yose. <verse eid="DEU 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 29:3" />Mwaonaga wenye makunt'ho makulu na vilagiso na vihungi na kweehela iyo atendaga Zumbe vileke amsulumize seuta ywa Misili na wandima wakwe na kila mnt'hu mwe isi. <verse eid="DEU 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 29:4" />Mna mpaka ivi haluse Zumbe hanati awenk'heni ubala wa kukombaganya hegu meso ya kuona na magutwi ya kwivila. <verse eid="DEU 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 29:5" />Kwa lupisi lwa miyaka milongo mine Zumbe awalongozaga kwe dijangwa, suke zenyu ne vilatu venyu mwavalaga havasakalaga. <verse eid="DEU 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 29:6" />Hamdile mkate, naho hamnywele divai hegu mp'hombe, vileke mmanye kugamba miye ni miye Zumbe Mnungu. <verse eid="DEU 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 29:7" />Aho mwize mbule hant'hu aha, seuta Sihoni ywa Heshiboni na seuta Ogu ywa Bashani wezaga kutowana na suwe, mna niyo chawahuma, <verse eid="DEU 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 29:8" />ivo chaiguhaga isi yawe na kuyapangila makabila ya Lubeni na Gadi ne nusu ye dikabila dya Manase inde ukipe wawe. <verse eid="DEU 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 29:9" />Ivo mwive na kutimila kwa uhuwilwa mbuli zose zi mwe Ndagano ino, vileke mnde na upati mwe zindima zenyu zose.”<verse eid="DEU 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 29:10" />“Dielo nyuwe nyose mwakimala aha ho undiilo wa Zumbe Mnungu: Vilongozi wa makabila yenyu na wadala vilongozi na wakulu wa watowani na wagosi watuhu wose wa Izilaeli, <verse eid="DEU 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 29:11" />na wavele wenyu na wana wenyu na watakwiza wakwikala mwenyu awo wakuwatemelani nk'huni na kuwatekela mazi. <verse eid="DEU 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 29:12" />Mwi aha dielo vileke Zumbe Mnungu ywako aike Ndagano na nyuwe nanywe mwiizumile ivo ikuunga, <verse eid="DEU 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 29:13" />vileke Zumbe adahe kuwenk'ha ukindedi kugamba nyuwe mwi want'hu wakwe, naye niye Mnungu ywenyu enga ivo alaganaga na nyuwe na wakale wenyu Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobo. <verse eid="DEU 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 29:14" />Hiyo nyuwe du awo huika nawo ndagano hamwenga na maligito yakwe, <verse eid="DEU 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 29:15" />mna ni yehe akimale na suwe ivi dielo aha ho undiilo wa Zumbe na yehe hehali hamwenga na suwe dielo.”<verse eid="DEU 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 29:16" />“Nyuwe wenye mmanya ivo kikale mwe isi ya Misili na ivo chomboke mgati mwe isi izo mzombokele. <verse eid="DEU 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 29:17" />Mwaonaga mahili yawe yakuiihiza, milungu ya maziti na maiwe na masawa na zahabu izo wendile nazo. <verse eid="DEU 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 29:18" />Mmanye kugamba hahana mgosi hegu mvele, ndugu hegu kabila dyodyose mwa nyuwe uyo akumleka Zumbe Mnungu, na kuvika milungu mituhu. Mbuli iyo neinde enga izi dikukulisa na kunda mti una usungu. <verse eid="DEU 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 29:19" />Mnt'hu akwiva mbuli ikulongwa ye Ndagano ino asekuketunya mwenye akafanyanya kugamba naande ywedi hata anatimila kumunk'hwamunk'hwa kwakwe kwiihile. Ino neiwaze wose wedi na wahiile. <verse eid="DEU 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 29:20" />Zumbe Mnungu haamusile mnt'hu uyo, maya ya Zumbe yatendese nayampate na maligito yose yawandikwe mwe kitabu iki mpaka Zumbe ande kamkoma pele. <verse eid="DEU 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 29:21" />Zumbe naamtende ande mliganyizo mwa makabila yose ya Izilaeli, naamwigaile mank'huto hamwenga na maligito enga ivo yawandikwe mwe kitabu iki che Miko.”<verse eid="DEU 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 29:22" />“Mwe vyeleko venyu vikwiza na watakwiza kulawa isi za hale nawaone makunt'ho na masulumizo ayo Zumbe ayegale kwenyu mwe isi. <verse eid="DEU 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 29:23" />Nk'honde nezinde zinyala naho Zumbe naakup'hule moto wa chola na munyu hakuna chochose nekihandigwe naho hakuna mani nayahote isi yenyu nainde enga Sodoma na Gomola na Adima na Seboimu aho andaga na maya yatendese. <verse eid="DEU 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 29:24" />Isi zose nezigambe, ‘Nii Zumbe Mnungu kaitendela ivi isi ino? Nii akanda na maya enga aya?’ <verse eid="DEU 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 29:25" />Naho nawahitule wakagamba, ‘Ni kwaviya want'hu wa Zumbe nawaleka indagano waikaga na Mnungu ywa wakale wawe aho awalavaga mwe isi ya Misili, <verse eid="DEU 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 29:26" />wagendaga kuvika milungu mituhu iyo hawaimanyaga kukongela aho nk'hongo iyo Zumbe awalemezaga wasekuivika. <verse eid="DEU 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 29:27" />Nivo vilekile maya ya Zumbe yakwelaga mwe isi yawe, niyo awegaila makunt'ho yose yawandikagwa mwe kitabu iki. <verse eid="DEU 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 29:28" />Zumbe awang'olaga kwa maya yatendese mwe isi yawe niyo awaduula mwe isi nt'huhu enga ivo vili dielo.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 29:29" />“Mbuli za kinyele ni za Zumbe Mnungu ywetu, mna kakilagisa mwiko wakwe. Ivo suwe na welekwa wetu chaungwa kuwiva na kuutimila mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="DEU 29:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="DEU 30" />
  <para style="s">Yo kudamanya vileke uuye kwa Zumbe na kuvikilwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 30:1" />Musa niyo agendeela kulonga, “Hiwenk'hani msagule mwa aya, uvikilwa na maligito. Yose yakeza kulaiala kwenyu, umwo mkekala mwe ziisi uko Zumbe Mnungu naande kawamwaganisani, uko nomkumbukile usaguzi niwenk'hileni. <verse eid="DEU 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 30:2" />Uneva nyuwe ne vyeleko venyu nommuiye Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu kwa moyo wenyu wose na kwa unt'hu wenyu wose niyo mwazitegeleza na kuzitimila zisigilizi zakwe huwenk'hani ivi dielo, <verse eid="DEU 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 30:3" />niho Zumbe Mnungu naawavuzileni ayedi na kuwaonela mbazi na kuwaduganya naho kulawa mwe ziisi awamwaganisagani. <verse eid="DEU 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 30:4" />hata uneva mwigalwa hale kwe ziisi, Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu naawaduganyeni na kuwavuza, <verse eid="DEU 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 30:5" />vileke mwiikaile naho isi iyo awa lekelaga wakale wenyu. Yehe naawatende mpatise na kunda wengi kujink'ha wakale wenyu. <verse eid="DEU 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 30:6" />Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu naawatendeni nyuwe ne vyeleko venyu mnde na moyo wedi vileke mmuunge yehe kwa moyo wenyu wose na unt'hu wenyu wose vileke mgendeele kwikala mwe isi. <verse eid="DEU 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 30:7" />Zumbe Mnungu naaike maligito aya yose kwa wose wakuwaihiyani kwa wank'hondo wenyu na wose wawasulumizagani. <verse eid="DEU 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 30:8" />Nanywe nommwive na kumtimila kindedi ndedi Zumbe na kutoza sigilizi zakwe zose huwenk'hani dielo. <verse eid="DEU 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 30:9" />Zumbe Mnungu naawatende mnde wapati mwa kila kiya mkudamanya, nomnde na wana wengi na mifugwa mingi, naho nk'honde zenyu nezilave ulozo mwingi. Kwaviya naaunge naho mnde wapati enga viya aungile kwa wakale wenyu, <verse eid="DEU 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 30:10" />uneva mnaziva na kuzitimila kindedi ndedi sigilizi za Zumbe Mnungu na mahinizo yakwe yawandikwe mwe kitabu che zisigilizi na kumuihiya Zumbe Mnungu kwa moyo wose na kwa unt'hu wose.”<verse eid="DEU 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 30:11" />“Sigilizi huwenk'hani dielo hizo ndala vitendese kwa kuzitimila hegu kuzikombaganya. <verse eid="DEU 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 30:12" />Hazihali kwe mbingu vikuleka muuze kugamba, ‘Niani naakwele kwe mbingu akigaile vileke kizive na kuzitimila? <verse eid="DEU 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 30:13" />Naho hazihali ng'ambu ye bahali vikuleka mgambe niani akuunga omboke mwe bahali akigaile vileke kitegeleze na kutimila? <verse eid="DEU 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 30:14" />Bule, mna zi hagihi na nyuwe mwe milomo yenyu na miyoyo yenyu vileke mzitimile.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 30:15" />“Dielo ivi nawenk'hani msagule ayedi hegu yaihile mwo ugima hegu kubanika. <verse eid="DEU 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 30:16" />Uneva mnatimila sigilizi za Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu izo niwenk'hileni dielo, mnamuunga na kutimila sila zakwe na kutoza malagizo yakwe na usengelo, ivo nomnde wapati na kugenyela, Zumbe Mnungu naawavikile kwe isi mkugenda kuikaila. <verse eid="DEU 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 30:17" />Mna unalemela kumtegeleza na kuluvigwa kwa kuivika milungu mituhu na kuitimila, <verse eid="DEU 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 30:18" />nawagambilani dielo kugamba nomsunguze kusila pele. Homwikale kwa lupisi lutali mwe isi iyo mkomboka mto Yolodani na kugenda kwikala. <verse eid="DEU 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 30:19" />Nazitanga mbingu ne isi zione ayo yakuunga yalaile dielo kugamba hiwenk'hani kusagula ugima hegu file, uvikilwa hegu ligito. Ivo elo saguleni ugima nyuwe na welekwa wenyu vileke mgendeele kwikala mwe isi nagambile neniwenk'he wakale wenyu. <verse eid="DEU 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 30:20" />Muungeni Zumbe Mnungu, mwiveni na kunda hamwenga naye. Kwaviya kwa kudamanya ivo nomwikalise mwe isi nyuwe na welekwa wenyu, isi iyo Zumbe Mnungu aikaga kilapi kwa Abulahamu, Isaka na Yakobo kugamba naawenk'he.”<verse eid="DEU 30:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="DEU 31" />
  <para style="s">Yoshua anda mkipe ywa Musa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 31:1" />Musa nakagendeela kulonga na Waizilaeli wose mbuli izi, <verse eid="DEU 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 31:2" />niyo agamba, “Miye ivi haluse nna miyaka gana na milongo miidi, naho hina ludole lwa kudamanyisa ndima. Naho Zumbe Mnungu kanigamba henomboke mto Yolodani. <verse eid="DEU 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 31:3" />Zumbe Mnungu naawalongoele na kuwakoma want'hu we ziisi wakwikala mwo mto Yolodani, vileke mwiitahe isi yawe. Yoshua naande kilongozi ywenyu enga ivo Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu alongile. <verse eid="DEU 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 31:4" />Zumbe naawabanange want'hu we si izo enga ivo awabanange want'hu wa Sihoni na want'hu wa Ogu, maseuta wa Waamoli hamwenga na want'hu wawe na kuibananga isi yawe. <verse eid="DEU 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 31:5" />Zumbe naawatendeni muwahume, nanywe nomuwatendele enga ivo niwasigiileni. <verse eid="DEU 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 31:6" />Mtoge naho mkangale, naho msekogoha hegu kutiswa nawo, kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu naande hamwenga na nyuwe. Yehe haaleke kuwambiza hegu kuwaleka.”<verse eid="DEU 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 31:7" />Ivo Musa amwitangaga Yoshua aho ha want'hu wa Izilaeli niyo amgamba, “Utoge naho ukangale, kwaviya ni weye nouwalongoze want'hu awa kugenda kuitaha isi iyo Zumbe Mnungu alagane na wakale wetu. <verse eid="DEU 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 31:8" />Zumbe niye naakulongoele na kunda hamwenga na weye, haaleke kukwambiza naho haawalekeni, use kogoha hegu kwingila chevu.”<verse eid="DEU 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwiko usomwe kila ikajink'ha miaka mfungate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 31:9" />Ivo, Musa awandikaga Imiko ya Mnungu iyo, niyo awenk'ha walavant'hambiko awo Walawi wakwinula Disanduku dye Ndagano ya Zumbe, naho awenk'haga iviyaiviya wadala vilongozi wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 31:10" />Niyo awasigiila akagamba, “Kwo uheelo wa kila mwaka wa mfungate umwo mwaka wo kuusilwa matigizo ukanda hagihi, mzisome kwa izwi mwe dizua dye kinyemi dye viheha. <verse eid="DEU 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 31:11" />Nomzisome umwo want'hu wa Izilaeli wakeza kumvika Zumbe Mnungu hant'hu hamwenga aha asagule. <verse eid="DEU 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 31:12" />Waduganye want'hu wose wagosi kwa wavele, wana na watakwiza wakwikala mwo mizi wenyu, vileke kila yumwenga eve na kukehiniza kumvika Zumbe na kutimila zimbuli ze sigilizi izi kwa uhuwilwa. <verse eid="DEU 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 31:13" />Kwa sila iyo awo welekwa heweenati weve sigilizi za Zumbe Mnungu, nawahine kumwiva na kumtimila umwo wakekala kwe isi iyo mkwomboka mto Yolodani kugenda kuitaha.”<verse eid="DEU 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zumbe amwink'ha Musa sigilizi zo uheelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 31:14" />Ivo, Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, “Zuwa dyako dyo kubanika dihagihi. Mwitange Yoshua, mwize hant'hu aho Mnungu akudugana na want'hu vileke nimsigiile.” Ivo Musa na Yoshua niyo waita kwe Dihema Dikukile, <verse eid="DEU 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 31:15" />Zumbe naye niyo awalaila uko mwo mkola we divunde. Mkola uwo we divunde wakimalaga he nk'hili ye dihema dikukile.<verse eid="DEU 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 31:16" />Zumbe niyo amgamba Musa, “Zuwa dyako dyo kubanika dihagihi, weye una banika want'hu nawande hi wahuwilwa kwangu, naho nawaileke indagano niikile nawo, nawanileke na kuvika milungu mituhu imwe isi iyo wakugenda kwikala. <verse eid="DEU 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 31:17" />Mwe dizuwa idyo, miye neniwafiile maya, name neniwaleke na kunda hale na woho, nawabanangwe. Nawapate makunt'ho na masulumizo mengi, naho nawagambe togoleni maihi aya yose yakipata kwaviya Mnungu hamuli mwetu. <verse eid="DEU 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 31:18" />Ikindedi neninde hale nawo kwaviya wadamanya mbuli ziihile na kuhitukila milungu mituhu.”<verse eid="DEU 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 31:19" />“Haluse wandika ukemi uno, uwahinize want'hu wa Izilaeli unde uwona wangu mwawe. <verse eid="DEU 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 31:20" />Neni wegale mwe isi ina ugoli na ulozo enga ivo nawaikilaga kilapi wakale wawe. Uko nawande ne nk'hande zose wakuziunga naho nawagimbale mna nawa nilemele na kuleka indagano na kuvika milungu mituhu. <verse eid="DEU 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 31:21" />Nawapate maihi mengi na makunt'ho, ukemi uno nowabwiile ivo houjalwe na welekwa wawe. Kwaviya himanya kiya wakufanyanya hata ivi haluse, handa hinati kuwegala mwe isi iyo huwenk'ha.”<verse eid="DEU 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 31:22" />Ivo, Musa awandikaga ukemi uno mwe dizuwa iidyo na kuwahiniza Waizilaeli.<verse eid="DEU 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 31:23" />Niyo Zumbe alonga na Yoshua, mwana Nuni akamgamba, “Utoge naho ukangale, kwaviya nouwalongoze Waizilaeli mwe isi iyo nilagane kuwenk'ha, name neninde hamwenga na weye.”<verse eid="DEU 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 31:24" />Musa eze ibinde kuwandika zimbuli ze sigilizi ino mwe kitabu, <verse eid="DEU 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 31:25" />naho awenk'haga isigilizi ino Walawi wenulaga Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Zumbe, <verse eid="DEU 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 31:26" />“Guheni kitabu iki che sigilizi, mkiike hank'handa he Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Zumbe Mnungu vileke inde uwona mwa nyuwe. <verse eid="DEU 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 31:27" />Himanya ivo mwili msaguke na kunda wank'hani. Kauleni umwo handa nikei mgima na nyuwe, msaguka kwa Zumbe, nyuwe homsagukise umwo miye heza kunda hibanika? <verse eid="DEU 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 31:28" />Waduganye wadala vilongozi wose wa makabila yenyu na vilongozi wakulu wenyu vileke nipate luneka lwa kulonga mbuli izi wazive, mbingu nazo ne isi nezinde waona mwa woho. <verse eid="DEU 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 31:29" />Kwaviya himanya umwo habanika ikindedi nomnde waihi na kuileka sila niwasigiile muitimile. Naho mazuwa yakwiza mbuli ziihile neziwezileni kwaviya nomumtende Zumbe aihiwe kwa kudamanya ayo awalemezeni.”<verse eid="DEU 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukemi wa Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 31:30" />Musa niyo akema mbuli zose zo ukemi uwo ho mdugano wa Waizilaeli, kukongela bosi mpaka kwo kubindiliza.<verse eid="DEU 31:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="DEU 32" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 32:1" />“Mbingu tegelezeni ulosi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:1">isi mwive kiya hulonga.<verse eid="DEU 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 32:2" />Mahinizo yangu nayagwe enga fula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">na milosi yangu enga mnyuzu mwe isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">Saviya manyunyu mwa majukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">iligana na matwent'we ya fula mwa mani yakudegeda.<verse eid="DEU 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 32:3" />Neniditogole dizina dya Zumbe nenibilikize ulosi wa Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:3">Want'hu nawasimwiile ukulu wakwe.”<verse eid="DEU 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 32:4" />“Zumbe ni gomela dyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">ndima zakwe zikint'ha heziina kwazagula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">Yehe ni Mnungu mhuwilwa naho mkindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">adamanya mbuli zo uwagilwa no uwedi.<verse eid="DEU 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 32:5" />Mna nyuwe hiyo wahuwilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">hamuwagilwe kunda want'hu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">nyuwe ni cheleko chagile naho kina wavu.<verse eid="DEU 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 32:6" />Togoleni ivi nivo mkumliha Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">nyuwe wahezi homwiina ubala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">Ivo, yehe hiye tati yenyu naho muumbi ywenyu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">Yehe niye awatendeni kunda isi.”<verse eid="DEU 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 32:7" />“Kumbukileni mazuwa yomboke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">fanyanyeni miaka ye vyeleko vingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">wauzeni tati zenyu wawagambileni ayo yalailaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">naho wauzeni wadala wenyu wawagambileni mbuli za kale.<verse eid="DEU 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 32:8" />Umwo Mnungu ekulanga vitendese eze awapangile want'hu isi yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">awapangaga want'hu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">aikaga mihaka kwaajili ye ziisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">viligane no uwazilo wa wana wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="DEU 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 32:9" />Mna Zumbe awasagulaga welekwa wa Yakobo wande wakwe mwenye.”<verse eid="DEU 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 32:10" />“Awabwiilaga mwe dijangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">naho mwe nyika ikutisa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">awamilaga na kuwakaulisa enga mboni ya ziso.<verse eid="DEU 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 32:11" />Enga degenyika dikuhiniza makinda yakwe ukupuuluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">yayenula kwa wengele mnanga mwa mawawa yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">Zumbe awadima Izilaeli wanase kugwa.<verse eid="DEU 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 32:12" />Yehe Zumbe Mnungu mwenye awalongozaga want'hu wakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:12">haheina wambizi wa mnungu mtuhu.”<verse eid="DEU 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 32:13" />“Awombosaga mnanga mwe isi ye vigulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">nawo wadyaga ulozo wa mwe migunda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">Awenk'haga uki walawaga mwa maiwe niyo wadya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">mavuta ya zeituni yalawaga mwe sanga ina maiwe.<verse eid="DEU 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 32:14" />Ng'ombe zawe ne zingoto zawe zalavisa jibini na mele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">Awenk'haga ngoto zedi ne mbuzi zedi ne zing'ombe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">na ngano itendese uwedi ne divai yedi.”<verse eid="DEU 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 32:15" />“Want'hu wa Izilaeli wandaga wagoli mna niyo wasaguka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">wadamanaga na kumwasa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">wamlekaga Mnungu awaumbanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">na kumlemela luwe lwo uyokozi wawe.<verse eid="DEU 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 32:16" />Wamtendaga Zumbe aone finju kwa kuitimila milungu yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:16">uihi wautendaga umwiihiza<verse eid="DEU 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 32:17" />Waitambikilaga milungu ya udant'hi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">milungu mihya iyo wakale wawe hawa imanyaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">milungu heyatimilwagwa ni Izilaeli.<verse eid="DEU 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 32:18" />Waujala Uluwe lwawe lwo uyokozi uyo awaumbaga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:18">Naho niyo wamjala Mnungu ywawe uyo awenk'hile ugima.”<verse eid="DEU 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 32:19" />“Zumbe Mnungu aonaga mbuli iyo niyo awaleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:19">kwaviya aihiwagwa ni wana kilume na wana kike.<verse eid="DEU 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 32:20" />Niyo agamba, ‘Heniwambize.’ ”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">Niho nenione ivo nevinde kwawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">awo cheleko kisaguke, want'hu hi wahuwilwa.<verse eid="DEU 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 32:21" />Wanigela maya kwa ayo mahili yawe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">na maya kwa iyo wakuitanga milungu yawe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">milungu hiyo milungu ye kindedi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">Neniwagele finju kwa kuwatuma want'hu wahezi heweina nt'hogola niwaihizeni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">Neni wageleni finju kwa isi heiina ubala.<verse eid="DEU 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 32:22" />Maya yangu nayakweele enga moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">nayabanange kila kint'hu mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">Nayabule mpaka kwe isi ya wabanike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">Luhotelo lwe milima nenilubanange.<verse eid="DEU 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 32:23" />“ ‘Neniwegaile makunt'ho heyekusila kwawe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:23">na kuwalasa kwa misale yangu yose.<verse eid="DEU 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 32:24" />Nawanyale kwa sala na maine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">nawakomwe kwa manyonge yakutisa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">Nenigale makala mbago vileke yawakump'hukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">na nyoka zina usungu ziwalume.<verse eid="DEU 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 32:25" />Nk'hondo neiwakome mwe zisila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">wogohi noutendese mwe zikaya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">Wana kilume na wa kike nawakomwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">Hokusigale mwana hegu mdala.<verse eid="DEU 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 32:26" />Nehaunga niwabanangeni pele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:26">vileke mnt'hu yeyose ase kuwakumbukilani naho,<verse eid="DEU 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 32:27" />mna hiungile wank'hondo wenyu wakeduvye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">wagambe, ni suwe kiwakomile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">hiyo Zumbe ayatendile aya.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 32:28" />“Izilaeli ni isi ya want'hu heweina ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:28">want'hu wakwe waswesa mizungu.<verse eid="DEU 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 32:29" />Wandile na mizungu hegu nawadimanya idi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:29">hegu nawamanya ivo uheelo wawe nounde.<verse eid="DEU 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 32:30" />Mnt'hu yumwenga adaha vivihi kuwahuma want'hu alufu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">hegu want'hu waidi kuwahuma want'hu milongo alufu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">Mnungu ywo udahi kawaonela chevu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">Ni kwaviya Zumbe ywawe kawaleka.”<verse eid="DEU 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 32:31" />Hata wank'hondo wawe wamanya kugamba milungu yawe misokezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:31">hiyo midahi enga Mnungu ywa Izilaeli.<verse eid="DEU 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 32:32" />Wank'hondo wawe ni enga mizabibu ihandigwe Sodoma na Gomola</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:32">woho ni enga mizabibu zisungu naho enga zabibu zina usungu.<verse eid="DEU 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 32:33" />Ni enga divai idamanywe kwa usungu wa nyoka.<verse eid="DEU 32:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 32:34" />“Zumbe akumbukila icho wadamanye wank'hondo wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:34">yehe agoja lupisi aikile vileke awasulumize.<verse eid="DEU 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 32:35" />Yeye naalihize na kuwasulumiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">dizuwa dyawe dyo kugwa nedize</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">dizuwa dya makunt'ho yawe dihagihi,<verse eid="DEU 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 32:36" />Miye Zumbe neniwagombele want'hu wangu hata uneva wana masa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">Neniwaonele mbazi wose wakunitegeleza na kunitimila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">heza kuona wasiilwa ni ludole.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">na kuona ivo waswesile wambizi.<verse eid="DEU 32:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 32:37" />Niho Zumbe Mnungu naawauze want'hu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:37">‘Ikuhi idya milungu yenyu mituhu midahi nomkaihuila?<verse eid="DEU 32:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 32:38" />Nomkaink'ha mavuta ye zint'hambiko zenyu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">no kuink'ha divai ya malavo yenyu yo kunywa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">Neize elo imyambizeni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">Neikombeke elo iwayokoleni.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 32:39" />“ ‘Miye nikedu ni miye Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">hakuli mnungu mtunhu ywe kindedi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">Nakoma naho nenk'hiza ugima, nalumiza naho nahonya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">naho hahali yeyose akudaha kunihiga kwa kiya hudamanya.<verse eid="DEU 32:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 32:40" />Nenula mkono wangu kwe mbingu naho nakelisa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:40">kwaviya miye nekala mazuwa yose,<verse eid="DEU 32:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 32:41" />naho neninole sime yangu ikumwekamweka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">na kuukimaila kunde na uwagilwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">neni walihize wank'hondo wangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">neni wasulumize wakuniihiya.<verse eid="DEU 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 32:42" />Misale yangu neitweke sakame yawe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">naho sime yangu neiwakome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">neijabale sakame ya wachinjigwe na watahigwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">hata walumizwe na wavugailwa nawa banike.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 32:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 32:43" />“Nyuwe want'hu wa si indeni na kinyemi hamwenga na want'hu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">kwaviya naalihize kwa wakuwakoma wadima wakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">naho naawalihize wank'hondo wakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">na kudamanya mwiivano kwe isi na want'hu wakwe.”<verse eid="DEU 32:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 32:44" />Musa na Yoshua mwana Nuni, wakemaga zimbuli zose zo ukemi, vileke Waizilaeli wose wazive.<verse eid="DEU 32:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa abindiliza kuwalagiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 32:45" />Musa eze ibinde kuwagambila want'hu wa Izilaeli mbuli izi zose, <verse eid="DEU 32:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 32:46" />awagambaga, “Mkaulise, mse kujala zisigilizi izi zose huwenk'hani dielo, vileke muwahinize wana wenyu wazive na kuzitimila. <verse eid="DEU 32:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 32:47" />Kwaviya mbuli izi hizo mbuli du heziina dyodyose, uno ni ugima wenyu. Kwa kuzitimila nomwikalise lupisi lutali mwe isi iyo mkomboka mto Yolodani, mkaitahe.”<verse eid="DEU 32:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 32:48" />Mwe dizuwa iidyo Zumbe amgambaga Musa, <verse eid="DEU 32:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 32:49" />“Ita kwe milima ya Abalimu kwe isi ya Moabu, kuhinga mzi wa Yeliko, kwela kwo mnima wa Nebo ukaisinye isi ya Kanaani huwenk'ha Waizilaeli inde yawe. <verse eid="DEU 32:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 32:50" />Noubanikile ukwo kwo mnima noukwele niyo wakelunga na want'hu wako, enga nduguyo Haluni ivo abanikile mwo mnima Holi, niyo akelunga kwa want'hu wakwe, <verse eid="DEU 32:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 32:51" />kwaviya nyose hamwandile wahuwilwa kwangu ha Waizilaeli ukwo Meliba kwa mazi, hagihi no mzi wa Kadeshi mwe dijangwa dya Sini, hamwanink'hile nt'hunyo yangu ha Waizilaeli. <verse eid="DEU 32:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 32:52" />Naivo isi iyo huwenk'ha Wazilaeli weye nouionele hale du, mna howiingile.”<verse eid="DEU 32:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="DEU 33" />
  <para style="s">Musa ayavikila Makabila ya Waizilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 33:1" />Uno nuwo uvikilo uwo Musa, mnt'hu ywa Mnungu, aulongaga kwa Waizilaeli umwo andaga akei kubanika.<verse eid="DEU 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 33:2" />Zumbe alawaga kwo Mnima wa Sinai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">atont'homokaga enga zuwa kulanga yo mnima Seili</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">awazangazilaga want'hu wakwe kulawa kwo mnima wa Palani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">Andaga hamwenga na fyo dya watumigwa wa kwe mbingu wakukile na moto ukwaka mwo mkono wakwe wa kulume.<verse eid="DEU 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 33:3" />Zumbe awaunga want'hu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">no kuwamila awakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">ivo elo chafika madi he viga vakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">no kutimila yadya akusigiila.<verse eid="DEU 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 33:4" />Musa akisigiilaga kitimile umwiko</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:4">nuwo ugoli wetu suwe want'hu wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="DEU 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 33:5" />Zumbe Mnungu kanda seuta ywa want'hu wa Waizilaeli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:5">umwo makabila yawe ne vilongozi wawe waduganaga hamwenga.<verse eid="DEU 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 33:6" />Mwe dikabila dya Lubeni Musa agambaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:6">“Lubeni asekubanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:6">Naho want'hu wakwe wase kunda wageke.”<verse eid="DEU 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 33:7" />Mwe dikabila dya Yuda, Musa agambaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">“Weye Zumbe utegeleze lukunga lwe dikabila dya Yuda wakalombeza wambizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">uwalunganye naho na makabila matuhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">Uwatowanile weye Zumbe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">Uwambize vileke wawahume wank'hondo wawe.”<verse eid="DEU 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 33:8" />Aya nayo alongaga mwe dikabila dya Lawi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">“Tumimu yako ne Ulimu yako nokumwink'ha yudya andile mhuilwa kwako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">nokumgeza uko Masa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">Niyo wahigana naye uko kwa mazi ya Meliba.<verse eid="DEU 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 33:9" />Walagisaga uhuilwa we kindedi kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">kujink'ha kwa welesi wawe na wandugu zawe na wana wawe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">Wazivaga na kuzitimila sigilizi zako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">Naho wandaga wahuilwa kwe Ndagano yako.<verse eid="DEU 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 33:10" />Nawawahinize want'hu wako kwiva malagizo yako na kuzitimila sigilizi zako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">Nawalave nt'hambiko he kilingo chako cho kulavila nt'hambiko.<verse eid="DEU 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 33:11" />Uwambize want'hu we isi yako wande na ludole.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">Welelwe mwe yadya wakudamanya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">Uvibogojole vigudi va wank'hondo wawe wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">na awo wakumwiihiya wasekwinuka naho.”<verse eid="DEU 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 33:12" />Aya nayo alongaga mwe dikabila dya Benjamini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">“Want'hu we dikabila idi nawo wakuungiswa ni Zumbe naho awamila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">Zumbe adyamila msi wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">Naho yudya Zumbe amuungise naamwiike he chaha na kumkaulisa.”<verse eid="DEU 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 33:13" />Aya nayo alongaga mwe dikabila dya Yusufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">“Zumbe aivikile isi yawe indilise na fula</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">Naho inde na nc'hoko za mazi.<verse eid="DEU 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 33:14" />Isi yawe ivikilwe kunda na matunda yaivizwe vedi ne dizuwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:14">Na matunda yedi ya kila msimo.<verse eid="DEU 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 33:15" />Na kwa vint'hu vedi ve milima ya kale na ulozo wa vigulu heviina uheelo.<verse eid="DEU 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 33:16" />Isi yakwe imeme vint'hu vose ivedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">ivikilwe nu uwedi wa Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">uyo alongaga kulawa mwa kasaka kakweelaga moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">uvikilwa uno umwiziile Yusufu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">kwaviya nakanda kilongozi mwa wanduguze.<verse eid="DEU 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 33:17" />Yusufu ana ludole enga lwa jeku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">mahembe yakwe enga ya jeku dya mbogo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">Ifulaimu naande ni ayo mahembe alufu mlongo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">Manase ana mahembe maalufu.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">Kwa mahembe ayo naazisukumizile si zose mpaka kwo uheelo we isi.<verse eid="DEU 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 33:18" />Naho mwa makabila ya Zabuloni na Isakali agambaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">“Nawande wapati mwo uchuuzi wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">Naho ugoli wa Isakali ugenyele mwa mahema yako.<verse eid="DEU 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 33:19" />Nawawalalike want'hu weze kwe milima yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">uko nawakalave nt'hambiko za uwagilwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">Kwaviya wapata ugoli wawe kulawa kwe bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">kulawa mwe sanga ya mp'wani.”<verse eid="DEU 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 33:20" />Mwe dikabila dya Gadi agambaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">“Atogolwe Mnungu uyo aikuzile mihaka ye isi yawe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">Yehe avemela enga simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">vileke afunch'e mkono no mtwi.<verse eid="DEU 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 33:21" />Nasagulaga hant'hu hana ulozo kujink'ha hose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">Upasi we vilongozi wenk'hagwa woho</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">Wevaga na kuzitimilaga sigilizi ne miko ya Zumbe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">Umwo vilongozi wa Waizilaeli waduganaga hamwenga.”<verse eid="DEU 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 33:22" />Mwe dikabila dya Dani agambaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:22">“Dani ni enga bwanga dya simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:22">Akupiilika kulawa Bashani.”<verse eid="DEU 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 33:23" />Mwe dikabila dya Nafutali agambaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">“Nafutali kamema uwedi wa Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">Isi yakwe ibula mpaka Kwa mwenye mzi ye diziwa dya Galilaya.”<verse eid="DEU 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 33:24" />Kwe dikabila dya Asheli agambaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">“Asheli avikiliswe kujink'ha wana wose wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">Naaungiswe ni wanduguze wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:24">Naho isi yakwe ilozoke mavuta ya zeituni.<verse eid="DEU 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 33:25" />Mizi yakwe ikindilwe ni nk'hili za vilama ne shaba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:25">Naho mazuwa yose ekale kwa utondowazi.”<verse eid="DEU 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 33:26" />Musa abindiliza kwa kugamba, nyuwe Izilaeli hakuli Mnungu enga Mnungu ywenyu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">Yehe alawa kwe mbingu vileke achambize</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">Naye alawa kwe mbingu no ung'azi wakwe.<verse eid="DEU 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 33:27" />Mnungu ywa mazuwa yose niye unyilikilo wenyu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">Naho ludole lwakwe ni kawiilo dyenyu hediina uheelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">awagulusaga wank'hondo wako umwo wandaga ukeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">niyo akugamba uwakome wose pele.<verse eid="DEU 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 33:28" />Ivo Waizilaeli nawekale kwa utondowazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">kwa utondowazi mwe isi imemile nk'hande na divai</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">uko umnyuzu wa kwe mbingu ukomela isanga.<verse eid="DEU 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 33:29" />Nyuwe want'hu wa Izilaeli mna kinyemi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Niani akuunga aliganywe na nyuwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">fyo kulu dya want'hu wayokolwe ni Zumbe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Zumbe niye nk'hindo yenyu naho niye isime yenyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">akuwamila na kuwenk'hani uhumi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">wank'hondo wenyu naweze wakaunga utondowazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">nanywe nomuwajatangizile.<verse eid="DEU 33:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34" />
  <para style="s">Kubanika kwa Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1" />Elo, Musa akulawaga kwe nt'hindiga ya Moabu no kuita kwo mnima wa Nebo, akwelaga kwo lunenengwa lwa Pisiga ulailo wa zuwa mwo mzi wa Yeliko. Uko nuko Zumbe Mnungu amlagisaga Musa isi yose, kulawa Gileadi mpaka Dani, <verse eid="DEU 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2" />isi yose ya Nafutali ne dijimbo dya Ifulaimu na Manase ne isi yose ya Yuda mpaka usweelo wa zuwa we Bahali ya Meditelania. <verse eid="DEU 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3" />Nyika ya Negebu ne isi yose kulawa kwe nt'hindiga ya Yeliko no mzi we miti ya mitende mpaka Zoali. <verse eid="DEU 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4" />Mnungu niyo amgamba Musa, “Ino niyo isi nalaganaga kwa Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo aho nagambaga neni ink'hize kwa welekwa wenyu. Hiunga wiione kwa meso du, mna hohuleke wiiingile.”<verse eid="DEU 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5" />Naivo Musa mndima ywa Zumbe abanikilaga kudya kwe isi ya Moabu viligane na ivo Zumbe agambile nevinde. <verse eid="DEU 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6" />Zumbe Mnungu ammoselaga msanga mwe dikolongo dya Moabu hagihi na Beti Peoli, mna hahali aho kili kikuta cha Musa hata ivi dielo. <verse eid="DEU 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7" />Musa abanikaga akanda na miaka gana na milongo miidi. Hamwenga na ludole mwo mwili wakwe halwa hungukaga aho meso yakwe yandaga yakaona vedi. <verse eid="DEU 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8" />Waizilaeli wamhongezelaga Musa mwe isi ya Moabu kwa mazuwa milongo mitatu.<verse eid="DEU 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9" />Naho Yoshua mwana Nuni andilisaga na muye ywe mizungu, kwaviya Musa amwiikaga kunda mndima hant'hu ha yehe. Ivo Waizilaeli wamwivaga no kutimila icho alongaga naye azitozaga zisigilizi za Zumbe izo azilavaga kwombokela kwa Musa.<verse eid="DEU 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 34:10" />Kukongela aho, mwe Izilaeli hakwalailaga naho mlotezi mtuhu enga Musa alongaga na Zumbe meso kwa meso. <verse eid="DEU 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 34:11" />Hakuli mlotezi mtuhu adamanyaga mitu na va kweheela enga idya Zumbe amwink'haga Musa aidamanye amhume seuta ywa Misili, wandima wakwe na isi yakwe yose. <verse eid="DEU 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 34:12" />Hakwandile na mtuhu andaga na udahi wa kudamanya mbuli nk'hulu naho za kutisa enga izo adamanye Musa ha Waizilaeli.<verse eid="DEU 34:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34" />
</usx>